&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gather and validate weekly timesheet data from a large network of freelancers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and maintain reporting templates, adapting them as requirements change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gather and analyse data for internal and client-facing reports.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create accurate, timely cost estimates for clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Logistics and Coordination&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide logistics and planning support for large-scale localisation events, coordinating between internal teams and external stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with Client&#39;s events team to organise travel and accommodation for attendees, making sure bookings meet current policy, budget and security requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Network Operations and Administration&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Onboard new network members, including account creation, access management and troubleshooting support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support financial administration by validating and processing network POs and working with internal finance teams to resolve invoicing queries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a point of contact for Client&#39;s vendor accounts, liaising with vendors on event planning and account management, and resolving account or access issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain documentation, floor plans and team databases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support other day-to-day operational tasks as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
