&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Established in 2004, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;OLIVER&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; is the world’s first and only specialist in designing, building, and running bespoke in-house agencies and marketing ecosystems for brands. We partner with over 300 clients in 40+ countries and counting. Our unique model drives creativity and efficiency, allowing us to deliver tailored solutions that resonate deeply with audiences.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;As a part of &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;The Brandtech Group&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;, we&#39;re at the forefront of leveraging cutting-edge AI technology to revolutionise how we create and deliver work. Our &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;AI solutions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; enhance efficiency, spark creativity, and drive insightful decision-making, empowering our teams to produce innovative and impactful results.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Role: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Account Director (&lt;strong&gt;6 Month FTC)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Location: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;London/ Slough, United Kingdom&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; (2-3 days a week from our Client&#39;s Slough Offices)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;About the role:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;As Account Director, working within our client, &amp;amp; global FMCG business; you are the trusted day-to-day partner for client and the person who keeps complex, multi-platform projects on track. You&#39;ll work closely with strategy, creative, production and account colleagues to turn briefs into effective campaigns, with a strong focus on social media and digital content. You&#39;ll be accountable for delivery, client satisfaction and project profitability across several projects at once.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What you will be doing:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a collaborative, trusted relationship with client stakeholders, acting as their first point of contact and protecting the brand across every project.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay close to the client to understand their needs, anticipate issues and resolve them early.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be accountable for integrated creative projects from brief to fulfilment, maintaining client satisfaction throughout.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with strategy and account colleagues to shape social strategy and milestones for the client.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Agree campaign scope with the client, then produce estimates and timing plans in our internal scheduling system, including for complex, cross-platform social projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Schedule projects against the right internal resource and help source external resource where needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with digital, video, photography and print producers to bring the right skills together for integrated campaigns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep projects on process, on time and on budget, motivating and coordinating teams through tight deadlines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be responsible for the financial health of your projects, including profitability, forecasting accuracy and fee discussions. Make sure everyone understands the cost impact of delays, extra amends and re-briefs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Report on project income accurately and on time, and escalate invoicing or estimate queries to senior account and business leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate project results, both qualitative and quantitative, against the original objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide internal stakeholders through production processes, and spot and act on ad hoc opportunities as they arise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What you need to be great in this role:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing digital and integrated campaigns in a creative or production agency, with a strong record of delivering across multiple platforms, particularly social media.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ideally FMCG experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient to expert capability in Account Management and Project Management, with confidence running several complex projects at once.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working alongside video and photography producers as part of a joined-up approach to campaign delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with project scheduling and sourcing resource and production services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong client engagement skills, with the ability to organise, influence and build effective working relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear, courteous communication across strategy, creative, production and client teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Close attention to detail, sound commercial awareness and a sharp eye for project risk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort integrating with a client-side team while maintaining a top-tier agency service.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Nice to have: experience creating content for CMS and e-commerce platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced use of Gen AI tools relevant to account management to improve output quality and efficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing AI-assisted workflows for yourself and your team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Agentic thinking for complex, multi-step challenges&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of AI capabilities and limitations, with rigorous human oversight&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
