&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Nebius:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nebius is leading a new era in cloud infrastructure for the global AI economy. We are building a full-stack AI cloud platform that supports developers and enterprises from data and model training through to production deployment, without the cost and complexity of building large in-house AI/ML infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Built by engineers, for engineers. From large-scale GPU orchestration to inference optimization, we own the hard problems across compute, storage, networking and applied AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Listed on Nasdaq (NBIS) and headquartered in Amsterdam, we have a global footprint with R&amp;amp;D hubs across Europe, the UK, North America and Israel. Our team of 1,500+ includes hundreds of engineers with deep expertise across hardware, software and AI R&amp;amp;D.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;The role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;JDC Warehouse Specialist&lt;br&gt;Position Overview&lt;br&gt;The Warehouse Specialist runs day-to-day warehouse operations at a Nebius data center site. The role receives, stores and issues high-value hardware (GPU racks, servers, network equipment, spare parts), keeps stock and asset records accurate, and provides equipment to data center engineers on time.&lt;br&gt;The specialist is the site&#39;s hands-on link to the wider logistics function: Transportation and Transport Coordination for arrivals and pickups, Logistics Planning and 3PL Planning for schedules, Back Office for system records, and the Project Office for new processes and tools.&lt;br&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;br&gt;1. Receiving &amp;amp; Dispatch&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Receive inbound shipments per the delivery schedule; check seals, packaging and contents against ASN, packing list and PO.&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Record damage and discrepancies with photos on arrival and hand them to Transport Coordination for insurance cases.&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Prepare outbound shipments and RMA returns: picking, packing, labelling, documents; hand over to carriers at the agreed pickup time.&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Follow handling standards for heavy, fragile and high-value equipment.&lt;br&gt;2. Provisioning to Data Center Operations&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Issue equipment and spare parts to DC engineers on time, according to requests and project priorities.&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Stage and kit hardware for rack deployments as agreed with ITDC and Project Managers.&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Keep a clear view of what is available on site and flag shortages to the Team Lead and Logistics Planning.&lt;br&gt;3. Inventory &amp;amp; Asset Control&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Post receipts, issues and transfers in ERP/WMS on the same day as the physical movement.&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Create inventory and asset records for received equipment, including serial numbers.&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Carry out cycle counts and annual stock takes; investigate and report discrepancies to Back Office.&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Keep the warehouse tidy, labelled and organized by location.&lt;br&gt;4. Security, Safety &amp;amp; Compliance&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Follow site security procedures for deliveries, access control and storage of high-value items.&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Apply safety rules for handling equipment and operating material handling equipment.&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Keep records complete and audit-ready (SOX, internal and external audits).&lt;br&gt;5. Process &amp;amp; Continuous Improvement&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Work according to global SOPs and site-specific instructions.&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Suggest improvements and report recurring issues to the Team Lead and the Project Office.&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Take part in pilots and rollouts of new processes and tools (WMS/TMS, automations) at the site.&lt;br&gt;6. Local Expertise&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Provide site-specific knowledge (access rules, dock limits, local carriers and customs specifics) to Transport, Planning and 3PL teams.&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Identify local operational risks and propose practical mitigation.&lt;br&gt;7. Add-on Roles (when assigned)&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;+ RMA: own RMA flows at the site — intake, documentation, return shipment, status tracking.&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;+ Key User (IRG / NetSuite / Project44): first-line support and training for colleagues on the system, test changes, collect feedback for the Project Office.&lt;br&gt;Expectations&lt;br&gt;Autonomy: Independently runs daily warehouse tasks at the site within SOPs; escalates discrepancies, damage and security issues to the Team Lead.&lt;br&gt;Impact: Keeps DC engineers supplied with the right hardware on time and keeps site stock accurate.&lt;br&gt;Communication: Clear, timely updates to the Team Lead, DC engineers and logistics teams.&lt;br&gt;Travel: Occasional support to other sites during launches or peaks.&lt;br&gt;Work Mode: On site; remote work not expected.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits &amp;amp; Perks:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive compensation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Career growth and learning opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexibility and ownership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative and innovative culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity to work on impactful AI projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;International environment and talented teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What&#39;s it like to work at Nebius:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fast moving&amp;nbsp;- Bold thinking&amp;nbsp;- Constant growth&amp;nbsp;- Meaningful impact&amp;nbsp;- Trust and real ownership&amp;nbsp;- Opportunity to shape the future of AI&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nebius is an equal opportunity employer. We are committed to fostering an inclusive and diverse workplace and to providing equal employment opportunities in all aspects of employment. We do not discriminate on the basis of race, color, religion, sex (including pregnancy), national origin, ancestry, age, disability, genetic information, marital status, veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by applicable law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Applicants must be authorized to work in the country in which they apply and will be required to provide proof of employment eligibility as a condition of hire.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you need accommodations during the application process, please let us know.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in Netherlands on Arbeitnow

&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;Do you own an LG or Panasonic Smart TV? You could get paid to test streaming apps from home!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Testlio&lt;/strong&gt; is a global software testing company that helps leading brands improve their apps and digital experiences. We work with a worldwide community of freelance testers who get paid to test real products, identify issues, and help companies deliver better experiences to their users.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re currently expanding our testing community in the Netherlands for upcoming Smart TV streaming projects!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&#39;re looking for people with:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;LG Smart TVs:&lt;/strong&gt; Older models (2015-2017) or newer models (2022-2024).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Panasonic Smart TVs:&lt;/strong&gt; Models that use Panasonic&#39;s own Smart TV system (My Home Screen), rather than Android TV or Google TV.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What would you do?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;You&#39;ll test a streaming application directly on your Smart TV, checking features such as:&lt;br&gt;• Browsing and searching for content&lt;br&gt;• Live TV and on-demand video playback&lt;br&gt;• App navigation and functionality&lt;br&gt;• Overall user experience and language accuracy&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;📍 &lt;strong&gt;Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Currently living in the Netherlands&lt;br&gt;• Physical access to one of the TVs listed above&lt;br&gt;• Comfortable following testing instructions and reporting issues&lt;br&gt;• Dutch proficiency preferred&lt;br&gt;• Previous software testing experience is a plus!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What can you expect?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Paid freelance testing opportunities&lt;br&gt;• Work remotely using your own Smart TV&lt;br&gt;• Potential projects every 2-4 weeks&lt;br&gt;• Approximately 3-4 hours per testing session&lt;br&gt;• Flexible, project-based assignments&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Know someone in the Netherlands with one of these TVs? Tag them or share this opportunity!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-REMOTE&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in Netherlands on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Burson, part of WPP, is the global communications leader built to create value for clients through reputation. With highly specialized teams, industry-leading technologies and breakthrough creative, we help brands and businesses redefine reputation as a competitive advantage so they can lead today and into the future. When you work at Burson, you are part of a global community of lifelong learners who thrive at the edge of innovation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP (LSE/NYSE: WPP) is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. We unite cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, world-class creativity, next-generation production, transformative enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel in a single company – powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform, WPP Open, to help our clients navigate change, capture opportunity and deliver transformational growth. For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;WPP.com&quot;&gt;WPP.com&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bursonglobal.com/&quot;&gt;bursonglobal.com&lt;/a&gt; and follow us on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/burson/posts/?feedView=all&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt; and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/burson.global/?hl=en&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stage Public Affairs bij Burson&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wil jij ervaring opdoen op het snijvlak van politiek, media, bestuur en bedrijfsleven?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Burson staat voor strategie en communicatie, met adviseurs die door opdrachtgevers worden ingeschakeld als het er echt om gaat. Met ons ervaren team van specialisten opereren we op hoog strategisch niveau en helpen we bedrijven en organisaties door de meest complexe situaties: van het versterken of beschermen van reputaties tot het inspelen op veranderende wetgeving, het agenderen van politieke thema’s, het begeleiden van fusies en overnames, productintroducties of crisiscommunicatie. We zijn onderdeel van Burson Group, een internationaal communicatiebureau bestaande uit een groot netwerk met meer dan 95 kantoren in ruim 40 landen. Samen maken wij onderdeel uit van WPP: het grootste marketing- en communicatiebedrijf ter wereld. Sinds 2019 zijn wij onder één dak gevestigd op onze Amsteldok-campus in Amsterdam. Daarnaast hebben wij in Nederland ook een kantoor in Den Haag.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Public Affairs bij Burson is veel meer dan lobbyen op het Binnenhof. In de huidige mediacratie wordt beleid steeds vaker beïnvloed door publieke opinie en politieke sentimenten. Hierdoor verschuift de macht: niet alleen overheid en markt bepalen de agenda, maar ook de samenleving zelf. &amp;nbsp;Onze adviseurs helpen organisaties om in te spelen op deze dynamiek: maatschappelijke trends signaleren, draagvlak creëren bij uiteenlopende stakeholders, en strategieën ontwikkelen die zowel politiek als publiek overtuigen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Als geïntegreerd communicatieadviesbureau weten wij hoe we Public Affairs versterken met slimme PR en gerichte communicatie, zodat we de juiste doelgroep bereiken, op het juiste moment, via het juiste kanaal, met de juiste boodschap. Daardoor richten ons op het beïnvloeden van relevante stakeholders via een breed scala aan kanalen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Burson stelt jaarlijks per 1 februari en 1 september een Public Affairs stage beschikbaar aan een talentvolle student.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wat ga je doen?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Als stagiair Public Affairs werk je mee aan diverse projecten en ondersteun je onze adviseurs. Je maakt kennis met veel aspecten van het werk binnen een Public Affairs kantoor en krijgt een uniek kijkje achter de schermen van de politieke arena. Je leert hoe organisaties hun belangen behartigen richting politiek, overheid en media. Kortom: een veelzijdige stage op het raakvlak van politiek, bestuur, media en bedrijfsleven.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Je werkzaamheden bestaan onder andere uit:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Monitoren van nieuws en politiek:&lt;/strong&gt;dagelijks kranten, vakbladen en opinietijdschriften scannen op relevant nieuws voor onze klanten.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Volgen van parlementaire agenda’s:&lt;/strong&gt;bijhouden van vergaderingen en debatten in de Tweede en Eerste Kamer, relevante Kamerstukken signaleren en samenvatten.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Verslaglegging&lt;/strong&gt;:&amp;nbsp;live en achteraf rapporteren over politieke debatten en griffieverslagen verzamelen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Research en analyse&lt;/strong&gt;:&amp;nbsp;informatie verzamelen via databanken en analyses maken voor onze adviseurs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholdermapping&lt;/strong&gt;:&amp;nbsp;relevante politieke en ambtelijke contacten in kaart brengen en up-to-date houden.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ondersteuning bij diverse klantprojecten&lt;/strong&gt;:&amp;nbsp;bijdragen aan presentaties, pitches en strategische adviezen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wie ben jij?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je volgt een HBO- of universitaire opleiding, bijvoorbeeld Politicologie, Bestuurskunde, Geschiedenis, Europese Studies of Internationale Betrekkingen (en staat ingeschreven tijdens de stageperiode).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je hebt een grote interesse in en kennis van de Nederlandse politiek en maatschappelijke vraagstukken.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je bent proactief, nieuwsgierig en analytisch sterk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je kunt complexe informatie helder analyseren en samenvatten en hebt een vlotte pen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je beheerst de Nederlands en Engels taal, zowel mondeling als schriftelijk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je kunt goed omgaan met deadlines en werkt nauwkeurig, ook onder druk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je bent minimaal vier dagen per week beschikbaar in de periode van 1 februari tot en met 30 juni.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wat bieden wij&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tijdens je stage ontvang je een maandelijkse stagevergoeding van €650 (gebaseerd op een volledige werkweek) en word je begeleid door twee collega’s. Elke maand heb je een coachingsgesprek over je eigen ambities en wensen. Halverwege je stage is er een tussentijds feedbackgesprek waarin genoeg ruimte is om aan te geven wat je nog meer uit je stage wil halen. Daarnaast kun je altijd terecht bij andere Young Professionals, consultants en senior-adviseurs met vragen. Tenslotte worden je reiskosten vergoed en is het mogelijk om zo nu en dan eens vanuit huis te werken.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solliciteren&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Heb je interesse? Stuur dan uiterlijk 30 november je cv en motivatiebrief in via onderstaande link of naar:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;E: -----
&lt;p&gt;Joost Reede, T: 06 – 34 55 50 18,&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You belong at Burson:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our vision is for Burson to be the leading ‘academy company’ for creative communications professionals and emerging leaders. We provide a dynamic environment where ambitious colleagues come to elevate their skills, expand their networks, and ultimately, produce the best solutions for today’s leading brands. Our commitment to your growth is reflected in our robust benefits and people programs, which include professional development opportunities, mentorship programs with industry leaders, a vibrant and inclusive company culture fostering collaboration and innovation and packages designed to reward and retain top talent. We invest in our people because we believe their success is our success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Burson, we’re an agency of learn-it-alls. We recognize that the things we do best, creativity and communications, require a level of nuanced understanding. That’s why it’s imperative for us to hire extraordinarily talented people of all backgrounds and identities. Without that we can’t do the essential work of inspiring bold ideas, fostering constructive dialogue, cultivating meaningful experiences, and driving innovation and creativity for our partners. Your unique point of view—your talent—is what makes you a #BursonPerson, and it’s how we deliver exceptional results for our clients, together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When you click the &quot;Submit Application&quot; button below, this will send any information you add below to Burson. Before you do this, we think it&#39;s a good idea to read through our &amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bursonglobal.com/p/recruitment-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy. &lt;/a&gt;California residents should read our  &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bursonglobal.com/p/california-recruitment-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;California Recruitment Privacy Notice. &lt;/a&gt;This explains what we do with your personal data when you apply for a role with us, and, how you can update the information you have provided us with or how to remove it.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Burson, part of WPP, is the global communications leader built to create value for clients through reputation. With highly specialized teams, industry-leading technologies and breakthrough creative, we help brands and businesses redefine reputation as a competitive advantage so they can lead today and into the future. When you work at Burson, you are part of a global community of lifelong learners who thrive at the edge of innovation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP (LSE/NYSE: WPP) is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. We unite cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, world-class creativity, next-generation production, transformative enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel in a single company – powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform, WPP Open, to help our clients navigate change, capture opportunity and deliver transformational growth. For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;WPP.com&quot;&gt;WPP.com&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bursonglobal.com/&quot;&gt;bursonglobal.com&lt;/a&gt; and follow us on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/burson/posts/?feedView=all&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt; and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/burson.global/?hl=en&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hoe versterken we de reputatie van één van de grootste werkgevers van Nederland? Welke influencers schakelen we in bij een lancering van een nieuw product? Hoe zorgen we dat de onze klant goed in de media komt? Als jouw hart sneller gaat kloppen van deze vragen, dan zijn wij op zoek naar jou!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wat ga je doen?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;Stage lopen bij Burson betekent dat je meteen veel verantwoordelijkheden krijgt. Als stagiair maak je écht onderdeel uit van ons team en word je zoveel mogelijk betrokken bij verschillende activiteiten.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Je werkt nauw samen met je collega’s aan opdrachten voor merken zoals SharkNinja, Jaguar Land Rover en Procter &amp;amp; Gamble (o.a. Gillette, Always en Olay). Afhankelijk van de klanten in jouw portfolio ondersteun je bijvoorbeeld bij andere inhoudelijke taken als het verzamelen van relevante informatie, het maken van media-, concurrentie- of stakeholderanalyses, het meedenken over de invulling van nieuwe social media- of influencer-campagnes en het creëren van content voor verschillende kanalen. Er wordt hard gewerkt in de diverse klantteams, maar de werksfeer is open, informeel en eigen initiatief wordt zeer gewaardeerd!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wie zijn wij? &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Burson staat voor strategie en communicatie, met adviseurs die door opdrachtgevers worden ingeschakeld als het er echt om gaat. Wij helpen bedrijven en organisaties in de meest uiteenlopende en vaak uitdagende omstandigheden, waarbij wij ze adviseren in hun transities en transformaties. Met het creëren van stakeholderacceptatie als doel. Nooit om de status quo te beschermen, niet om op elke hype in te gaan, maar om ze met een gegronde strategie toekomstbestendig te maken.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Onze adviseurs zijn met hun brede ervaring, vakmanschap en integriteit erkende boardroompartners. Onafhankelijk en kritisch zetten zij de discussie met onze opdrachtgevers op scherp. Burson heeft jarenlange ervaring in het adviseren van bedrijven in complexe situaties, onder meer op het gebied van strategie, stakeholdermanagement en geloofwaardige communicatie.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We zijn onderdeel van Burson Group, een internationaal communicatiebureau bestaande uit een groot netwerk met meer dan 95 kantoren in ruim 40 landen. Samen maken wij onderdeel uit van WPP: het grootste marketing- en communicatiebedrijf ter wereld. Sinds 2019 zijn wij onder één dak gevestigd op onze Amsteldok-campus in Amsterdam. Daarnaast hebben wij in Nederland ook een kantoor in Den Haag.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wie ben jij?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Heb jij je altijd al afgevraagd hoe het is om stage te lopen bij een internationaal communicatiebureau? Ben je goed op de hoogte van het laatste nieuws? Weet je je weg te vinden in de onlinewereld? Ben je communicatief vaardig, leergierig en stel je altijd de juiste vragen? Dan past deze stage perfect bij jou.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Je staat open voor nieuwe ideeën en opvattingen, bent breed geïnteresseerd en zoekt graag dingen tot op de bodem uit. Bij ons zijn studenten van alle studieachtergronden welkom die geïnteresseerd zijn in communicatie, marketing en media.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wat bieden wij?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Tijdens je stage ontvang je een maandelijkse stagevergoeding van €650 (gebaseerd op een volledige werkweek) en word je begeleid door twee collega’s. Elke maand heb je een coachingsgesprek over je eigen ambities en wensen. Halverwege je stage is er een tussentijds feedbackgesprek waarin genoeg ruimte is om aan te geven wat je nog meer uit je stage wil halen. Daarnaast kun je altijd terecht bij andere Young Professionals (trainees), consultants en senior-adviseurs met vragen. Tenslotte worden je reiskosten vergoed en is het mogelijk om op vrijdagen&amp;nbsp; vanuit huis te werken.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enthousiast?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Solliciteer dan via onderstaande link!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Je kunt solliciteren t/m 1 december. &lt;/strong&gt;De gesprekken zullen dan in de weken erna plaatsvinden. De startdatum van de stage is flexibel, maar idealiter 1 februari.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Vragen? Neem contact op met Lauren: ----- class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You belong at Burson:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our vision is for Burson to be the leading ‘academy company’ for creative communications professionals and emerging leaders. We provide a dynamic environment where ambitious colleagues come to elevate their skills, expand their networks, and ultimately, produce the best solutions for today’s leading brands. Our commitment to your growth is reflected in our robust benefits and people programs, which include professional development opportunities, mentorship programs with industry leaders, a vibrant and inclusive company culture fostering collaboration and innovation and packages designed to reward and retain top talent. We invest in our people because we believe their success is our success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Burson, we’re an agency of learn-it-alls. We recognize that the things we do best, creativity and communications, require a level of nuanced understanding. That’s why it’s imperative for us to hire extraordinarily talented people of all backgrounds and identities. Without that we can’t do the essential work of inspiring bold ideas, fostering constructive dialogue, cultivating meaningful experiences, and driving innovation and creativity for our partners. Your unique point of view—your talent—is what makes you a #BursonPerson, and it’s how we deliver exceptional results for our clients, together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When you click the &quot;Submit Application&quot; button below, this will send any information you add below to Burson. Before you do this, we think it&#39;s a good idea to read through our &amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bursonglobal.com/p/recruitment-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy. &lt;/a&gt;California residents should read our  &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bursonglobal.com/p/california-recruitment-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;California Recruitment Privacy Notice. &lt;/a&gt;This explains what we do with your personal data when you apply for a role with us, and, how you can update the information you have provided us with or how to remove it.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Our Purpose&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At SentinelOne, we are driven by a clear purpose: to give the advantage to those who secure our future. As AI reshapes how organizations build, operate, and innovate, the responsibility to protect them becomes more critical than ever. When you join SentinelOne, your work helps protect global enterprises, critical infrastructure, and the technologies shaping tomorrow. If you are motivated by meaningful challenges and want your impact to be real, measurable, and global, you will find purpose here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About Us&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SentinelOne is a company at the intersection of AI and security, pioneering a new operating model for cybersecurity. Our AI-native platform unifies protection across endpoint, cloud, identity, data, and AI systems to deliver autonomous detection and response with clarity and speed. By combining real-time analytics, intelligent automation, and a unified data foundation, we reduce noise, simplify complexity, and empower security teams to focus on what truly matters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our teams are builders, problem-solvers, and innovators committed to shaping the future of security. If you are excited to solve hard problems alongside talented, mission-driven people, we invite you to help us build a safer future for humanity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Are We Looking For?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for people who are relentlessly curious and committed to continuous learning. AI is reshaping every function across our business, and we enable every team member, regardless of role or level, to build fluency in AI tools and concepts. Those who thrive here actively seek out new solutions, experiment thoughtfully, and apply what they learn to drive better, faster, smarter outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;As a Senior Commercial Solutions Engineer, you will work with both commercial and some enterprise prospects and customers in Belgium, aligning their goals and requirements with SentinelOne&#39;s offerings across prevention, XDR, and threat hunting. You will play an instrumental role in accelerating our sales initiatives, partnering closely with the sales team to design and propose security solutions that address the unique challenges of our customers. If you are a self-starter who thrives in a high-paced environment and is energized by pitching revolutionary technology to executives and security practitioners alike, we&#39;d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;What Will You Do?&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;Primary responsibilities include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3 print:block print:space-y-1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Work closely with our sales team to design and propose security solutions that meet the unique needs of commercial and enterprise customers in Belgium, applying technical and commercial expertise to address diverse cybersecurity challenges and creatively resolve issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Lead the Proof of Concept lifecycle from delivering demos through to technical closing, demonstrating strong problem-solving and analytical skills, and provide first and second-level technical support throughout the sales cycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Develop and showcase a deep understanding of SentinelOne&#39;s products and solutions, aligning technical capabilities with customer needs and pain points, and deliver engaging security workshops and demonstrations to both technical and executive audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Collaborate with the channel, covering partner networks and engaging with selected enterprise customers, while providing valuable feedback to product management on product features and market trends.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Demonstrate objection handling and competitive positioning skills across a range of customer engagements, communicating effectively with CxO-level, technical, and non-technical stakeholders as part of the broader EMEA team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;What Skills and Knowledge Will You Bring?&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;Ideal candidates will have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3 print:block print:space-y-1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Fluency in English, Dutch or French, with 3 to 6 years of experience in pre-sales within the cybersecurity industry and a proven track record of successfully selling to large customers and managing complex, competitive sales cycles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Strong technical depth across endpoint security, XDR, and threat hunting, with good knowledge of hacking and exploitation tools and methodologies, detection evasion techniques, and notable malware and anti-malware solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Demonstrable experience speaking to both small and large audiences, with excellent presentation skills and the ability to lead business and technical presentations, demonstrations, and conversations with executives and technical practitioners alike.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;A team-focused approach, positive attitude, and the ability to work effectively both independently and as part of a larger EMEA team, with a high level of technical curiosity and a passion for emerging technologies across endpoint, mobile, and cloud.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Experience in computer forensics, security architecture, penetration testing, red teaming, or incident response is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;Why SentinelOne?&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;AI is redefining how the world operates and rewriting the rules of security in real time, and SentinelOne was built for this moment. From day one, we architected an AI-native platform designed to operate at machine speed, not as an add-on to legacy systems but as the foundation itself. If you want to build where innovation and impact move together, this is that place.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;We invest in our Sentinels with comprehensive, competitive benefits designed to support you and your family:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equity &amp;amp; Rewards&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Restricted Stock Units (RSUs)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Stock Purchase Plan (ESPP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Time Off &amp;amp; Wellbeing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive leave benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gender-neutral parental leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Insurance &amp;amp; Financial Security&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Insurance and medical allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pension scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Assistance Program (EAP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Perks &amp;amp; Flexibility&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Global home office allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mobile phone reimbursement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commuter or work-from-home allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wellness &amp;amp; Lifestyle&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wellness benefit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;SentinelOne is proud to be an Equal Employment Opportunity and Affirmative Action employer. We do not discriminate based upon race, religion, color, national origin, gender (including pregnancy, childbirth, or related medical conditions), sexual orientation, gender identity, gender expression, age, status as a protected veteran, status as an individual with a disability, or other applicable legally protected characteristics.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;SentinelOne participates in the E-Verify Program for all U.S. based roles.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;To learn more about how we use AI in our hiring process, please review our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://assets.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt53c99b43892c2378/bltca86b3b84e902400/AI-in-Hiring-SentinelOne.pdf&quot;&gt;AI in Hiring Candidate Disclosure&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in Netherlands on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Building&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Honeycomb is a service for the near and present future, defining observability and raising expectations of what developer tools can do! We’re working with well known companies like HelloFresh, Slack, LaunchDarkly, and Vanguard and more across a range of industries. This is an exciting time in our trajectory, we’ve closed Series D funding, scaled past the 200-person mark, and were named to Forbes’ America’s Best Startups of 2022 and 2023!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;If you want to see what we’ve been up to, please check out these &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.honeycomb.io/blog&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;blog posts&lt;/a&gt; and Honeycomb.io &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.honeycomb.io/category/press-releases&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;press releases&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;We come for the impact, and stay for the culture! We’re a talented, opinionated, passionate, fiercely inclusive, and responsible group of bees. We have conviction and we strive to live&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;postings-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.honeycomb.io/about/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;our values&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;every day. We want our people to do what they truly love amongst a team of highly talented (but humble) peers.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How We Work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;We are a fully distributed company, which means we believe it is not where you sit, but how you deliver that matters most. We invest in our people and care about how you orient to our culture and processes. At the same time we imbue a lot of trust, autonomy, and accountability from Day 1. #LI-Remote&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A little more about the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Honeycomb partnerships team creates pipeline and revenue with our strategic partners, and we’re hiring our first leader in EMEA. Most of our spend is on AWS, so Amazon is the first and most important partner for this role. You’ll also work with our software partners (like Anthropic and Checkly) and our services and channel partners. You’ll be the local presence for Honeycomb in market, working daily with our EMEA sales and marketing teams. You’ll shape the in-field EMEA strategy and execution, with room to decide where we invest. You won’t be starting from scratch, because integrations and programs are already in place. As the partner business grows, there will be room to build a team in EMEA.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do in the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the Honeycomb and AWS relationship in EMEA, working with AWS teams from the first meeting through deal close.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be the partner expert for EMEA sellers. Join pipeline reviews and rep 1:1s, and bring ideas that find new deals or move existing ones faster.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and run co-sell and co-marketing programs with software, services and channel partners to create and convert pipeline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead channel field enablement and field events with strategic partners, including AWS workshops and partner sponsorships at our events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review the software integrations we’ve already built and find European partners where joint selling could grow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define EMEA partnership priorities, including where to invest and where not to.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build executive relationships with partners in the EMEA market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track partner-sourced and partner-influenced pipeline in Salesforce, and report on progress toward pipeline and revenue goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring to the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on AWS experience, selling with or partnering with AWS, ideally from a sales role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A business development or partnership background, with a record of creating pipeline through partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with sales and marketing teams to hit GTM and quota goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing and executing strategy with internal and external C-suite teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to work on your own across time zones, make decisions and manage ambiguity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong point of view on how Honeycomb adds value to our partners’ customers, and how they add value to ours.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to see what partners need, such as more consumption or new customers, and build programs around it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Observability experience, or experience at a partner in the observability space (nice to have).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;On Target Earnings (OTE) based on level of experience (Base + Commission)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;£149,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;£175,000 GBP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Base Salary based on level of experience&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;£127,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;£149,000 GBP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll get when you join the Hive:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A stake in our success - generous equity with employee-friendly stock program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;It’s not about how strong of a negotiator you are - our pay is based on transparent levels relative to experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Time to recharge with unlimited PTO&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A distributed-first mindset and culture (really!)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home office, co-working, and internet stipend&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Full benefits coverage for employees, with additional coverage available for dependents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Up to 16 weeks of paid parental leave, regardless of path to parenthood&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Annual development allowance&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;And much more...&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please note we cannot currently sponsor or support visa transfers at this time. &lt;/strong&gt;Additionally, in compliance with applicable law, all persons hired will be required to verify identity and eligibility to work.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Phishing and Recruitment Scam Warning:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;We take your security seriously. Please be aware that recruitment scams are increasingly common and scammers may create email addresses or websites to impersonate Honeycomb employees. To help protect you:&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;All communications will come from an ----- email address
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We occasionally work with external recruiting agencies. These partners will use legitimate business email addresses—&lt;strong data-start=&quot;512&quot; data-end=&quot;559&quot;&gt;never personal accounts like Gmail or Yahoo&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our recruiting process will &lt;strong data-start=&quot;592&quot; data-end=&quot;601&quot;&gt;never&lt;/strong&gt; ask you to provide financial or sensitive personal information, including but not limited to:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Social security or tax identification numbers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Credit card numbers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bank account information&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity &amp;amp; Accommodations:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;We&#39;re committed to building a diverse, inclusive, and equitable workplace—where people of all backgrounds, identities, experiences, and abilities are welcomed, valued, and supported. We recognize that there is no single path to success and embrace nontraditional career journeys and diverse perspectives as key to building stronger, more innovative teams.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;We strive to ensure an inclusive experience throughout every stage of our hiring process and are happy to provide reasonable accommodations as needed. If you require accommodations or accessible formats at any point during our hiring process, please let your recruiter know.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;As an equal opportunity employer our hiring process is designed to put you at ease and help you show your best work. If there’s anything we can do to improve your experience, we’re always open to feedback.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy Notice:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;If you apply for a job at Honeycomb and your application is unsuccessful (or you withdraw from the process or decline our offer), Honeycomb will retain your information after your application for a period of time in accordance with local laws. We retain this information for various reasons, including in case we face a legal challenge in respect of a recruitment decision, to consider you for other current or future jobs at Honeycomb, and to help us better understand, analyze and improve our recruitment processes.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;For more information regarding our privacy practices please see the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.honeycomb.io/privacy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Honeycomb Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;If you do not want us to retain your information, or want us to update it, please contact&amp;nbsp;&lt;a ----- ----- Please note, however, that we may retain some information if required by law or as necessary to protect ourselves from legal claims.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT QUINCE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Quince is a destination for builders, creators, innovators, and operators who want to come together and challenge the status quo. Our mission is simple: make really high quality essentials for really low prices, fairly and sustainably. We deliver on that mission through a unique manufacturer-to-consumer (M2C) model eliminating the layers of traditional retail that add cost and result in consumers paying more than they need to. We find, build relationships with, and work directly with the manufacturing partners behind some of the world’s finest products. From there, our teams design smart, efficient operational processes&amp;nbsp; and build and deploy proprietary technology, AI, and analytics to help us scale fast.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What began with a small assortment of elevated basics has quickly grown into a cross-category brand spanning apparel, accessories, home goods, and more. Today, tens of millions of people across a growing number of countries come – and return – to Quince because they trust us to deliver.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;OUR CULTURE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Quince is a culture built for builders by builders. Our way of working starts with a blank sheet of paper. We question conventional thinking, use technology and data to uncover new opportunities, and move quickly to turn ideas into reality. We aren’t interested in replicating how others do retail. We’re building a better way – at a speed and scale unlike anything that’s been done before.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We dream big and chase the hard problems others shy away from. Rejecting long-held assumptions is part of our company&#39;s DNA.&amp;nbsp; Where conventional wisdom says you have to choose – soft or durable, speed or rigor, quality or price – we ask why that trade-off has to exist in the first place.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our pace is fast and the bar is high because our customers expect a lot from us and we refuse to let them down. We believe the best results come from challenging ourselves, learning from one another, and building on each other&#39;s strengths.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Here, responsibility is not determined by role, tenure, or seniority. Every team member - no matter their level - has the opportunity to drive our business and shape our trajectory.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re someone who likes to imagine new possibilities and build better systems rather than plug-in to outdated ones, Quince is the place for you.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2290&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6a0d0d38-3057-4834-9012-12f09f19e465&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fabric-text-color-mark&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-text-custom-color=&quot;#0747a6&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;THE ROLE&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Returns, Quality and Fraud team is seeking a highly independent, detail-oriented and proactive Senior Fraud Operations Coordinator to own fraud operations for Quince Europe. As the sole member of the Fraud team based in Europe, you will be the primary owner of all inbound fraud, chargeback, security and privacy activity for the region, working across every fraud system and tool to identify, investigate and resolve customer fraud. The ideal candidate is exceptionally organized, solution-driven and self-directed, with the judgment to make sound decisions and move work forward without day-to-day oversight from a manager or coworkers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The candidate should thrive in a fast-paced, continuously evolving environment and be able to independently prioritize across live order monitoring, chargeback management, escalations and prevention initiatives. Because the majority of the team operates in US time zones, this person must be an outstanding communicator: proactively sharing updates, documenting decisions, escalating risks at the right time, and partnering across multiple teams and systems to synthesize data into clear narratives about customer behavior that drive effective resolutions and measurable fraud savings.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2663&quot; data-local-id=&quot;e0c03b8d-8a8f-42ae-b3e9-26b5a2308ae6&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fabric-text-color-mark&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-text-custom-color=&quot;#0747a6&quot;&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Regional Ownership &amp;amp; Independent Operation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the end-to-end owner and single point of contact for all fraud inbound for Quince Europe, including fraud, security and privacy inboxes, escalations, chargebacks and active order monitoring queues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operate independently across all fraud systems, payment processors and internal tools, making day-to-day decisions without reliance on real-time manager or peer support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and manage your own workflows, queues and prioritization to consistently meet SLAs as the sole regional resource&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide structured, asynchronous updates to US-based leadership and partners (e.g., daily/weekly summaries, escalation logs, KPI reporting), with clear hand-offs across time zones&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exercise sound judgment on when to act independently and when to escalate, documenting rationale for key decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify regional gaps in tooling, process or coverage and proactively propose and implement solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fraud Investigations &amp;amp; Escalations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead investigations into customer fraud activity across European markets, including credit card chargeback requests and suspicious activity escalations from Service, Auditing, Security, Privacy and other partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Triage and resolve fraud, security and privacy inbox requests within 24 hours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct account-level deep dives to identify linked behaviors, repeat offenders and coordinated abuse&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a strong steward of the Quince brand, balancing fraud prevention with customer experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Chargeback &amp;amp; Dispute Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage daily chargeback processing for Quince Europe across Stripe, Braintree, PayPal and any regional payment processors or methods&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure all disputes are responded to and actioned a minimum of 14 calendar days prior to due dates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Optimize representment documentation to improve dispute win rates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify root causes driving chargebacks and recommend preventative controls&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Active Order Monitoring &amp;amp; Asset Protection&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct real-time review of high-risk and high-dollar transactions prior to fulfillment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Investigate suspicious purchases across vulnerable categories such as gift cards, jewelry, 3P vendor products (e.g., Therabody, coffee makers) and gold bars&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee order cancellations when fraud thresholds are met&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate shipment interception and asset recovery efforts with European carriers and fulfillment partners when necessary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track performance metrics including approval rates, cancellation rates, fraud loss prevented and recovery outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fraud Detection, Reporting &amp;amp; Legal Follow-Up&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify trends of abuse and systemic vulnerabilities across delivery, returns, gift card purchasing, referral programs and high-value SKUs, including patterns specific to European markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Analytics to develop robust reporting that streamlines insights and accelerates fraud detection and prevention efforts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extrapolate case-level findings into broader fraud themes and prevention strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Legal to determine customer recourse strategy, including account closures, recovery actions and escalation frameworks, in line with applicable European regulations (e.g., GDPR, PSD2/SCA)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track savings and impact measurement tied to fraud prevention initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional &amp;amp; Operational Support&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with CX, Payments, Security, Product, Legal, Analytics and third-party vendors, both in Europe and the US, to strengthen fraud controls&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track and lead key operational projects for the region, including savings measurement and process optimization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and maintain European SOPs and documentation standards across fraud workflows, ensuring processes are well-documented and aligned with global standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide flexible support for emerging initiatives and priorities that fall outside of standard responsibilities as the business scales&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2753&quot; data-local-id=&quot;9ae6a13b-2175-4a37-a4c2-5839b2f592ae&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fabric-text-color-mark&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-text-custom-color=&quot;#0747a6&quot;&gt;Qualifications&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of experience in fraud operations, payments risk, chargeback management or trust &amp;amp; safety, ideally in e-commerce&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of working autonomously, ideally as a sole or remote team member supporting a globally distributed organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with payment processors and dispute platforms (e.g., Stripe, Braintree, PayPal) and fraud tooling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of European payments and data privacy regulations (e.g., GDPR, PSD2/SCA, 3DS)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional written and verbal communication skills, with the ability to deliver clear, concise asynchronous updates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly organized, with strong prioritization and time management across multiple queues and deadlines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills; comfortable working with data to identify trends and quantify impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Additional European language(s) a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2753&quot; data-local-id=&quot;9ae6a13b-2175-4a37-a4c2-5839b2f592ae&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3319&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;WHY QUINCE?&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3352&quot;&gt;Joining Quince means being part of a mission-driven team reshaping retail. You will work alongside talented colleagues, tackle meaningful challenges, and contribute to building a more sustainable, accessible future for customers and partners alike.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3604&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;EQUAL OPPORTUNITY &amp;amp; HIRING INTEGRITY&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3662&quot;&gt;Quince provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applications for employment and prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran or military status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state, or local laws.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4074&quot;&gt;Quince is committed to providing reasonable accommodations to qualified individuals with disabilities. If you need a reasonable accommodation to complete your application or to perform the essential functions of a role at Quince, please let us know by completing &lt;a href=&quot;https://forms.gle/DpJ11jHa1WbqfUWB9&quot;&gt;this accommodation form&lt;/a&gt;. We review all requests individually and will work with you to determine appropriate accommodations on a case-by-case basis.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4428&quot;&gt;Employment is contingent upon successful completion of a background check. Quince will conduct background checks in compliance with applicable federal, state, and local laws.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4604&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Security Advisory: Beware of Frauds&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4641&quot;&gt;At Quince, we&#39;re dedicated to recruiting top talent who share our drive for innovation. To safeguard candidates, Quince emphasizes legitimate recruitment practices. Initial communication is primarily via official Quince email addresses and LinkedIn; beware of deviations. Personal data and sensitive information will not be solicited during the application phase. Interviews are conducted via phone, in person, or through the approved platforms Google Meets or Zoom—never via messaging apps or other calling services. Offers are merit-based, communicated verbally, and followed up in writing. If personal information is requested to initiate the hiring process, rest assured it will be through secure and protected means.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5364&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;h4&gt;Lead Solution &amp;amp; Enterprise Architect&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: London (Hybrid) | Practice Area: Technology &amp;amp; Engineering | Type: Permanent&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead transformative architecture to redefine the future of financial services.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;The Role&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Capco, you will play a pivotal role in delivering some of our clients’ most complex and high-profile transformation programmes, drawing on your expertise in enterprise and solution architecture.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will move between hands-on solution design, collaborating closely with engineers, and articulating compelling enterprise visions to senior stakeholders. Your work will influence key technology decisions and business outcomes, leveraging approved AI-enabled tools and workflows where appropriate to enhance architectural insight, design quality and delivery efficiency.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will oversee architecture across business, data, application and technology domains, guide cross-functional teams and support the development of colleagues. You will also contribute to the growth of our Technology &amp;amp; Engineering Practice through community leadership, delivery excellence and business development, while championing responsible AI adoption, appropriate governance and human oversight in architecture decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Shape enterprise technology strategies, architecture roadmaps and governance frameworks that align technology investments with business priorities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Design complex, scalable and resilient solutions across legacy and cloud environments, applying modern distributed architecture patterns and engineering principles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead cross-functional architecture and engineering teams, promoting collaboration, delivery excellence, continuous learning and the development of colleagues.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Build trusted relationships with senior stakeholders, communicate enterprise architecture visions and influence strategic decisions while contributing to business development and commercial opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Explore and apply approved AI tools, automation and AI-enabled workflows to improve architecture analysis, design documentation and delivery efficiency, maintaining human review, appropriate governance and clear escalation pathways.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;What We’re Looking For&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Proven experience leading enterprise architecture initiatives, shaping technology strategies, roadmaps and governance across complex organisations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong solution architecture expertise across legacy and cloud environments, including at least one major cloud platform (AWS, Google Cloud or Azure).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience applying modern distributed architecture patterns, including microservices, event-driven, containerised, serverless and zero-trust architectures.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ability to build trusted senior stakeholder relationships, guide cross-functional technical teams and deliver through agile and DevOps practices, supported by recognised architecture frameworks such as TOGAF, Zachman, Domain-driven Design or NIST.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Curiosity about AI-enabled ways of working, with an understanding of how approved AI tools can support architecture activities while preserving professional judgement, security, responsible AI principles and appropriate human oversight.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Bonus Points For&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Senior-level consulting experience, ideally within financial services or other regulated industries with complex compliance, risk and security requirements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience leading pre-sales activities, proposals or bids, including commercial ownership and client engagement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience designing greenfield architectures, cloud-first enterprises or establishing and maturing enterprise architecture functions within agile delivery environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Awareness of emerging AI capabilities, including Generative AI and Agentic AI, and their potential application to enterprise architecture, engineering productivity and responsible technology transformation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Relevant professional certifications in architecture frameworks, cloud technologies or related disciplines, such as TOGAF or cloud provider certifications.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Why Join Capco&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Deliver high-impact technology solutions for Tier 1 financial institutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Work in a collaborative, flat and entrepreneurial consulting culture.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Access continuous learning, training and industry certifications.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Be part of a team shaping the future of digital financial services.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Help shape the future of digital transformation across financial services and energy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Benefits&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We offer a competitive, people-first benefits package designed to support every aspect of your life:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Core Benefits: Discretionary bonus, competitive pension, health insurance, life insurance and critical illness cover.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Mental Health: Easy access to CareFirst, Unmind, Aviva consultations and in-house first aiders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Family-Friendly: Maternity, adoption and shared parental leave, plus paid leave for sickness, pregnancy loss, fertility treatment, menopause and bereavement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Family Care: 8 complimentary backup care sessions for emergency childcare or elder care.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Holiday Flexibility: 5 weeks of annual leave with the option to buy or sell holiday days based on your needs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Continuous Learning: Your growth, your way – a minimum of 40 hours of training annually. Take your pick from workshops, certifications and e-learning. You&#39;ll also be assigned a Business Coach from Day One, offering one-on-one guidance to support your goals and accelerate your development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Healthcare Access: Convenient online GP services.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Extra Perks: Gympass (Wellhub), travel insurance, Tastecard, season ticket loans, Cycle to Work and dental insurance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Inclusion at Capco&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re committed to making our recruitment process accessible and straightforward for everyone. If you need any adjustments at any stage, just let us know – we’ll be happy to help. We value each person’s unique perspective and contribution. At Capco, we believe that being yourself is your greatest strength. Our #BeYourselfAtWork culture encourages individuality and collaboration – a mindset that shapes how we work with clients and each other every day.&lt;/p&gt;
