&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Hi, we’re Phiture — the mobile growth consultancy working with the teams behind leading apps like Adobe, Headspace, and LEGO® 👋. We’re setting the standard for growth in the brave new digital world, and we need great people to join our global team!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT TO EXPECT:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a sharp, versatile &lt;strong&gt;Senior Copywriter&lt;/strong&gt; to own copy across some of Phiture&#39;s biggest accounts, including one of Europe’s biggest mobile gaming companies, the USA’s largest retailer, a fintech that keeps families connected across borders, and a fast-growing productivity app.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll join a close-knit creative pod, working side by side with our Creative Lead, designers and Growth Consultants. Together, you&#39;ll &lt;strong&gt;turn briefs, audience insights and testing hypotheses into conversion-focused copy&lt;/strong&gt; that reaches millions of users in app stores around the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This isn&#39;t copywriting in a vacuum. You&#39;ll see how your messaging performs, learn from every test and use those insights to make the next round sharper. You&#39;ll switch between very different brands, tones and formats, often within tight character limits and on deadlines tied to larger experiments. It&#39;s a role for a writer who cares as much about why copy works as how it sounds, and who wants to grow into ASO, experimentation and creative strategy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL DO:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own copy delivery across your assigned accounts, from brief interpretation through to final QA on production and market localisation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate creative briefs, audience insights and testing hypotheses into clear, conversion-focused copy, and ask the right questions when context or objectives are missing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write across a range of formats, including:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;App store metadata, screenshot captions and in-app events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Promotional content, storyboards and CRM campaigns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build deep knowledge of each client&#39;s brand, products, features and audiences, understanding not just what we&#39;re promoting, but why&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Switch confidently between distinct brand voices, formats and markets, keeping each brand&#39;s identity intact while leaving room for creative testing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with designers so that copy and visuals work towards the same objective&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write English source copy that translates well, and adapt messaging for different English-speaking markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use creative testing and performance results to shape your recommendations and bring new ideas to the table&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present and explain your creative rationale in meetings, alongside the Creative Lead&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Brief, guide and review freelance copywriters when the workload calls for it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Carry client feedback, brand preferences and past learnings into every new piece of work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run copy QA and proofreading, including checking final designs for accuracy, localisation and consistency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan your own workload and capacity, flagging risks early so copy never holds up design, testing or launches&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use AI tools thoughtfully to work smarter, with the judgement to critically edit what they produce&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL NEED:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Native-level English copywriting ability, with excellent grammar, editorial skills and exceptional attention to detail&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven experience in a senior copywriting role, writing compelling digital copy across different formats and brands&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic and commercial thinking: you can find the real user benefit in a brief and explain why your copy will work, not just why it sounds good&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A strong portfolio that shows range across brand voices and clear, benefit-led messaging&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing multiple projects in a fast-paced, deadline-driven environment, with full ownership of quality, priorities and delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative mindset: you enjoy working closely with designers and strategists, and respond constructively to feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confident communication with clients and internal stakeholders at all levels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a creative or digital agency, ideally in mobile, performance or growth marketing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with ASO, SEO, UX or performance copywriting is a plus, but not essential, we&#39;ll teach you the ASO side. What matters most is strong craft, curiosity and a real interest in how ASO works beyond the copy itself&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curiosity about products, audiences and the data behind them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We encourage all qualified individuals to apply, regardless of their age, gender identity, ethnicity, sexual orientation, disability status, or religion. We celebrate diversity and are excited about building teams that represent a variety of backgrounds, perspectives, and skills. All employment decisions are based on qualifications, merit, and business needs.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

