&lt;h3&gt;Join a French Foodtech Superstar!&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At HelloFresh, we&#39;re shaking up the way people eat in France with our meal kits!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our ambition? To revolutionise our subscribers&#39; everyday lives by promoting a more sustainable way of cooking and introducing them to delicious, creative and balanced recipes. The perfect blend of technology and gastronomy, with plenty of flavour!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HelloFresh operates in more than 15 countries. France is one of our youngest markets, launched in 2019, where we&#39;ve experienced tremendous growth, establishing ourselves as the market leader. Joining our team means having a real impact within one of France&#39;s most promising scale-ups!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;How do we make all this happen? Through a talented and dynamic team, strong values rooted in kindness and diversity, and an inspiring, stimulating work environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you&#39;d like to be part of this exciting human, international and entrepreneurial adventure, come and join us!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role : What’s in the Box&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The France Marketing &amp;amp; Product Analytics team is a small team at the core of HelloFresh France&#39;s performance management. It measures marketing and product performance, keeps the underlying data reliable, and supports the Growth and Product teams with analyses that guide daily and long-term decisions. ROI and customer lifetime value (CLV) sit at the center of marketing decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The team works closely with Marketing, Product, Finance, Operations and Global Analytics (Berlin).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Senior Product Analyst divides their time equally between Product and Marketing. On the product side, they are the analytical reference for product decisions in France, working with the Culinary, Menu Planning and Strategy &amp;amp; Product Development (SPD) teams. On the marketing side, they shape growth strategy with data, weighing investment allocation and acquisition versus retention trade-offs, and explaining what drives marketing performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-cutting responsibility&lt;/strong&gt;: design and maintain internal analytical tools (scripts, dashboards, automations) that support the Culinary, Menu Planning, SPD and marketing workflows, and sponsor agentic analytics and AI tools across both areas.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do : The Recipe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product responsibilities (50%)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Product performance reporting: present regular summaries on menu performance, recipe adoption and assortment rotation to feed management reviews, with key KPIs defined and tracked.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer analytics through a product lens: analyze menu and recipe performance together with customer behavior and preferences (satisfaction, repurchase, retention by menu or recipe choice) to inform assortment decisions, and identify high-impact opportunities to feed the product strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic projects: lead the analytical and operational side of strategic projects that improve the product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Marketing responsibilities (50%)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic analyses: collaborate closely with our CMO and marketing leadership to drive strategic decisions (analyses on growth strategy, investment allocation and acquisition versus retention trade-offs).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Top line performance deep dives: investigate the root causes behind changes in marketing performance, and explain them from a customer and purchase behavior perspective (customer segmentation, discount applied, box taken, purchase behavior over time).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Management summaries: turn these deep dives into concise, top-level insights for management review.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have graduated from a top-tier engineering or business school, or hold a university degree in Data, Statistics or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have at least 4 years of experience in data analytics, business intelligence or data science, ideally in an e-commerce, FMCG or food-tech environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have advanced SQL skills; Python is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience with BI tools (Tableau preferred) and excellent command of Google Sheets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience using AI/ML tools for exploratory analysis (e.g. anomaly detection), as well as leveraging LLMs to boost analytical productivity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can turn complex analyses into clear, concise and actionable recommendations for non-technical stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are organised, rigorous and detail-oriented, with the ability to prioritise multiple topics while giving each the attention it deserves.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are proactive: you know how to ask the right questions, not just find the answers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are fluent in French and have a good command of English, both spoken and written.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bonus: You have a genuine passion for food and an interest in culinary or FMCG-related topics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A dynamic and international environment, with a strong corporate culture and DNA&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Delicious discounts on HelloFresh meal kits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A steep learning curve guaranteed!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A supportive, passionate, proactive, and dynamic French team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Central Paris offices (1st arrondissement)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee benefits (Alan Blue healthcare, transport discount, Gymlib, training budget)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our recruitment process:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;ll review your CV and cover letter. If your profile looks like a good match, we&#39;ll invite you to a series of interviews and ask you to complete a case study. We&#39;ll do our best to keep the process moving quickly, so we can hopefully welcome you to HelloFresh soon!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your first steps at HelloFresh:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When you join us, we&#39;ll put together a tailored onboarding programme to help you meet each manager and get to know how HelloFresh works. You&#39;ll also have time to get to know your team before diving into your new role!&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;FEQ327R111&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sr. Manager Field Engineering, Digital Natives &amp;amp; Emerging Enterprise France&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;The Solutions Architecture team serves as trusted advisors, helping customers identify and prioritise impactful use cases across their industries. Our team provides expert technical guidance to drive Data and AI solutions from concept to production. They act as a bridge between customers, product teams, and sales, ensuring that solutions are not only technically sound but also aligned with business objectives.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;This is a senior technical and strategic role focused on designing, developing, and implementing technology solutions tailored for digital native companies—businesses born in the digital era, often leveraging cloud, APIs, and modern data platforms. This leader not only understands data solutions but also focuses on growing and developing a team of Solution Architects who drive the adoption of the Databricks Platform at the largest, fastest-growing tech companies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical Leadership:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide customers through competitive landscapes, best practices, and implementation strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide technical leadership to help customers understand how Databricks can solve their business problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team Leadership &amp;amp; Mentorship:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, build, and mentor a high-performing team of solution architects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive exceptional customer outcomes demonstrated by production applications and increased adoption of APIs and platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop technical champions within customer organizations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer Engagement &amp;amp; Strategy:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with sales teams to develop account strategies and align on plans that help our customers to achieve their business goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead technical win strategies and support technical account management for strategic customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage with end-user and developer communities to understand needs and tailor solutions accordingly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience &amp;amp; Skills:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience (often 5+ years) in infrastructure architecture, database architecture, networking, and IT development or consulting within software or internet industries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of digital native business models and their technology and business requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to navigate complex technical environments and communicate effectively with both technical and business stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be successful in this role if you:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of experience in the data space with a technical product (i.e. data warehousing, big data, cloud infrastructure, or machine learning)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have 5+ years of experience building and leading technical customer-facing teams: hiring, onboarding, and supporting team members in a high growth environment&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have strong communication skills with excellent presentation and negotiation skills, both in-person and written.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have experience in pre-sales activities, such as solution design and business value selling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Inspiring a team vision about the unique nature of the digital natives business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A history of execution by managing workloads and consumption with sales, product, and engineering counterparts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience owning C-level alignment in accounts to guide strategic decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Note: Location for this role is Paris, France&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Databricks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Databricks is the Data and AI company. More than 20,000 organizations worldwide — including adidas, AT&amp;amp;T, Bayer, Block, Mastercard, Rivian, Unilever, and 70% of the Fortune 500 — rely on the Databricks Data + AI Platform to build and scale data and AI apps, analytics and agents. Headquartered in San Francisco with 30+ offices around the globe, Databricks offers a unified platform that includes Genie, Lakebase, Agent Bricks, Lakeflow, Lakehouse, and Unity Catalog. To learn more, follow Databricks on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/databricks&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://x.com/databricks&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/@Databricks&quot;&gt;YouTube&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/databricksinc/?hl=en&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;At Databricks, we strive to provide comprehensive benefits and perks that meet the needs of all of our employees. For specific details on the benefits offered in your region click &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/154un3e8Xav4BceOSlcYFZRGEuQI54xMxVydRwQn54eQ/edit?usp=sharing&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Databricks, we are committed to fostering a diverse and inclusive culture where everyone can excel. We take great care to ensure that our hiring practices are inclusive and meet equal employment opportunity standards. Individuals looking for employment at Databricks are considered without regard to age, color, disability, ethnicity, family or marital status, gender identity or expression, language, national origin, physical and mental ability, political affiliation, race, religion, sexual orientation, socio-economic status, veteran status, and other protected characteristics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compliance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If access to export-controlled technology or source code is required for performance of job duties, it is within Employer&#39;s discretion whether to apply for a U.S. government license for such positions, and Employer may decline to proceed with an applicant on this basis alone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Engineer - FDE (Forward Deployed Engineer)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Req ID: CSQ427R334&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We welcome remote applicants located near our offices. Preferred locations: Paris, France. Remote location for candidates to be based in the France region only (not remote from any other country)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The AI Forward Deployed Engineering (AI FDE) team is a highly specialised customer-facing AI team at Databricks. We deliver professional services engagements to help our customers build and productionize first-of-its-kind AI applications. We work cross-functionally to shape long-term strategic priorities and initiatives alongside engineering, product, and developer relations, as well as support internal subject matter expert (SME) teams. We view our team as an ensemble: we look for individuals with strong, unique specialisations to improve the overall strength of the team. This team is the right fit for you if you love working with customers, teammates, and fueling your curiosity for the latest trends in GenAI, LLMOps, and ML more broadly.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting to: Senior Manager - AI FDE, EMEA&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The impact you will have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop cutting-edge GenAI solutions, incorporating the latest techniques from &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.databricks.com/blog/category/databricks-ai?categories=databricks-ai%2Cai-research%2Cai-engineering&quot;&gt;Databricks AI research&lt;/a&gt; to solve customer problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own production rollouts of consumer and internally facing GenAI applications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a trusted technical advisor to customers across a variety of domains&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present at conferences such as Data + AI Summit, recognized as a thought leader internally and externally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate cross-functionally with the product and engineering teams to influence priorities and shape the product roadmap&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we look for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Min 4 years&#39; experience&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building GenAI applications, including RAG, multi-agent systems, Text2SQL, fine-tuning, etc., with tools such as HuggingFace, LangChain, and DSPy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in deploying production-grade GenAI applications, including evaluation and optimisations&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive years of hands-on industry data science experience, leveraging common machine learning and data science tools, i.e. pandas, scikit-learn, PyTorch, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building production-grade machine learning deployments on AWS, Azure, or GCP&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Graduate degree in a quantitative discipline (Computer Science, Engineering, Statistics, Operations Research, etc.) or equivalent practical experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience communicating and/or teaching technical concepts to non-technical and technical audiences alike&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for collaboration, life-long learning, and driving business value through AI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Preferred] Experience using the Databricks Intelligence Platform and Apache Spark™ to process large-scale distributed datasets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willing to travel once every 4-8 weeks to see customers (as needed)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Databricks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Databricks is the Data and AI company. More than 20,000 organizations worldwide — including adidas, AT&amp;amp;T, Bayer, Block, Mastercard, Rivian, Unilever, and 70% of the Fortune 500 — rely on the Databricks Data + AI Platform to build and scale data and AI apps, analytics and agents. Headquartered in San Francisco with 30+ offices around the globe, Databricks offers a unified platform that includes Genie, Lakebase, Agent Bricks, Lakeflow, Lakehouse, and Unity Catalog. To learn more, follow Databricks on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/databricks&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://x.com/databricks&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/@Databricks&quot;&gt;YouTube&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/databricksinc/?hl=en&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;At Databricks, we strive to provide comprehensive benefits and perks that meet the needs of all of our employees. For specific details on the benefits offered in your region click &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/154un3e8Xav4BceOSlcYFZRGEuQI54xMxVydRwQn54eQ/edit?usp=sharing&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Databricks, we are committed to fostering a diverse and inclusive culture where everyone can excel. We take great care to ensure that our hiring practices are inclusive and meet equal employment opportunity standards. Individuals looking for employment at Databricks are considered without regard to age, color, disability, ethnicity, family or marital status, gender identity or expression, language, national origin, physical and mental ability, political affiliation, race, religion, sexual orientation, socio-economic status, veteran status, and other protected characteristics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compliance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If access to export-controlled technology or source code is required for performance of job duties, it is within Employer&#39;s discretion whether to apply for a U.S. government license for such positions, and Employer may decline to proceed with an applicant on this basis alone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;For clarity and accessibility, we have chosen not to use gender-neutral or inclusive writing conventions in our communications. WPP Media is firmly committed to diversity: we value inclusion and equality, considering all candidates regardless of gender identity, ethnic origin, or religion. All our positions are also open to people with disabilities.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;WPP is a creative transformation company. We use the power of creativity to build a better future for our people, our planet, our clients, and our communities. For more information, visit &lt;a id=&quot;OWA519da216-b9bf-0b2e-cb31-6bf014a89cd1&quot; class=&quot;fui-Link ___1q1shib f2hkw1w f3rmtva f1ewtqcl fyind8e f1k6fduh f1w7gpdv fk6fouc fjoy568 figsok6 f1s184ao f1mk8lai fnbmjn9 f1o700av f13mvf36 f1cmlufx f9n3di6 f1ids18y f1tx3yz7 f1deo86v f1eh06m1 f1iescvh fhgqx19 f1olyrje f1p93eir f1nev41a f1h8hb77 f1lqvz6u f10aw75t fsle3fq f17ae5zn OWAAutoLink&quot; href=&quot;https://wpp.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;wpp.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s global media network. In a world where media is omnipresent, we bring together the best platform, the best talent, and the best partners to develop the most innovative solutions, delivering unparalleled growth for our clients. For more information, visit &lt;a id=&quot;OWA26449dfe-1f3a-ebd7-2fa0-f1458cc16da5&quot; class=&quot;fui-Link ___1q1shib f2hkw1w f3rmtva f1ewtqcl fyind8e f1k6fduh f1w7gpdv fk6fouc fjoy568 figsok6 f1s184ao f1mk8lai fnbmjn9 f1o700av f13mvf36 f1cmlufx f9n3di6 f1ids18y f1tx3yz7 f1deo86v f1eh06m1 f1iescvh fhgqx19 f1olyrje f1p93eir f1nev41a f1h8hb77 f1lqvz6u f10aw75t fsle3fq f17ae5zn OWAAutoLink&quot; href=&quot;https://wppmedia.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;At WPP Media, we believe in the power of our culture and our people. It is through this synergy that we deliver truly exceptional experiences, for both our clients and our internal teams. To succeed in this role, it is crucial to embody the core values that unite WPP and WPP Media:&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be Extraordinary&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;by fostering collective leadership that inspires truly transformative creativity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Create an Open environment&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;by finding the perfect balance between the fulfillment of our people and the satisfaction of our clients, all built on mutual trust.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead with Optimism&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;by actively stimulating growth and development to mobilize our entire organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;L’Oréal International Distribution (LID) is one of our flagship global media accounts, delivering full-funnel media planning and activation across 30+ markets in Europe, MENA, and Sub-Saharan Africa. Spanning five iconic L’Oréal divisions—Luxe, Consumer Products Division (CPD), L’Oréal Dermatological Beauty (LDB), Professional Products Division (PPD), and Dragon—the account is entering an ambitious growth phase, expanded scope across Amazon Ads and CPD, and fast-growing African markets.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;To sit directly alongside the client leadership, the core planning function is relocating from London to Paris.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;As Implementation Planning Director, you will be the operational anchor and strategic owner of every media plan across all five divisions. You will not simply inherit a structure—you will build, shape, and lead the new Paris-based planning hub while orchestrating scaled activation via our offshore specialist desks in Delhi.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;1. End-to-End Planning Ownership &amp;amp; Delivery&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Master the Account Plan:&lt;/span&gt; Own end-to-end media implementation planning across all 30 markets and 5 divisions, ensuring plans translate overarching brand strategy into flawless execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Lead Annual &amp;amp; Quarterly Prioritisation:&lt;/span&gt; Drive the critical January client prioritisation and Tier 1 campaign slot allocations, establishing clear campaign tiering, budgets, and SLAs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Orchestrate Channel Specialists:&lt;/span&gt; Steer briefs and execution across digital, offline, and emerging channels, working in lockstep with the &lt;span&gt;Amazon Ads Director&lt;/span&gt;, Delhi offshore activation hubs (Programmatic, Social, Amazon Search), and central strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Quality Assurance &amp;amp; Rigour:&lt;/span&gt; Safeguard delivery standards through high-stakes periods, ensuring flawless in-market execution, budget pacing, and post-campaign reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;2. Client Partnership &amp;amp; Stakeholder Management&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Senior Client Counsel: Partner daily with key client leaders to provide trusted, proactive planning consultation.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Expectation &amp;amp; Scope Management:&lt;/span&gt; Own client relationships up to Procurement and Marketing Director levels. Confidently establish boundaries, negotiate priorities, and align expectations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Close Internal Partnership: Collaborate daily on-site with the&amp;nbsp;Client Leadership in Paris to maintain unified agency leadership and client health.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;3. Team Leadership &amp;amp; Hub Building&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Build &amp;amp; Scale the Paris Hub: Lead the onboarding, and mentoring of incoming Paris-based Planning Managers, setting team culture and best-in-class planning workflows.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Offshore Hub Integration: Establish efficient, collaborative, and accountable working rhythms with our specialist activation leads in Delhi.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;4. Cross-Functional Integration &amp;amp; Commercial Stewardship&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Holistic Solutions:&lt;/span&gt; Bridge implementation planning with Strategy, Commerce, Analytics, and Finance to deliver connected consumer journeys and commercial value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Financial Governance:&lt;/span&gt; Oversee accurate budget tracking, variance management, and financial reconciliations across multi-currency, multi-market plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Are Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Non-Negotiable Requirements&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;8+ years of media planning experience&lt;/span&gt; within a leading media agency, with at least &lt;span&gt;3+ years leading multi-market / international accounts&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;End-to-End Planning Mastery:&lt;/span&gt; Proven track record running the entire lifecycle: brief deconstruction, multi-channel architecture, offshore/specialist briefing, client sign-off, QA, and advanced reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Senior Client Ownership:&lt;/span&gt; Demonstrated authority managing and holding boundaries with Marketing Directors, Division Heads, and Procurement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Prioritisation &amp;amp; Backbone:&lt;/span&gt; High level of planning judgement—comfortable deciding which campaigns warrant senior attention and clearly communicating trade-offs to senior clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Team Leadership:&lt;/span&gt; Experience managing planners/associate directors and leading through structural change or hub transitions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Languages &amp;amp; Location:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span&gt;Fluent English&lt;/span&gt; is mandatory. Must be currently &lt;span&gt;based in Paris or actively relocating&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Preferred &amp;amp; Functional Skills&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Bilingual English / French:&lt;/span&gt; A significant asset given daily proximity to the Paris-based client team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Channel Breadth:&lt;/span&gt; Strong literacy across Digital Performance, Brand Media, Offline/Local channels, and &lt;span&gt;Amazon Ads / Retail Media&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Category Familiarity:&lt;/span&gt; Experience in Beauty, FMCG, or Luxury is advantageous, though proven multi-market operational rigour is our primary criterion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Shape, Don&#39;t Just Inherit:&lt;/span&gt; You are architecting a new Paris hub from the ground up on one of the world&#39;s most prestigious beauty accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Scale &amp;amp; Momentum: Work with a rapidly expanding media budget across 30 dynamic markets spanning Europe, the Middle East, and Sub-Saharan Africa.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Senior Visibility:&lt;/span&gt; Direct proximity to global client decision-makers combined with the backing of scaled, mature offshore execution teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at WPP Media and its Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Our commitment to shaping the future of media is manifested by active support for the professional development of our talents, helping them reach their full potential. This approach is accompanied by a responsible vision in our media investment strategies, thus reflecting our dual priority: valuing our employees while adopting sustainable practices in our sector. WPP Media employees have privileged access to WPP Media&#39;s and WPP&#39;s international networks, allowing them to develop their passions, expand their professional network, and stay at the forefront of innovations in marketing and advertising.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;We have vast and varied resources available to our employees; our company actively cultivates the inclusion of talents from all backgrounds. The successes and expertise of the teams are regularly highlighted during unifying events that also punctuate key moments of the year, thus strengthening our collaborative and diverse corporate culture.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our benefits include:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Remote work:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;up to 2 days per week and 2 full weeks to be taken twice a year.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Two additional days off offered&lt;/strong&gt;, including Whit Monday.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Additional leave days&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;based on seniority in 5-year increments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5 additional remote work days per month&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;for employees suffering from endometriosis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Disability policy:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;3 paid authorized absence days per year, access to Chèques Emploi Service Universel (CESU), and specific support for employees with a RQTH (Recognition of Disabled Worker Status).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solidarity missions&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;possible via the &quot;We care and we act&quot; program.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recruitment Process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interview with the recruitment team:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;A first phone or video conference interview with a member of our recruitment team to review your background, discuss your experience with European campaign management and analytics, and address your questions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational interview:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;An interview with the Luxury Client Team lead to assess your technical, analytical, and management skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Case study:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;A practical case study focused on cross-media campaign analysis and strategy within the European market, followed by a debriefing session.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;div&gt;We are committed to making this process as fast and efficient as possible, and to maintaining open and transparent communication throughout.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;em&gt;WPP Media guarantees equal opportunities and considers all candidates without discrimination or consideration of particular characteristics. We are committed to cultivating an environment of respect where everyone feels at home and benefits from the same opportunities for professional development.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;em&gt;Consult our privacy policy to learn all about the protection of your data. Although we review all applications received, we only contact those selected for an interview.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;#LI-PROMOTED&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MailCompose&quot;&gt;For clarity and accessibility, we have chosen not to use gender-neutral or inclusive writing conventions in our communications. WPP Media is firmly committed to diversity: we value inclusion and equality, considering all candidates regardless of gender identity, ethnic origin, or religion. All our positions are also open to people with disabilities.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MailCompose&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;WPP is a creative transformation company. We use the power of creativity to build a better future for our people, our planet, our clients, and our communities. For more information, visit &lt;a id=&quot;OWA4cae95f2-3748-509e-e140-4a089ebde078&quot; class=&quot;fui-Link ___1q1shib f2hkw1w f3rmtva f1ewtqcl fyind8e f1k6fduh f1w7gpdv fk6fouc fjoy568 figsok6 f1s184ao f1mk8lai fnbmjn9 f1o700av f13mvf36 f1cmlufx f9n3di6 f1ids18y f1tx3yz7 f1deo86v f1eh06m1 f1iescvh fhgqx19 f1olyrje f1p93eir f1nev41a f1h8hb77 f1lqvz6u f10aw75t fsle3fq f17ae5zn OWAAutoLink&quot; href=&quot;https://wpp.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;wpp.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s global media network. In a world where media is omnipresent, we bring together the best platform, the best talent, and the best partners to develop the most innovative solutions, delivering unparalleled growth for our clients. For more information, visit &lt;a id=&quot;OWAbd053592-c3b9-7eb3-0211-ce9fc11d9c6f&quot; class=&quot;fui-Link ___1q1shib f2hkw1w f3rmtva f1ewtqcl fyind8e f1k6fduh f1w7gpdv fk6fouc fjoy568 figsok6 f1s184ao f1mk8lai fnbmjn9 f1o700av f13mvf36 f1cmlufx f9n3di6 f1ids18y f1tx3yz7 f1deo86v f1eh06m1 f1iescvh fhgqx19 f1olyrje f1p93eir f1nev41a f1h8hb77 f1lqvz6u f10aw75t fsle3fq f17ae5zn OWAAutoLink&quot; href=&quot;https://wppmedia.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;At WPP Media, we believe in the power of our culture and our people. It is through this synergy that we deliver truly exceptional experiences, for both our clients and our internal teams. To succeed in this role, it is crucial to embody the core values that unite WPP and WPP Media:&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be Extraordinary&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;by fostering collective leadership that inspires truly transformative creativity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Create an Open environment&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;by finding the perfect balance between the fulfillment of our people and the satisfaction of our clients, all built on mutual trust.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead with Optimism&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;by actively stimulating growth and development to mobilize our entire organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;L’Oréal International Distribution (LID) is a premier global media planning and activation account spanning 30+ markets across Europe, MENA, and Sub-Saharan Africa. In 2027, the account is relocating its core planning engine from London to Paris to work in direct, daily proximity with client leadership.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Within this transformed setup, we are hiring an Implementation Planning Associate Director to lead the Luxe division (Lifestyle &amp;amp; Couture). This is the largest and most prestigious portfolio on the account, driving seven of the agency&#39;s nine biggest annual brand launches—including iconic houses such as Mugler, Azzaro, Maison Margiela, Ralph Lauren, and YSL Beauty.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Sitting in Paris at the client’s table, you will own Luxe planning end-to-end, mentor incoming Planning Managers, and direct our specialized offshore activation desks in Delhi to deliver flawless, high-impact campaigns.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;1. Strategic Media Planning &amp;amp; &quot;Big-Bet&quot; Launch Delivery&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Own the Luxe Media Blueprint:&lt;/span&gt; Architect, review, and sign off full-funnel media plans across 30 markets, ensuring channel mix, audience segmentation, budget allocation, and phasing match L&#39;Oréal&#39;s distinct campaign grading tiers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Lead Flagship Product Launches:&lt;/span&gt; Deliver the division&#39;s &lt;span&gt;seven big-bet H1 launches&lt;/span&gt;, translating central creative ideas and brand ambitions into tailored, high-performing local market executions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Full-Funnel &amp;amp; Retail Media Synergy:&lt;/span&gt; Integrate digital and offline touchpoints seamlessly, collaborating with the &lt;span&gt;Amazon Ads Director&lt;/span&gt; and local commerce specialists to capture luxury e-commerce demand.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;2. Directing Activation &amp;amp; Operational Rigour (Delhi Hub)&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Offshore Leadership:&lt;/span&gt; Serve as the primary briefing and delivery authority for our dedicated activation desks in Delhi (Programmatic, Paid Social, and Search).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;QA &amp;amp; Execution Standards:&lt;/span&gt; Establish strict QA workflows, SLAs, and performance benchmarks to continuously reduce error rates, improve trafficking speed, and optimize live pacing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Post-Campaign Excellence:&lt;/span&gt; Ensure robust reporting, actionable insight generation, and post-campaign reviews are delivered back to brand teams on time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;3. Client Leadership &amp;amp; Partnership&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Brand Team Trusted Advisor: Act as the daily, strategic planning partner for Luxe brand directors, divisional marketing leads, and key stakeholders.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Presenting &amp;amp; Challenging:&lt;/span&gt; Lead client-facing plan presentations, expertly taking feedback, challenging assumptions with data, and setting clear parameters on feasibility and budget trade-offs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Unified Account Front: Collaborate daily with the Implementation Planning Director and &lt;strong&gt;the&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Client Leadership&amp;nbsp;in Paris to ensure consistent, premium client satisfaction.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;4. Team Management &amp;amp; Upskilling&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Line Management:&lt;/span&gt; Directly manage and develop the Paris-based &lt;span&gt;Global Planning Managers&lt;/span&gt;, training them to take autonomous ownership of Tier 2 campaigns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Cross-Agency Collaboration: Partner closely with peer Associate Director, as well as Strategy, Analytics, and local market WPP teams, to share operational best practices.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Are Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Non-Negotiable Requirements&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;5+ years of digital media planning experience&lt;/span&gt; within a media agency, with proven &lt;span&gt;multi-market / international account experience&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;End-to-End Planning Craft:&lt;/span&gt; Demonstrated ability to build sophisticated media plans from scratch: audience sizing, channel selection, cross-market budget splits, flighting, and measurement frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Advanced Data Literacy: Advanced Excel skills and comfort handling multi-currency, multi-market plans.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;People Leadership:&lt;/span&gt; Experience line-managing and developing at least one media planner or executive.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Client Command:&lt;/span&gt; High level of confidence presenting directly to brand teams, fielding unscripted questions, and negotiating plan revisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Languages &amp;amp; Location:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span&gt;Fluent English&lt;/span&gt; is mandatory. Must be currently &lt;span&gt;based in Paris or actively relocating&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Preferred &amp;amp; Functional Skills&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Category Affinity:&lt;/span&gt; Prior experience planning for &lt;span&gt;Luxury, Fragrance, Beauty, or Fashion&lt;/span&gt; brands is a strong advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Omnichannel Breadth:&lt;/span&gt; Working knowledge of retail media (Amazon Ads, e-retailers) and high-impact offline media formats.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Bilingual English / French:&lt;/span&gt; Highly beneficial for building fluid daily relationships on-site with Parisian brand managers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join This Team?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Prestige Brand Portfolio:&lt;/span&gt; Guide the media voice of globally admired couture and fragrance houses across 30 diverse markets in Europe, MENA, and Sub-Saharan Africa.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;High-Visibility Paris Seat:&lt;/span&gt; Be part of a newly minted central hub in Paris, enjoying direct client exposure while supported by scaled offshore execution desks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Build the Function:&lt;/span&gt; Work alongside a newly appointed Director to shape team culture, processes, and delivery standards from day one.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at WPP Media and its Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Our commitment to shaping the future of media is manifested by active support for the professional development of our talents, helping them reach their full potential. This approach is accompanied by a responsible vision in our media investment strategies, thus reflecting our dual priority: valuing our employees while adopting sustainable practices in our sector. WPP Media employees have privileged access to WPP Media&#39;s and WPP&#39;s international networks, allowing them to develop their passions, expand their professional network, and stay at the forefront of innovations in marketing and advertising.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;We have vast and varied resources available to our employees; our company actively cultivates the inclusion of talents from all backgrounds. The successes and expertise of the teams are regularly highlighted during unifying events that also punctuate key moments of the year, thus strengthening our collaborative and diverse corporate culture.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our benefits include:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Remote work:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;up to 2 days per week and 2 full weeks to be taken twice a year.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Two additional days off offered&lt;/strong&gt;, including Whit Monday.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Additional leave days&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;based on seniority in 5-year increments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5 additional remote work days per month&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;for employees suffering from endometriosis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Disability policy:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;3 paid authorized absence days per year, access to Chèques Emploi Service Universel (CESU), and specific support for employees with a RQTH (Recognition of Disabled Worker Status).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solidarity missions&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;possible via the &quot;We care and we act&quot; program.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recruitment Process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interview with the recruitment team:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;A first phone or video conference interview with a member of our recruitment team to review your background, discuss your experience with European campaign management and analytics, and address your questions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational interview:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;An interview with the Luxury Client Team lead to assess your technical, analytical, and management skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Case study:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;A practical case study focused on cross-media campaign analysis and strategy within the European market, followed by a debriefing session.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;div&gt;We are committed to making this process as fast and efficient as possible, and to maintaining open and transparent communication throughout.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;em&gt;WPP Media guarantees equal opportunities and considers all candidates without discrimination or consideration of particular characteristics. We are committed to cultivating an environment of respect where everyone feels at home and benefits from the same opportunities for professional development.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;em&gt;Consult our privacy policy to learn all about the protection of your data. Although we review all applications received, we only contact those selected for an interview.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;#LI-PROMOTED&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MailCompose&quot;&gt;For clarity and accessibility, we have chosen not to use gender-neutral or inclusive writing conventions in our communications. WPP Media is firmly committed to diversity: we value inclusion and equality, considering all candidates regardless of gender identity, ethnic origin, or religion. All our positions are also open to people with disabilities.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MailCompose&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;WPP is a creative transformation company. We use the power of creativity to build a better future for our people, our planet, our clients, and our communities. For more information, visit &lt;a id=&quot;OWAa8700d42-b54a-215f-412d-da8a29b6bcce&quot; class=&quot;fui-Link ___1q1shib f2hkw1w f3rmtva f1ewtqcl fyind8e f1k6fduh f1w7gpdv fk6fouc fjoy568 figsok6 f1s184ao f1mk8lai fnbmjn9 f1o700av f13mvf36 f1cmlufx f9n3di6 f1ids18y f1tx3yz7 f1deo86v f1eh06m1 f1iescvh fhgqx19 f1olyrje f1p93eir f1nev41a f1h8hb77 f1lqvz6u f10aw75t fsle3fq f17ae5zn OWAAutoLink&quot; href=&quot;https://wpp.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;wpp.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s global media network. In a world where media is omnipresent, we bring together the best platform, the best talent, and the best partners to develop the most innovative solutions, delivering unparalleled growth for our clients. For more information, visit &lt;a id=&quot;OWA6b4af54d-0fa2-ea17-0194-48c422091bbb&quot; class=&quot;fui-Link ___1q1shib f2hkw1w f3rmtva f1ewtqcl fyind8e f1k6fduh f1w7gpdv fk6fouc fjoy568 figsok6 f1s184ao f1mk8lai fnbmjn9 f1o700av f13mvf36 f1cmlufx f9n3di6 f1ids18y f1tx3yz7 f1deo86v f1eh06m1 f1iescvh fhgqx19 f1olyrje f1p93eir f1nev41a f1h8hb77 f1lqvz6u f10aw75t fsle3fq f17ae5zn OWAAutoLink&quot; href=&quot;https://wppmedia.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;At WPP Media, we believe in the power of our culture and our people. It is through this synergy that we deliver truly exceptional experiences, for both our clients and our internal teams. To succeed in this role, it is crucial to embody the core values that unite WPP and WPP Media:&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be Extraordinary&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;by fostering collective leadership that inspires truly transformative creativity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Create an Open environment&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;by finding the perfect balance between the fulfillment of our people and the satisfaction of our clients, all built on mutual trust.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead with Optimism&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;by actively stimulating growth and development to mobilize our entire organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;L’Oréal International Distribution (LID) is a premier global media planning and activation account spanning &lt;strong&gt;30+ international markets&lt;/strong&gt; and five powerhouse L’Oréal divisions: &lt;strong&gt;Luxe, Consumer Products (CPD), L’Oréal Dermatological Beauty (LDB), Professional Products (PPD), and Dragon&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;As part of the account’s relocation from London to Paris, we are building out our on-the-ground client delivery hub. We are opening &lt;strong&gt;four new Implementation Planning Manager seats&lt;/strong&gt; in Paris to form the engine room of our media operations.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;As an &lt;strong&gt;Implementation Planning Manager&lt;/strong&gt;, you are the hands-on owner of campaign delivery. Sitting under a Planning Director, you will take briefs from brand teams, build multi-market channel plans, coordinate local agency teams, and direct our specialized Delhi activation desks. Across the account’s &lt;strong&gt;c.200 annual activations&lt;/strong&gt;, you will be the driving force ensuring media launches go live accurately, on time, and on budget.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1. End-to-End Media Planning &amp;amp; Craft&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build Plans Unsupervised:&lt;/strong&gt; Translate marketing briefs into actionable, robust media plans—defining audience segments, channel mix, budget splits by market, flighting/phasing, cost benchmarks, and KPIs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tier 2 &amp;amp; Always-On Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; Take full autonomous ownership of Tier 2 product activations and always-on campaigns for your assigned division, while actively supporting your Planning Director on Tier 1 flagship &quot;big-bet&quot; launches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Budget &amp;amp; Excel Precision:&lt;/strong&gt; Master complex, multi-currency plan templates, maintaining airtight budget tracking and financial hygiene in coordination with internal Finance teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2. Activation Directing &amp;amp; Offshore QA (Delhi Hub)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Actionable Briefing:&lt;/strong&gt; Translate central plans into precise media briefs and trafficking instructions for our specialist Delhi activation desks (Paid Social, Programmatic, Amazon Search).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rigorous Quality Assurance:&lt;/strong&gt; Champion QA standards so campaigns go live right the first time; monitor delivery pacing and quickly troubleshoot optimization or tracking issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Performance Reporting:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with Analytics to build data-driven Post-Campaign Reviews, identifying actionable insights for future campaign iterations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3. Stakeholder &amp;amp; Market Coordination&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Market Orchestration:&lt;/strong&gt; Connect with local market agency teams across Europe, MENA, and Sub-Saharan Africa to obtain local media rate cards, availability, and cultural nuances, synthesizing inputs into one unified plan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client Interface:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner day-to-day with client brand managers and divisional coordinators in Paris, fielding planning queries, presenting plan options, and holding delivery timelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Are Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Non-Negotiable Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3 to 5 years of digital media planning experience&lt;/strong&gt; within a media agency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Multi-Market Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Exposure to international / multi-territory accounts, with an understanding of how to plan across differing market maturity levels and budget sizes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Independent Planning Craft:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven capability to take a client brief from scratch and build out a multi-channel plan (digital-first, with holistic channel awareness) without close supervision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Coordination:&lt;/strong&gt; Confident communicator who is comfortable following up with local markets, channel specialists, and creative stakeholders to gather missing inputs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advanced Excel Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; High proficiency in Excel&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Languages &amp;amp; Location:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Fluent English&lt;/strong&gt; is mandatory. Must be currently &lt;strong&gt;based in Paris or actively relocating&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred &amp;amp; Functional Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bilingual English / French:&lt;/strong&gt; A major advantage for daily, informal interactions with Parisian brand coordinators.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Category Affinity:&lt;/strong&gt; Prior experience planning for &lt;strong&gt;Beauty, Fragrance, FMCG, or Luxury&lt;/strong&gt; brands is a strong plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Offline &amp;amp; Retail Media Awareness:&lt;/strong&gt; Familiarity with high-impact offline touchpoints and e-commerce/retail media (e.g., Amazon Ads).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client Presentation Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Comfortable walking client brand managers through plan rationales and budget allocations independently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join This Team?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Genuine Campaign Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead end-to-end media activations across 30 diverse markets for globally recognized beauty and fragrance houses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Brand-New Paris Hub:&lt;/strong&gt; Join a newly forming team with a collaborative startup energy, supported by the stability and scale of a premier global agency account.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scale Behind You:&lt;/strong&gt; Lean on dedicated offshore activation desks for technical execution, allowing you to focus on planning craft, client consultation, and strategic optimization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fast-Track Progression:&lt;/strong&gt; Work directly under newly appointed Directors and an account Lead committed to developing internal talent into future leadership seats.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at WPP Media and its Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Our commitment to shaping the future of media is manifested by active support for the professional development of our talents, helping them reach their full potential. This approach is accompanied by a responsible vision in our media investment strategies, thus reflecting our dual priority: valuing our employees while adopting sustainable practices in our sector. WPP Media employees have privileged access to WPP Media&#39;s and WPP&#39;s international networks, allowing them to develop their passions, expand their professional network, and stay at the forefront of innovations in marketing and advertising.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;We have vast and varied resources available to our employees; our company actively cultivates the inclusion of talents from all backgrounds. The successes and expertise of the teams are regularly highlighted during unifying events that also punctuate key moments of the year, thus strengthening our collaborative and diverse corporate culture.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our benefits include:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Remote work:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;up to 2 days per week and 2 full weeks to be taken twice a year.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Two additional days off offered&lt;/strong&gt;, including Whit Monday.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Additional leave days&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;based on seniority in 5-year increments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5 additional remote work days per month&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;for employees suffering from endometriosis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Disability policy:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;3 paid authorized absence days per year, access to Chèques Emploi Service Universel (CESU), and specific support for employees with a RQTH (Recognition of Disabled Worker Status).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solidarity missions&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;possible via the &quot;We care and we act&quot; program.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recruitment Process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interview with the recruitment team:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;A first phone or video conference interview with a member of our recruitment team to review your background, discuss your experience with European campaign management and analytics, and address your questions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational interview:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;An interview with the Luxury Client Team lead to assess your technical, analytical, and management skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Case study:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;A practical case study focused on cross-media campaign analysis and strategy within the European market, followed by a debriefing session.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;div&gt;We are committed to making this process as fast and efficient as possible, and to maintaining open and transparent communication throughout.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;em&gt;WPP Media guarantees equal opportunities and considers all candidates without discrimination or consideration of particular characteristics. We are committed to cultivating an environment of respect where everyone feels at home and benefits from the same opportunities for professional development.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;em&gt;Consult our privacy policy to learn all about the protection of your data. Although we review all applications received, we only contact those selected for an interview.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;#LI-PROMOTED&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;gmail_default&quot; style=&quot;font-size: small;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Mozilla?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Mozilla Corporation is the non-profit-backed technology company that has shaped the internet for the better over the last 25 years. We make pioneering brands like Firefox, the privacy-minded web browser. Now, with more than 225 million people around the world using our products each month, we’re shaping the next 25 years of technology and helping to reclaim an internet built for people, not companies. Our work focuses on diverse areas including AI, social media, security and more. And we’re doing this while never losing our focus on our core mission – to make the internet better for people.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;The Mozilla Corporation is wholly owned by the non-profit 501(c) Mozilla Foundation. This means we aren’t beholden to any shareholders — only to our mission. Along with thousands of volunteer contributors and collaborators all over the world, Mozillians design, build and distribute &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;open-source&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; software that enables people to enjoy the internet on their terms.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About this team and role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;The Firefox team is a community of engineers who care deeply about delivering the fastest, friendliest, most usable browser possible. We are responsible for making the things you see in the browser work securely, quickly, and well! The Enterprise team is a cross-disciplinary team in charge of improving and maintaining Firefox support for large Enterprise deployments. As part of the team, you will be responsible for all things related to services and infrastructure for our Enterprise products.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A Staff Software Engineer is the next &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;level up from&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; a Senior Software Engineer. At Mozilla this role can vary, but typically a staff engineer supports an engineering team, providing technical leadership, building cross-team relationships, and helping the team deliver on their objectives.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Improve the ease of use and security of Firefox in large deployments by developing better administration and monitoring tools.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Improve Firefox functionality by better integration with remote services.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Assess what work supports the team and product roadmap and make insightful recommendations in regards to priorities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Work with a geographically-distributed development team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Bring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;8+ years of professional experience in software development.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Experience developing robust services according to modern best practices.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Strong software engineering fundamentals: modularity, abstraction, data structures, and algorithms.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Proficiency in Rust and JavaScript.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Proven understanding of database systems (SQL and/or non-relational databases).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You are an excellent communicator and have participated effectively on a distributed team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You’re pragmatic about how to move things forward in specific timeframes including trade-offs and safeguards when implementing new functionality.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Curiosity and interest in learning new things.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Commitment to our values:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Welcoming differences&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Being relationship-minded&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Practicing responsible participation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Having grit&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Front-end development experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Experience with kubernetes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Experience with OIDC/OAuth2.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You have previously successfully contributed to an open source project.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll get:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Generous performance-based bonus plans to all eligible employees - we share in our success as one team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Rich medical, dental, and vision coverage&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Generous retirement contributions with 100% immediate vesting (regardless of whether you contribute)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Quarterly all-company wellness days where everyone takes a pause together&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Country specific holidays plus a day off for your birthday&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;One-time home office stipend&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Annual professional development budget&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Quarterly well-being stipend&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Considerable paid parental leave&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Employee referral bonus program&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Other benefits (life/AD&amp;amp;D, disability, EAP, etc. - varies by country)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We value a variety of voices within our team and at Mozilla. You don&#39;t need to check every box on this list to apply.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Mozilla&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Mozilla exists to build the Internet as a public resource accessible to all because we believe that open and free is better than closed and controlled. When you work at Mozilla, you give yourself a chance to make a difference in the lives of Web users everywhere. And you give us a chance to make a difference in your life every single day. Join us to work on the Web as the platform and help create more opportunity and innovation for everyone online.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commitment to diversity, equity, inclusion, and belonging&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Mozilla understands that valuing diverse creative practices and forms of knowledge are crucial to and enrich the company’s core mission.&amp;nbsp; We encourage applications from everyone, including members of all equity-seeking communities, such as (but certainly not limited to) women, racialized and Indigenous persons, persons with disabilities, persons of all sexual orientation&lt;span style=&quot;color: #003366;&quot;&gt;s, &lt;/span&gt;gender identities, and expressions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We will ensure that qualified individuals with disabilities are provided reasonable accommodations to participate in the job application or interview process, to perform essential job functions, and to receive other benefits and privileges of employment, as appropriate. Please contact us at &lt;a class=&quot;external-link&quot; ---------- to request accommodation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer. We do not discriminate on the basis of race (including hairstyle and texture), religion (including religious grooming and dress practices), gender, gender identity, gender expression, color, national origin, pregnancy, ancestry, domestic partner status, disability, sexual orientation, age, genetic predisposition, medical condition, marital status, citizenship status, military or veteran status, or any other basis covered by applicable laws.&amp;nbsp; Mozilla will not tolerate discrimination or harassment based on any of these characteristics or any other unlawful behavior, conduct, or purpose.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Group: C&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-REMOTE&lt;/p&gt;
