&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Debug, test and profile your work, and document it so others can build on it.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
