&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Mozilla?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Mozilla Corporation is the non-profit-backed technology company that has shaped the internet for the better over the last 25 years. We make pioneering brands like Firefox, the privacy-minded web browser. Now, with more than 225 million people around the world using our products each month, we’re shaping the next 25 years of technology and helping to reclaim an internet built for people, not companies. Our work focuses on diverse areas including AI, social media, security and more. And we’re doing this while never losing our focus on our core mission – to make the internet better for people.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;The Mozilla Corporation is wholly owned by the non-profit 501(c) Mozilla Foundation. This means we aren’t beholden to any shareholders — only to our mission. Along with thousands of volunteer contributors and collaborators all over the world, Mozillians design, build and distribute &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;open-source&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; software that enables people to enjoy the internet on their terms. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About this team and role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Mozilla seeks to build a work environment that values and makes space for our employees, partners, and the broader community to bring their vast experiences to our mission - to improve the internet. Being inclusive and transparent for the betterment of humankind is at the core of our values.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A healthy and inclusive internet starts with the tools we use to access and discover the Web.&amp;nbsp; On iOS, we start by developing applications that give people a choice in their browser to experience the Web in an open, safe and healthy environment. Promoting transparency, innovation, inclusion and opportunity from every angle for mobile is at our core.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If you are an iOS Engineer and you want to work for a company that builds products for everyone, join our team!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Design, write, and maintain the code for sophisticated mobile applications on iOS, ensuring they meet our high standards for quality and user experience&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Work alongside a diverse and geographically distributed team&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Uphold our commitment to quality by conducting through code reviews, fixing bugs, and writing tests to ensure application stability and performance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Collaborate with the team in building new features that enhance user engagement and contribute to the application’s growth while working closely with Product Managers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Engage in crafting experiments to understand user interactions better and contribute ideas for product improvements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;2+ years of experience in the software engineering space&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Experience building and shipping native iOS/iPadOS applications using Swift. Strong interest in modern iOS development practices, including SwiftUI and architectural patterns like MVVM&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A passion for identifying and resolving bugs, with proficiency in code reviews, unit testing, and automation to ensure high quality, maintainable code.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Effectively operate in a distributed team setting, demonstrating excellent communication skills&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Work transparently as part of the Mozilla open-source project, interacting with Mozilla’s global community to support our mission and contribute to a healthier internet.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Commitment to our values:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Welcoming differences&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Being relationship-minded&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Practicing responsible participation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Having grit&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll get:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Generous performance-based bonus plans to all regular employees - we share in our success as one team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Rich medical, dental, and vision coverage&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Generous retirement contributions with 100% immediate vesting (regardless of whether you contribute)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Quarterly all-company wellness days where everyone takes a pause together&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Country specific holidays plus a day off for your birthday&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;One-time home office stipend&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Annual professional development budget&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Quarterly well-being stipend&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Considerable paid parental leave&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Employee referral bonus program&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Other benefits (life/AD&amp;amp;D, disability, EAP, etc. - varies by country)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Mozilla&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Mozilla exists to build the Internet as a public resource accessible to all because we believe that open and free is better than closed and controlled. When you work at Mozilla, you give yourself a chance to make a difference in the lives of Web users everywhere. And you give us a chance to make a difference in your life every single day. Join us to work on the Web as the platform and help create more opportunity and innovation for everyone online.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commitment to diversity, equity, inclusion, and belonging&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Mozilla understands that valuing diverse creative practices and forms of knowledge are crucial to and enrich the company’s core mission.&amp;nbsp; We encourage applications from everyone, including members of all equity-seeking communities, such as (but certainly not limited to) women, racialized and Indigenous persons, persons with disabilities, persons of all sexual orientation&lt;span style=&quot;color: #003366;&quot;&gt;s, &lt;/span&gt;gender identities, and expressions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We will ensure that qualified individuals with disabilities are provided reasonable accommodations to participate in the job application or interview process, to perform essential job functions, and to receive other benefits and privileges of employment, as appropriate. Please contact us at &lt;a class=&quot;external-link&quot; ---------- to request accommodation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer. We do not discriminate on the basis of race (including hairstyle and texture), religion (including religious grooming and dress practices), gender, gender identity, gender expression, color, national origin, pregnancy, ancestry, domestic partner status, disability, sexual orientation, age, genetic predisposition, medical condition, marital status, citizenship status, military or veteran status, or any other basis covered by applicable laws.&amp;nbsp; Mozilla will not tolerate discrimination or harassment based on any of these characteristics or any other unlawful behavior, conduct, or purpose.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Group: E&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-REMOTE&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Req ID: R3261&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hiring Ranges:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Remote Germany&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€57.000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€76.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Venn&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Venn is the sovereign AI platform for real estate. We turn each company’s data, knowledge and way of operating into its own Company Brain, then build bespoke applications and AI agents on top of it to grow revenue, reduce costs and improve performance. The intelligence stays the customer’s proprietary asset and compounds over time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;More than 270 owners and operators run on Venn across 30 states and five countries. Our customers include Related, Bozzuto and Kairoi Residential in the U.S. and Grand City Properties in Europe. Our platform is approaching one million homes, and our contracted revenue has more than quadrupled in the past year. Venn has raised over $140 million from investors including Group 11 and NOA, and recently acquired a16z-backed Zuma to accelerate our AI agents.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission is to make sure AI sharpens what makes a real estate company different, instead of erasing it. Come build it with us&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About the Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Venn partners with a leading German residential property company that manages a large portfolio across the country. As our Senior Technical Customer Success Manager in Berlin, you will own this strategic relationship end to end, from onboarding and implementation through long-term adoption. You are hands-on and technical: you understand the client&#39;s business and systems, and you build the automations, implementation tools and training that make the rollout succeed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be the client&#39;s primary point of contact and their voice inside Venn, working closely with our Product, Engineering, Support and Data teams. You work independently, see the big picture, and drive results without waiting for direction.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;After 12 months, success means the rollout phases are live on schedule, adoption targets are met across the client&#39;s teams, and the client sees Venn as a trusted long-term partner. [REVIEW: confirm the 12-month success measures] As Venn grows in Germany, you will have room to help build the customer success function here.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the client relationship end to end, as the primary point of contact for stakeholders from property managers to leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead onboarding and implementation on the client side together with Venn&#39;s Product and Engineering teams: timelines, stakeholders, configuration, integrations and go-lives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build automations, implementation tools and processes that make onboarding faster and repeatable&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and deliver training programs and materials, building the client&#39;s self-sufficiency on the platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive adoption across a large, distributed portfolio, including property management, customer service and back-office teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand the client&#39;s priorities and systems, and translate them into clear, prioritized requirements for Venn&#39;s Product team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Investigate technical issues with the client and work with Venn&#39;s Support and Engineering teams to resolve them [REVIEW: align with Eli on what Support covers (language, hours, location) and adjust this line]&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track and report on user engagement and value against agreed KPIs, including regular business reviews and steering meetings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Navigate German-specific requirements and stakeholders, such as data protection (GDPR) and works council processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share German market and localization insights to help shape Venn&#39;s product for Europe&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Requirements&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years in customer-facing roles in B2B SaaS, such as Customer Success, Technical CSM, Implementation or Solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical background: hands-on with integrations, APIs, data and automation or no-code tools, and comfortable troubleshooting technical issues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record leading enterprise software implementations with multiple stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Business-fluent German and English (C1 or higher), written and verbal&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Independent self-starter who takes ownership, sees the big picture and engages confidently with senior stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel regularly, within Germany and to Venn&#39;s offices abroad&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Based in Berlin and eligible to work in Germany [REVIEW (HR / Deel)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Nice to Haves&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in German residential real estate (Wohnungswirtschaft, Hausverwaltung) or with software for the property sector&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proptech, startup or scale-up experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with ERP environments such as SAP, and with CRM, support and project management tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building customer success processes or playbooks from scratch&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with international teams across time zones&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

