&nbsp;
Sheriff’s Highway Vets is looking for a passionate and confident Senior Veterinary Surgeon to join our progressive and well-established multi-site small animal practice in Tyne and Wear. This role would be suited to an experienced vet ideally with a surgical bias as well as a GDP Assessor, however we are flexible and will happily but you through the GPD Assessor course
&nbsp;
Based in Gateshead, the practice is ideally located to enjoy everything the North East has to offer. From Newcastle's vibrant city life and cultural scene to the stunning Northumberland coastline and nearby countryside, the area offers an excellent balance of urban and outdoor living.
&nbsp;
Whether you're looking for city amenities, beautiful beaches, outdoor adventures, or a lower cost of living, the region provides an exceptional quality of life.
