&nbsp;
* Established four-site small animal practice across Gateshead, Sunderland, Ryton, and Whickham
* Large clinical team of 14 Veterinary Surgeons supported by experienced nurses and support staff
* Strong collaborative culture with a focus on mentoring, teamwork, and knowledge sharing
* Modern diagnostic and surgical facilities including Doppler ultrasound, ECG, digital radiography, dental x-ray, endoscopy, laparoscopy, orthopaedic surgery suite, and in-house laboratory
* Strong support for certificate study and development of clinical interests
&nbsp;
