&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the creative transformation company. We use the power of creativity to build better futures for our people, planet, clients and communities. For more information, visit wpp.com.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP’s global media collective. In a world where media is everywhere and in everything, we bring the best platform, people, and partners together to create limitless opportunities for growth. For more information, visit wppmedia.com&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary and Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Search &amp;amp; Ecommerce Account Director to lead the strategic development, execution, and performance of integrated biddable activity across &lt;strong&gt;Google Ads (Search, Shopping, Performance Max)&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;Amazon Search&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a senior leader within the team, you will be responsible for &lt;strong&gt;defining and delivering best-in-class search and ecommerce strategies&lt;/strong&gt;, ensuring alignment with broader client business goals and full-funnel media objectives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will act as the &lt;strong&gt;senior client contact&lt;/strong&gt;, working with stakeholders at Director level and above, while leading cross-functional teams and offshore delivery hubs to execute against strategy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role combines &lt;strong&gt;deep platform expertise, strategic leadership, and operational oversight&lt;/strong&gt;, ensuring campaigns are executed to the highest standard while continuously driving innovation and growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the development of holistic Search &amp;amp; Ecommerce strategies across:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Google Ads (Search, Shopping, Performance Max)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Amazon Search (Sponsored Ads ecosystem)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure strategies are aligned to client business objectives, KPIs, and commercial priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate broader marketing strategy into channel-specific activation frameworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify growth opportunities across demand capture (Search) and retail media (Amazon)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive integration between Search, Ecommerce, and wider media channels (Paid Social, Programmatic, SEO)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop forward-thinking POVs on industry trends, platform developments, and emerging opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client and Stakeholder Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the primary senior contact for Search &amp;amp; Ecommerce across your client portfolio&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build strong relationships with senior stakeholders, becoming a trusted strategic advisor&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead client meetings, presentations, quarterly reviews, and strategic planning sessions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clearly articulate performance, insights, and forward strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to grow client investment and expand scope&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Performance and Campaign&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain ultimate accountability for performance delivery across all Search &amp;amp; Ecommerce activity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee campaign execution across Google Ads and Amazon platforms, ensuring alignment with strategy
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure robust optimisation frameworks are in place across:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bidding &amp;amp; automation (e.g., Smart Bidding, PMAX optimisation)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Feed optimisation (Shopping / Amazon)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Query, audience, and keyword strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead performance reviews, identifying risks and opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure rigorous testing frameworks are defined and executed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure all campaigns are delivered &lt;strong&gt;on time, within budget, and to the highest standards&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain strong governance across:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;QA processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Financial management and invoicing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Platform best practice adherence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive improvements in workflows, automation, and efficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure clear documentation of processes and ways of working&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead development of &lt;strong&gt;test &amp;amp; learn roadmaps&lt;/strong&gt; across Search and Ecommerce&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to leverage new platform capabilities (e.g., PMAX, AI bidding, Amazon innovations)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to agency thought leadership, case studies, and award submissions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Actively participate in the wider Search and Commerce communities within WPP Media&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Onshore–Offshore Delivery Model&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and manage ways of working between onshore strategy teams and offshore execution teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure offshore teams are set up for success with:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear briefs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Defined processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;QA frameworks and performance standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee output quality across offshore Account Managers and Executives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive scalability, efficiency, and operational excellence across delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and develop a team of Account Managers and Account Executives (onshore and offshore)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide coaching, mentorship, and performance management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure effective workload allocation, prioritisation, and delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support hiring and team growth aligned to client needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foster a high-performing, collaborative, and innovative team culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Skills &amp;amp; Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience across:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Google Ads (Search, Shopping, Performance Max)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Amazon Search / Retail Media ecosystems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of leading performance-driven search and ecommerce strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of full-funnel media strategy and cross-channel integration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced analytical skills with ability to translate data into actionable insights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing large-scale, complex accounts and budgets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong client leadership experience, including senior stakeholder management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing and developing multi-layered teams (including offshore models)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of bidding strategies, feed-based media, automation, and measurement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication and presentation skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at WPP Media &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our passion for shaping the next era of media includes investing in our employees to help them do their best work, and we&#39;re just as committed to employee growth as we are to responsible media investment. WPP Media employees can tap into the global WPP Media &amp;amp; WPP networks to pursue their passions, grow their networks, and learn at the cutting edge of marketing and advertising. We have a variety of employee resource groups and host frequent in-office events showcasing team wins, sharing thought leadership, and celebrating holidays and milestone events. Our benefits include competitive medical, group retirement plans, vision, and dental insurance, significant paid time off, preferential partner discounts, and employee mental health awareness days.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to particular characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we&#39;ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please note this is a UK based role and requires individuals to have the right to work in this location&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please read our Privacy Notice (https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy) for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;835 - Manager, Client Analytics - DTA&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the creative transformation company. We use the power of creativity to build better futures for our people, planet, clients and communities. For more information, visit wpp.com.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP’s global media collective. In a world where media is everywhere and in everything, we bring the best platform, people, and partners together to create limitless opportunities for growth. For more information, visit wppmedia.com&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At WPP Media, we believe in the power of our culture and our people. It’s what elevates us to deliver exceptional experiences for both our clients and each other. In this role it will be critical to embrace WPP &amp;amp; WPP Media’s shared core values:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be &lt;strong&gt;Extraordinary&lt;/strong&gt; by &lt;em&gt;Leading Collectively&lt;/em&gt; to &lt;em&gt;Inspire transformational Creativity.&lt;/em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create an &lt;strong&gt;Open&lt;/strong&gt; environment by&lt;em&gt; Balancing People and Client Experiences&lt;/em&gt; by &lt;em&gt;Cultivating Trust&lt;/em&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead &lt;strong&gt;Optimistically&lt;/strong&gt; by &lt;em&gt;Championing Growth&lt;/em&gt; &lt;em&gt;and Development&lt;/em&gt; to &lt;em&gt;Mobilize the Enterprise&lt;/em&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Choreograph: A Leading WPP Media Brand&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Choreograph is WPP’s global data products and technology company. We’re on a mission to transform marketing by building the fastest, most connected data platform that bridges marketing strategy to scaled activation.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We work with agencies and clients to transform the value of data by bringing together technology, data and analytics capabilities. We deliver this through the Open Media Studio, an AI-enabled media and data platform for the next era of advertising.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re endlessly curious. Our team of thinkers, builders, creators and problem solvers are over 1,000 strong, across 20 markets around the world.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary and Impact&lt;/strong&gt;  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Manager, Client Analytics reports to the Director of Analytics, working to design, customize and maintain platforms for business analytics and measurement. You would have excellent oral and written communication skills, be client obsessed, self-motivated and able to operate both as a team and independently with limited guidance and direction&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Manager, Client Analytics is following the direction of Director of Analytics and is responsible for data manipulation and visualization, performing quantitative data analysis, problem solving, statistical modeling, and developing/analysing business cases.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU WILL DO&lt;/strong&gt;  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply deep knowledge of basic statistics (significance testing, correlation analysis, confidence intervals, descriptive statistics) to support analytical solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use statistical modeling techniques (regression, classification) to extract business value from campaign data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilize programming languages (Python, R, SQL), statistical packages (SciPy), and Google tools (BigQuery, Tensorflow, Datalab) to prototype and deliver data-driven solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recommend and develop technical solutions with guidance from senior leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define project scope, setup, and effort estimation in collaboration with the account Analytics lead.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain strong relationships with Analytics leads and gain a deep understanding of client challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with key stakeholders to assess project needs and ensure delivery of best-in-class analytics work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with regional leadership on process development, improvement, and compliance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support campaign measurement, determine incremental lift from marketing activities, and manage reporting and data needs (ingestion, cleaning, delivery).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Code in SQL and Python to create reports and build dashboards; automate recurring workloads to improve efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generate meaningful insights using advanced analytics/statistical techniques; create dashboards and presentations for wider teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure continuous collaboration and progression across bands, disciplines, and offices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills and Experience&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relevant industry experience in analytics-focused roles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Degree in an applied quantitative field (data science, mathematics, statistics, engineering, economics, business management, computer science, or related).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of marketing campaigns, objectives, and measurement techniques; prior experience in digital agency or consulting preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient coding skills in statistical software (R, Python, SciPy), programming languages (SQL, Python), and MS Office tools (especially advanced Excel/Google Sheets).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in owning and delivering analytics projects, including correlation, regression, significance testing, A/B tests, and supervised machine learning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical understanding of data science techniques, statistical analysis, and modeling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for data analysis, troubleshooting data anomalies, integrating data from multiple sources to create repositories for data science models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to transform raw data into actionable business insights for decision-making and strategic planning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong logical thinking, problem-solving, and stakeholder management skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent verbal and written communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adherence to quality standards and ability to plan and prioritize work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using or building reports with business intelligence tools is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in applying big data, statistics, and analytical techniques to solve client problems is preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Business acumen to provide actionable strategic recommendations is preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at WPP Media &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our passion for shaping the next era of media includes investing in our employees to help them do their best work, and we’re just as committed to employee growth as we are to responsible media investment. WPP Media employees can tap into the global WPP Media &amp;amp; WPP networks to pursue their passions, grow their networks, and learn at the cutting edge of marketing and advertising. We have a variety of employee resource groups and host frequent in-office events showcasing team wins, sharing thought leadership, and celebrating holidays and milestone events. Our benefits include competitive medical, group retirement plans, vision, and dental insurance, significant paid time off, preferential partner discounts, and employee mental health awareness days.  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please note this is a UK based role and requires individuals to have the right to work in this location&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
