Build and maintain robust account and quarterly business plans covering pipeline, key deals, opportunities, and risks&nbsp;

Essential Requirements:


5–8 years of experience managing and growing large, complex enterprise customers
Experience in data, SaaS, or data‑driven solution environments is a strong advantage
Proven ability to sell complex solutions in regulated and governance‑heavy&nbsp;environments
Strong expertise in Finance &amp; Risk Solutions, Third Party Risk, Compliance &amp; regulatory frameworks, and risk &amp; governance topics
Extensive experience engaging with C‑level executives and positioning AI‑driven and advanced data solutions at executive and board level
Skilled in MEDDICC methodology and Challenger Sales (or comparable sales methodologies)
Strong proficiency in CRM systems (ideally Salesforce) and analytics tools
Highly autonomous, proactive, and execution‑driven (“runs independently”)
Excellent stakeholder management skills across business, technical, and executive levels
Fluency in German and English; French or Italian is a strong plus
Excellent communication and presentation skills in German and English&nbsp;


