&lt;li&gt;Hard-working and upbeat. You excel at learning on the fly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outstanding verbal communicator. You’re not only eloquent, you flex your style and tailor your approach depending on who you’re talking to.&lt;/li&gt;
