&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We unite cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, world-class creativity, next-generation production, transformative enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel in a single company – powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform, WPP Open, to help our clients navigate change, capture opportunity and deliver transformational growth.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We work with the world&#39;s most valuable brands and have global reach across 100+ markets, with deep local expertise.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our people are the key to our success. We&#39;re committed to fostering a culture of creativity, belonging and continuous learning, attracting and developing the brightest talent, and providing exciting career opportunities that help our people grow.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;https://eur02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fwpp.com%2F&amp;amp;data=05%7C02%7CErica.Durr%40wpp.com%7C9bf4566a65bc46a48ac008de749116ea%7C150b5e663d884dee83f6ed149b727a00%7C0%7C0%7C639076363668176216%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;amp;sdata=Q9juosud56XGLThSFZ1NpPZd6FXpJPxV74OeRZWoh%2B4%3D&amp;amp;reserved=0&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;WPP.com.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why we&#39;re hiring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Director of Employee Listening &amp;amp; Insights will lead WPP’s global approach to understanding and responding to employee sentiment, creating a scalable, insight-led listening ecosystem that drives visible action and sustains trust through transformation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At the heart of the role is connecting employee voice with leadership decisions and tangible employee experience outcomes. The Director will harness technology, analytics and automation to provide timely, actionable workforce insights and embed employee sentiment more deeply into decision-making across WPP.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Partnering closely with HR, People Analytics, Communications, GBS and business leaders, the role will help create a single, trusted view of workforce insights and ensure employee feedback leads to meaningful action and measurable improvements throughout Elevate28 and beyond.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employee Listening Strategy &amp;amp; Delivery&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the evolution of WPP’s global employee listening strategy, developing a clear roadmap for implementation from 2027 onwards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and embed a scalable, insight-led listening ecosystem that strengthens employee voice, drives visible action and sustains trust through transformation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review and optimise WPP’s employee listening technology landscape, leveraging technology, analytics and automation to deliver more timely and actionable insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and continuously enhance WPP’s global listening framework, including engagement surveys, pulse surveys, lifecycle surveys, exit feedback and employee advisory forums.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver monthly pulse surveys and transformation sentiment tracking across major geographies, providing leaders with timely visibility of employee sentiment and experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure listening activities are closely aligned to business priorities, transformation milestones and employee experience objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead survey governance, stakeholder engagement, vendor relationships and communications, ensuring a consistent and effective global approach.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor participation, engagement and feedback quality, identifying opportunities to strengthen employee voice and increase the impact of listening.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the broader People Experience team to identify key employee experience pain points and prioritise areas for improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with People Analytics, GBS and Technology teams to create a more connected, automated listening ecosystem and a single source of truth for workforce insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Employee Insights &amp;amp; Action&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and embed WPP’s employee insights strategy, establishing clear governance, reporting and action-planning frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate employee feedback and listening data into clear, actionable insights that strengthen the connection between employee voice, leadership decisions and employee experience outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyse data to identify emerging trends, organisational risks, opportunities and areas requiring intervention.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide executive-ready insights and recommendations for People Leadership, EMT reviews and transformation governance forums.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain dashboards that provide real-time visibility of employee sentiment, engagement and experience trends.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track key indicators including engagement, transformation sentiment, change readiness, retention risks and wellbeing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify leading indicators and early warning signals, enabling leaders to take proactive action.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with HR and business leaders to translate insights into measurable actions and track their impact over time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a data-driven culture where employee sentiment and experience are embedded into decision-making at all levels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the development of WPP’s &lt;strong&gt;“You Said, We Did”&lt;/strong&gt; communications, demonstrating how employee feedback is influencing decisions and driving tangible change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Key Measures of Success &amp;amp; Year One Deliverables&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Success in the first year will be focused on establishing a stronger, insight-led listening approach and demonstrating a clear connection between employee feedback and action. Key priorities will include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Delivering a reimagined WPP Employee Listening Strategy and roadmap for 2027.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establishing a Continuous Listening Model, including monthly pulse surveys across major geographies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Developing an Employee Insights Dashboard providing timely visibility of employee sentiment, engagement and experience trends.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Delivering the first cycle of the “You Said, We Did” programme, clearly demonstrating how employee feedback translates into action.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Driving strong listening participation and satisfaction, ensuring employees see value in sharing their feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Increasing the insight-to-action ratio, with listening insights translated into tangible and communicated actions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitoring transformation sentiment and fatigue, identifying emerging risks and enabling timely intervention.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant experience in a senior HR, Employee Experience, People Insights or Employee Listening role, with a strong track record of delivering listening programmes at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience shaping and activating employee listening and insights strategies, translating feedback into meaningful organisational change and action.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong partnership skills, with experience working across People Analytics, HR, GBS, Communications and Technology to deliver an integrated listening and insights approach.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A highly data-driven and insight-led mindset, with the ability to turn complex employee data into clear recommendations, executive-level insights and measurable improvements to the employee experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working within large, complex, global and federated organisations, balancing global consistency with local and regional needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong stakeholder management and influencing skills, with the credibility to engage senior leaders and drive action through compelling data and insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong understanding of how technology, analytics and automation can enhance employee listening, provide more timely insights and strengthen organisational decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;re open&lt;em&gt;:&lt;/em&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;We are inclusive and collaborative; we encourage the free exchange of ideas; we respect and celebrate diverse views. We are open-minded: to new ideas, new partnerships, new ways of working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;re optimistic&lt;em&gt;:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;span id=&quot;628d56ad5d8a35dab853e65d9daa237c&quot; class=&quot;editor-module-hl-green-solid&quot;&gt;We believe&lt;/span&gt; in the power of creativity, technology and talent to create brighter futures or our people, our clients and our communities. We approach all that we do with conviction: to try the new and to seek the unexpected.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;re extraordinary:&lt;/strong&gt; we are stronger together: through collaboration we achieve the amazing. We are creative leaders and pioneers of our industry; we provide extraordinary every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we&#39;ll give you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Passionate, inspired people&lt;/strong&gt; – We aim to create a culture in which people can do extraordinary work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scale and opportunity&lt;/strong&gt; – We offer the opportunity to create, influence and complete projects at a scale that is unparalleled in the industry.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Challenging and stimulating work&lt;/strong&gt; – Unique work and the opportunity to join a group of creative problem solvers. Are you up for the challenge?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(236, 240, 241);&quot;&gt;#LI-Hybrid&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WPP is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to particular characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please read our Privacy Notice (&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wpp.com/en/careers/wpp-privacy-policy-for-recruitment&quot;&gt;https://www.wpp.com/en/careers/wpp-privacy-policy-for-recruitment&lt;/a&gt;) for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;MAP | WPP Enterprise Solutions designs, builds, and operates the growth systems that competitive businesses rely on. In a world where Al is reshaping how companies drive growth, we lead clients in business transformation and marketing modernization, connecting strategy directly to execution. Our 12,000 experts in engineering and platforms, commerce, consulting, content transformation, CRM, and CX work within a unified global operating unit across 40+ markets. WPP Enterprise Solutions works alongside best-in-class partners including Adobe, AWS, Braze, Google, Microsoft, Salesforce, and Shopify, as well as innovators in AI, to deliver growth solutions tailored to the needs of our clients’ businesses.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;MAP is part of&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://urldefense.com/v3/__http:/wpp.com/__;!!IfJP2Nwhk5Z0yJ43lA!L_cfT4E3gsmmDY1lVQTB6ihlfPeBl9X4sMM2KI6iWZYexC2nCeZ9oxgP9qvgbrqxIBpx82rGb_mWqh5F0zKxq5_dP7Y$&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;5677231c-455b-4705-9250-42d6515234fb&quot;&gt;WPP&lt;/a&gt;, the trusted growth partner for the world&#39;s leading brands. Powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform WPP Open, WPP unites cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, creativity, production, enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Are you a marketing technology leader who thrives at the intersection of technology and business, capable of driving strategic initiatives and shaping the future of personalized customer experiences? Do you possess the ability to dive into the complexities of marketing platforms while effortlessly communicating their value to a room full of executives? Are you a trusted advisor, a skilled presenter, and a passionate advocate for innovation in the MarTech space, with a proven track record of leading and mentoring high-performing teams?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW228640761 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW228640761 BCX0&quot;&gt;Then you might be the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW228640761 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW228640761 BCX0&quot;&gt;Director of Solution Consulting&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW228640761 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW228640761 BCX0&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW228640761 BCX0&quot;&gt;we&#39;re&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW228640761 BCX0&quot;&gt; looking for &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW228640761 BCX0&quot;&gt;(EMEA focused)!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW228640761 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What will your day look like?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Director of Solution Consulting&lt;/strong&gt; and a key member of the Solution Consulting leadership team, you&#39;ll play a pivotal role in driving the strategic direction of our technology solutions. Reporting to the Senior Director of Solution Consulting, you&#39;ll be a trusted advisor, guiding our clients and internal stakeholders towards significant growth by deeply understanding their complex needs and crafting tailored, cutting-edge technology solutions. You will also be responsible for sharing the responsibilities currently held by the Senior Director of Solution Consulting. Our Solution Consulting team acts as the bridge between business goals and technological possibilities, translating complex requirements into clear roadmaps and innovative designs that empower our clients to thrive. You will be responsible for being a senior stakeholder who can deliver projects, stand up in front of clients, position map, steer conversations, and handle difficult conversations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your responsibilities will include:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;: Contributing to the overall strategic direction of the Solution Consulting team, aligning technology solutions with business objectives, and identifying opportunities for innovation and growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client Engagement:&lt;/strong&gt; Building and maintaining strong relationships with key client stakeholders, acting as a trusted advisor and thought leader on marketing technology trends and best practices. You will also network with our strategi partners.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solution Design &amp;amp; Implementation:&lt;/strong&gt; Overseeing the design and implementation of complex marketing technology solutions, ensuring alignment with client requirements and industry best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;New Business Development&lt;/strong&gt;: Actively participating in new business pursuits, including leading presentations, developing proposals, and contributing to RFIs and RFPs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vendor Relationships:&lt;/strong&gt; Cultivating and maintaining strong relationships with key technology vendors (Adobe, Salesforce, Braze, etc.), staying abreast of new product developments and identifying opportunities for collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Mentorship &amp;amp; Development&lt;/strong&gt;: Mentoring and developing junior members of the Solution Consulting team, fostering a culture of collaboration, innovation, and continuous learning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Presenting compelling cases and case studies at industry events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the go-to technical expert on client projects, working closely with internal teams (Technology, Data, Experience, Strategy).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a translator, transforming ambitious client goals into actionable technology strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with our growth team on pitches, RFPs, and high-level scoping.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay ahead of the curve by keeping your finger on the pulse of the latest marketing technologies and developing insightful points of view.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Who are you going to work with?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a valued member of our Solution Consulting team, you&#39;ll benefit from a supportive environment where knowledge sharing and collaboration are paramount. You will be working alongside brilliant minds who are passionate about pushing the boundaries of marketing technology. You will be working closely with the Senior Director of Solution Consulting.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll collaborate with a diverse network of experts across our global offices, spanning technology, data, experience, and client service teams. You will be a vital part of supporting all of MAP’s capabilities. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What do you bring to the table?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re seeking a highly experienced technology leader who embodies a rare combination of technical expertise, exceptional communication skills, and a drive to make a real impact.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You bring a passion for marketing technology and a genuine desire to make a difference for our clients and MAP.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a proven track record of leadership and success in a solutions consulting or related role (e.g., technical consulting or customer success management) at a senior level, with experience managing and mentoring teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You possess a strong foundation in Salesforce Marketing Cloud.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re a natural communicator with exceptional presentation skills, capable of captivating any level audience in speech, writing and PowerPoint.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience building strong relationships and managing different stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in direct new business development and business expansion.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;A leader in personalized customer experiences&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VML MAP is a world-leading Centre of Excellence that helps businesses humanize the relationship between the brand and the customer through hyper personalization at scale, marketing automation and CRM.&amp;nbsp;With the brain of a consultancy, the heart of an agency and the power of technology and data, we work with some of the world&#39;s most admired brands to help them on their transformation journey to becoming truly customer-centric.&amp;nbsp;Together, we are 1000 + technology specialists, data scientists, strategic thinkers, consultants, operations experts, and creative minds from 55+ nationalities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;A global network&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are part of the global VML network that encompasses more than 30,000 employees across 150+ offices in 60+ markets, each contributing to a culture that values connection, belonging, and the power of differences.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-EMEA&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;WPP (MAP/VML) is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;scxw176048299&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When you click “Apply now” below, your information is sent to MAP/VML. To learn more about how we process your personal data during when you apply for a role with us, on how you can update your information or have the information removed please read our&amp;nbsp;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://wt-map.com/privacy-policy&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;1be1ea03-7c74-4825-b023-8bda1dc2d911&quot;&gt;Privacy policy&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;. California residents should read our&amp;nbsp;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wundermanthompson.com/california-recruitment-privacy-notice&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;02863cf9-cae6-4a11-b7f1-4f68ba8e0816&quot;&gt;California Recruitment Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Software Engineer (Python / TypeScript / Azure)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;London, UK (On-site) | £100,000-£150,000 + pre-IPO stock options&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build the software behind some of the world’s most advanced radar systems.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;CHAOS Industries is a defense tech company founded in 2022 that has raised $1B from investors including 8VC, Accel and Valor Equity Partners. You’ll build the backend services, data pipelines and operator-facing apps that turn raw sensor data into decisions people can act on.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build high-performance Python services that ingest, process and distribute real-time sensor data with low latency, high reliability and security at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build the web apps (TypeScript and React) operators use to monitor live missions and investigate what the sensors saw&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and build secure, scalable Azure services for distributed radar systems, defining the infrastructure as code and instrumentation for what you own&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work alongside software, hardware and systems engineers, and the teams who take these systems into the field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influence architecture and help define the engineering foundations of a fast-evolving platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’re a fit if you have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building scalable backend systems and owning production services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with distributed systems and real-time data problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Real leverage from AI coding tools, with a considered view on what to delegate and what not to&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel: you’ll be based in our Soho office, and most of the team is in San Francisco, so expect to co-locate there for around a week each quarter&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Python for backend services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;TypeScript and React for web applications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Azure and infrastructure as code&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you get&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private medical, dental and vision for you and your dependents, 100% paid by the company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5% pension match&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pre-IPO stock options, relocation assistance, and annual bonuses (coming soon)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please note: &lt;/strong&gt;Right to work in the UK required.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Apply now. &lt;/strong&gt;It takes just 2 minutes.&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Network Administrator (Palo Alto / Aruba)&lt;br&gt;London (On-site) | £70,000 - £85,000&amp;nbsp;+ pre-IPO stock options&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please note: Active UK SC clearance (DV preferred), or eligibility to obtain SC.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the secure network behind a UK defence programme, from architecture through to day-to-day operations.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;CHAOS Industries is a defense technology company, founded in 2022, that has raised $1 billion from investors including 8VC, Accel and Valor Equity Partners. You’ll own the design, security and uptime of the network that supports critical national security missions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, deploy and maintain secure networks across classified and unclassified environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run Palo Alto firewalls (PAN-OS, Panorama, GlobalProtect) and Aruba switching, wireless and ClearPass&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement segmentation, zero-trust and policy enforcement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor performance, troubleshoot complex issues and support incident response&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Handle vulnerability remediation, RMF/STIG compliance and system accreditation (ATO)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’re a fit if you have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years in network administration in enterprise or DoD environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on Palo Alto experience (NGFW, Panorama, VPNs, threat prevention)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on Aruba experience (switching, wireless, ClearPass NAC)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong TCP/IP, BGP, OSPF, VLANs and VPNs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in classified environments (SIPR/NIPR or equivalent)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with RMF, NIST 800-53 and STIGs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Active UK SC clearance (DV preferred), or eligibility to obtain SC&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;PCNSE or higher&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Aruba certifications (ACMP, ACDX, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Network automation (Python, Ansible, APIs)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cloud networking (AWS GovCloud, Azure Government)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Zero Trust / SASE, Zscaler ZIA / ZPA or similar&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High-availability or mission-critical systems background&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Defence contractor or rapid-deployment experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you get&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private medical, dental and vision, 100% paid by the company for you and your dependents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5% pension match&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pre-IPO stock options, relocation assistance and annual bonuses (coming soon)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fully stocked kitchen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free daily lunch when you’re on-site&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Apply now.&lt;/strong&gt; It takes just 2 minutes.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The stated compensation range reflects only the targeted base compensation range and excludes additional earnings such as bonus, equity, and benefits. If your compensation requirements fall outside of the range, we still encourage you to apply. The salary range for this role is an estimate based on a range of compensation factors, inclusive of base salary only. Actual salary offer may vary based on (but not limited to) work experience, education and/or training, critical skills, and/or business considerations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
