&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;At Superchat, we&#39;re rebuilding how businesses talk to their customers. The phone call, the contact form, the support ticket: all of it is being replaced by messaging and AI. We&#39;re building the platform that runs underneath.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded in 2020, Superchat has become the platform of choice for &lt;strong&gt;10,000+ businesses worldwide&lt;/strong&gt;, from globally recognized brands like Allianz, Auto1, Enpal, Danone, and GASAG to the small businesses, dental practices, and one-person startups that need to look bigger than they are. Today, &lt;strong&gt;millions of messages flow through Superchat every single day&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We started as a unified inbox: one place for every channel a customer might pick, WhatsApp, email, SMS, Instagram. Then ChatGPT happened, and the second chapter began: AI agents that respond across chat, email, and voice at the quality of the best human teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re &lt;strong&gt;100 people&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;profitable&lt;/strong&gt;, and have raised &lt;strong&gt;€18M in funding&lt;/strong&gt; (last round 4.5 years ago, we&#39;ve been growing on our own money since). Headquartered in Berlin.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;As a Revenue Operations Engineeer you anchor the build end of Revenue Operations - our internal product team whose customers are the GTM functions: Sales, CS, Marketing, and Finance. You build the AI, automation, and data foundations that make these teams faster, smarter, and more scalable, owning the end-to-end delivery of internal tools, integrations, and AI-powered workflows - from problem framing and architecture through launch, adoption, and measurable business impact.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Want&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven GTM Systems Builder.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;You bring 3+ years of hands-on experience in RevOps, GTM Engineering, SalesOps, Business Systems, or a comparable B2B SaaS role, and can show production systems you personally built.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI-Native Builder.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;You&#39;ve integrated LLMs into real workflows or tools through APIs and understand how to move beyond prompting into reliable, production-ready use cases.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product-Minded Systems Thinker.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;You start with the user and business problem, map the relevant process and data dependencies, and choose the simplest scalable solution rather than defaulting to a particular tool.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Integration &amp;amp; Data Fluent.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;You&#39;re comfortable working with APIs, webhooks, JSON, authentication, data models, and the movement of data between multiple systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;End-to-End Owner.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;You can take a project from discovery and architecture through building, testing, rollout, documentation, monitoring, and ongoing improvement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pragmatic Production Engineer.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;You ship quickly without treating reliability as optional, including appropriate testing, error handling, security, observability, and documentation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business-Impact Oriented.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;You connect technical work to measurable outcomes such as pipeline, productivity, data quality, speed, cost, or customer experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Clear Cross-Functional Communicator.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;You can explain technical decisions simply, manage trade-offs, work through ambiguity, and collaborate effectively with both technical and non-technical stakeholders.&lt;br&gt;You are fluent in written and spoken English; German is a plus.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Curious &amp;amp; Self-Directed.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;You actively experiment with new technologies, learn through building, and share useful findings without chasing novelty for its own sake.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Who We Don’t Want&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;3:1-4:145;22-205&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Uses tools without hands-on depth.&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;br&gt;You&#39;ve used CRM and AI tools but lack hands-on experience building automations, configuring systems, or solving operational problems end-to-end.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;6:1-7:121;207-378&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Struggles with cross-functional GTM processes.&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;br&gt;You find it hard to understand how operational decisions ripple across the wider GTM motion and the business as a whole.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;9:1-10:111;380-530&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Weak on the technical fundamentals.&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;br&gt;You struggle with APIs, JSON, data models, authentication, debugging, or moving data reliably between systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;12:1-13:137;532-713&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Can&#39;t connect the build to the business.&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;br&gt;You can&#39;t explain technical choices clearly, manage trade-offs, influence stakeholders, or connect a build to its wider business impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;15:1-16:128;715-886&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Uses AI without shipping anything real.&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;br&gt;You use ChatGPT or Claude but can&#39;t point to an LLM-powered workflow, integration, or tool you&#39;ve personally built and shipped.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;18:1-19:169;888-1108&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Builds without thinking about what comes after.&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;br&gt;You&#39;ve built isolated automations without considering maintainability, documentation, ownership, failure handling, or how the solution fits into the wider architecture.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Your Day To Day&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Building: AI, Automation &amp;amp; Systems (~ 65%)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You identify and productionize high-leverage AI use cases across Sales, Customer Success, Marketing, and Finance, including LLM integrations, workflow design, evaluation, guardrails, and monitoring&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You design and build lightweight internal applications and interfaces that remove recurring manual work, improve decision-making, and are simple for teams to adopt&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You build end-to-end workflows using Make, n8n, and custom logic, including business rules, system handoffs, error handling, alerts, and ongoing monitoring&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You create clean, maintainable data flows between HubSpot, the data warehouse, billing, support, and other GTM tools using APIs, webhooks, enrichment pipelines, and data activation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You work deeply within HubSpot&#39;s objects, properties, workflows, and integration layer to support complex use cases without creating fragile or unnecessarily complicated architecture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Discovery &amp;amp; Solution Design (~ 15%)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You translate scoped or ambiguous business problems into clear technical solutions, define success metrics, and choose the simplest approach that can deliver meaningful impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Deployment, Adoption &amp;amp; Documentation (~ 20%)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You test, document, deploy, and iterate on solutions with end users so they remain secure, maintainable, reliable, and useful after launch&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Stakeholders&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;RevOps:&lt;/strong&gt; Your peers and manager to collaborate on projects and daily initiatives&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engineering team:&lt;/strong&gt; Coordinate with engineers for projects that may require product know how and integration across the engineering tool stack GTM teams as and when required&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Why People Choose Us&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We believe in the power of in-person collaboration: We genuinely love being together in the Berlin office. That&#39;s where the best ideas happen, decisions move faster, and we learn from and grow with each other every day. We do offer some flexibility for remote work, but our default and our energy is being in the room together.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We&#39;re an international team with diverse cultural backgrounds and languages. Openness, mutual respect, and the exchange of different perspectives shape the way we work together.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We value ambition and drive. We&#39;re looking for people who take ownership, show initiative, and are excited to grow quickly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We work with a high degree of ownership and a strong learning mindset. Asking questions, staying curious, and continuously improving are part of our everyday culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We care deeply about humility and teamwork. No egos, open feedback, and a willingness to learn from one another matter more to us than titles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits &amp;amp; Culture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Choose between an Urban Sports Club or John Reed membership, or a public transport pass/Dance subscription.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regular company-wide and team events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An annual €500 learning and development budget that you can use for conferences, courses, books, career coaching, and more.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An inclusive and exciting startup culture that supports rapid professional and personal growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A beautiful office in the heart of Berlin (Prenzlauer Allee 242) with free snacks, drinks, and top-notch equipment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We want to build a community, not just a company.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Creating an environment where people genuinely enjoy spending time together is important to us - whether that&#39;s through HYROX training, golf, beer pong tournaments, running clubs, Warhammer, weekend activities, or any other community you&#39;d like to build here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We believe that diversity makes companies stronger. We welcome applications from everyone, regardless of gender, background, nationality, or religion. Feel free to apply - we&#39;d love to hear from you!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;By submitting your application, you agree to our Privacy Policy.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We look forward to receiving your application! 🙂&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i.imgur.com/Uicf3C7.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;800&quot; style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Manager, Corporate Strategy &amp;amp; Development&lt;/strong&gt;, you will work in a small, AI enabled team of highly driven and committed individuals, reporting to the Director Corporate Strategy &amp;amp; Development. This is a high-exposure role, acting as the strategic and analytical engine for our most important decisions in a team that reports &lt;strong&gt;directly to the Group CEO&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work across the team&#39;s full agenda: Group and business unit strategy, portfolio and capital allocation decisions, and M&amp;amp;A. You are hands-on: you build the financial models, analysis and executive-level outputs yourself. You work under the guidance of the team leadership, owning the quality of analysis and models within your workstreams as well as the respective internal stakeholder relationships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Corporate Strategy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;:&lt;/strong&gt; Support the development of the Group&#39;s mid-term strategy by driving the process, own the underlying analysis, strategic synthesis, and preparation of strategic documents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business Unit Strategy:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as an internal consultant, supporting our key business units across geographies on a project-by-project basis to develop their mid-term strategies and solve their most complex challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;M&amp;amp;A Strategy:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive workstreams for M&amp;amp;A projects, building and owning financial models, analyzing targets, preparing negotiations and supporting the M&amp;amp;A processes the team owns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Portfolio Optimization:&lt;/strong&gt; Contribute to the strategic analysis for key portfolio decisions, including potential geo-expansions, new vertical or brand launches or divestments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Capital Allocation:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop and improve the analytical frameworks and models to support our strategic budget allocation and ROI analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;4+ years&lt;/strong&gt; of high-performance experience from a top-tier Management Consulting firm, Investment Banking, or a comparable in-house Strategy / Corporate Development team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Toolkit:&lt;/strong&gt; Exceptional qualitative and analytical problem-solving skills. You are hypothesis-driven and can own and structure complex analytical problems from end-to-end. You are utilizing AI tools to meaningfully improve your productivity. Ability to build applications with AI coding tools is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Financial Acumen:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong financial modeling skills are required: you have built and defended models used for investment or strategic decisions. Valuation experience is a plus. You are just as comfortable building analysis and models from scratch as you are managing processes and presenting recommendations to leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DTC economics:&lt;/strong&gt; You are comfortable working with typical DTC KPIs like CAC, AOR, AOV, CLV, retention and understand how cohort economics build a P&amp;amp;L over time. DTC marketing analytics experience is a plus but not required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Proactive 360° communication and excellent ability to synthesize complex analysis into clear, concise storylines, presentations&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;and memos for an executive audience.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How you work:&lt;/strong&gt; You take ownership of outcomes and pressure-test your own conclusions before presenting them. You go deep into the analysis to get to the right answer, and know when it is good enough to decide.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Elevate your lifestyle! Join one of Europe&#39;s fastest-growing tech powerhouses in a dynamic phase of expansion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Immerse yourself in a diverse global community of 90+ nationalities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy a competitive compensation package that goes beyond the norm, with perks like a HelloFresh - subsidized Pension Scheme, Berlin relocation support, and a Hybrid working model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Elevate your lifestyle with exclusive discounts on your weekly HelloFresh box and office meals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Invest in your growth with an annual learning &amp;amp; development budget, German language learning budget, and access to the HelloFresh Academy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plus, we&#39;ve got your well-being covered with mental health support, transportation perks, and working-parent-friendly benefits. From our 24/7 gym access,wellbeing platforms like Headspace and Spill, to sabbatical leave options, HelloFresh is not just a workplace; it&#39;s a lifestyle of perks and possibilities!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are you up for the challenge?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Please submit your complete application below including your salary expectations and earliest starting date.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;After submitting an application our team will review this and get back to you within 5 business days.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an &lt;strong&gt;Associate Director, Corporate Strategy &amp;amp; Development&lt;/strong&gt;, you will be a senior member of a small, AI enabled team of highly driven and committed individuals, reporting to the Director Corporate Strategy &amp;amp; Development. This is a high-exposure role, acting as the strategic and analytical engine for our most important decisions in a team that reports &lt;strong&gt;directly to the Group CEO&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role balances corporate development / M&amp;amp;A with corporate strategy. You &lt;strong&gt;lead projects across both areas&lt;/strong&gt; as the day-to-day owner and guide a small number of more junior colleagues and internal functional experts. You operate with &lt;strong&gt;minimal direction&lt;/strong&gt; and take projects from a vague problem statement to a CEO-ready recommendation. You also &lt;strong&gt;stay hands-on&lt;/strong&gt;, personally building the models and analysis and preparing the executive-level outputs that drive investment and strategy decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;M&amp;amp;A Strategy:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead M&amp;amp;A projects end to end (owning small and mid-sized transactions independently and partnering with the Director on the largest, transformational deals), from target screening and valuation through due diligence, negotiation preparation, and post-deal integration. Run deal teams day to day, coordinate external advisors and act as the lead with target management teams or their advisors. You are not just a process manager but can form and defend a point of view on whether and why a deal makes strategic sense and present it directly to senior leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Portfolio Optimization:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead the strategic analysis and recommendations for key portfolio decisions, including potential geo-expansions, new vertical or brand launches or divestments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Corporate Strategy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;:&lt;/strong&gt; Contribute to the development of the Group&#39;s mid-term strategy by driving the process, owning the underlying analysis, strategic synthesis, and preparation of strategic documents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Capital Allocation:&lt;/strong&gt; Own and develop analytical frameworks and models to support strategic budget allocation and ROI analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business Unit Strategy:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as a senior internal consultant, supporting our key business units across geographies on a project-by-project basis to develop their mid-term strategies and solve their most complex challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;6+ years&lt;/strong&gt; of high-performance experience from a top-tier Management Consulting firm, Investment Banking, or a comparable in-house Strategy / Corporate Development team. This includes leading projects or deal teams with minimal supervision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process and deal leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; You have led complex, multi-stakeholder processes to a deadline, coordinating internal functions and external advisors and managing senior counterparties such as target or client management teams. This can come from running M&amp;amp;A transactions (in-house corporate development or advisory) or from leading strategy projects with transaction exposure, such as due diligence, carve-outs, partnerships or market entries. Direct M&amp;amp;A process experience is a strong plus; the ability to learn it quickly is essential.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership and Influence:&lt;/strong&gt; You have guided and developed more junior colleagues and influenced senior stakeholders, including through negotiation and building rapport with counterparties.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Toolkit:&lt;/strong&gt; Exceptional qualitative and analytical problem-solving skills. You are hypothesis-driven and can own and structure complex analytical problems from end-to-end. You structure ambiguous problems and set direction for others, not just solve them yourself. You are utilizing AI tools to meaningfully improve your productivity. Ability to build applications with AI coding tools is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Financial Acumen:&lt;/strong&gt; Expert-level financial modeling skills are required: you have built and defended complex models used for high-stakes investment or strategic decisions. Valuation experience is a plus. You are just as comfortable building analysis and models from scratch as you are managing processes and presenting recommendations to leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DTC economics:&lt;/strong&gt; You are comfortable working with typical DTC KPIs like CAC, AOR, AOV, CLV, retention and understand how cohort economics build a P&amp;amp;L over time. DTC marketing analytics experience is a plus but not required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Proactive 360° communication and excellent ability to synthesize complex analysis into clear, concise storylines, presentations&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;and memos for an executive audience.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How you work:&lt;/strong&gt; You take ownership of outcomes and pressure-test your own conclusions before presenting them. You go deep into the analysis to get to the right answer, and know when it is good enough to decide.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Elevate your lifestyle! Join one of Europe&#39;s fastest-growing tech powerhouses in a dynamic phase of expansion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Immerse yourself in a diverse global community of 90+ nationalities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy a competitive compensation package that goes beyond the norm, with perks like a HelloFresh- subsidized Pension Scheme, Berlin relocation support, and a Hybrid working model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Elevate your lifestyle with exclusive discounts on your weekly HelloFresh box and office meals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Invest in your growth with an annual learning &amp;amp; development budget, German language learning budget, and access to the HelloFresh Academy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plus, we&#39;ve got your well-being covered with mental health support, transportation perks, and working-parent-friendly benefits. From our 24/7 gym access,wellbeing platforms like Headspace and Spill, to sabbatical leave options, HelloFresh is not just a workplace; it&#39;s a lifestyle of perks and possibilities!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are you up for the challenge?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Please submit your complete application below including your salary expectations and earliest starting date.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;After submitting an application our team will review this and get back to you within 5 business days.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;At Stark, we forge the future of European and national security through cutting-edge, AI-driven technology and unmatched engineering precision. As a premier defence technology company, our mission is clear: to equip NATO Allies and their partners &amp;nbsp;with next-generation autonomous defence platforms and advanced AI-driven software built to perform in the world’s most demanding environments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We believe that true security stems from relentless innovation. By combining elite engineering talent with agile technology and an AI-native operational culture, Stark turns complex defence challenges into field-tested, multi-domain solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;WHY JOIN US&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;The software and systems you work on directly protect personnel and defend European and national sovereignty.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;You will work alongside industry-leading minds on autonomous systems, advanced propulsion, and secure cyber platforms.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We foster a fast-paced, collaborative environment where bold ideas are supported by serious R&amp;amp;D backing.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;YOUR MISSION&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;As a Program Manager at STARK, you will lead one of our core hardware programs taking it from early R&amp;amp;D all the way to production readiness. You’ll be responsible for translating ambitious technical concepts into operational products and building the team that makes it happen.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;You’ll work hand-in-hand with a dedicated Chief Engineer, combining program leadership with technical direction. Together, you’ll shape the vision, align priorities, and drive execution across engineering, production, and business functions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;A key part of your mission will be to build and scale a world-class engineering team, recruiting top talent, defining structure, and fostering a high-performance culture that moves fast, collaborates openly, and delivers. You’ll also coordinate with shared engineering functions (simulation, testing, systems, etc.) to allocate resources effectively and ensure critical work gets the attention it needs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;This role is about ownership and leadership: Building both a product and the organization that delivers it.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU WILL DO AT STARK&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;End-to-End Program Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;:&amp;nbsp;Own the delivery of a major hardware program from R&amp;amp;D, to go-to-market verification to production readiness.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Building:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Build, structure, and grow a high-performing multidisciplinary team. Recruit top engineering talent and create an environment where they can deliver their best work.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partnership with Chief Engineer&lt;/strong&gt;:&amp;nbsp;Co-lead the program, pairing strong technical direction with decisive program leadership.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Planning&lt;/strong&gt;:&amp;nbsp;Translate strategic goals into clear milestones, deliverables, and resource plans.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Execution &amp;amp; Prioritization&lt;/strong&gt;:&amp;nbsp;Drive focus on what matters most. Keep teams aligned, proactive, and moving fast.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Coordinatio&lt;/strong&gt;n:&amp;nbsp;Connect the dots across engineering, manufacturing, supply chain, and business functions to maintain alignment and momentum.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Program–Portfolio Alignment:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Work closely with the VP Programs to ensure key programs get the focus and resources needed to deliver cutting-edge technology to customers at record speed.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership &amp;amp; Culture&lt;/strong&gt;:&amp;nbsp;Set high standards, communicate clearly, and keep teams motivated and accountable even in demanding phases.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Communication&lt;/strong&gt;:&amp;nbsp;Deliver concise, transparent updates on progress, risks, and key decisions to leadership.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process &amp;amp; Structure&lt;/strong&gt;:&amp;nbsp;Implement pragmatic governance and scalable processes that enable speed without bureaucracy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU BRING TO THE MISSION&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience&lt;/strong&gt;:&amp;nbsp;4–10 years in program or project management, ideally in hardware, aerospace, robotics, or defense. Proven experience leading complex technical programs and growing teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Background&lt;/strong&gt;:&amp;nbsp;Technical or technically literate background: e.g. engineering, industrial engineering, or technical management. You don’t need to design systems yourself, but you must understand how engineers think and work.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;:&amp;nbsp;Proven ability to&amp;nbsp;build and lead&amp;nbsp;high-performing teams. You attract talent, set structure, and keep people aligned through clarity and purpose.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mindset&lt;/strong&gt;:&amp;nbsp;Mission-driven, decisive, and pragmatic. You thrive in ambiguity and bring structure to complexity. You seek feedback, learn fast, and raise your own bar continuously.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication&lt;/strong&gt;:&amp;nbsp;Clear, direct communicator with strong written and verbal skills in&amp;nbsp;English and German.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Execution&lt;/strong&gt;:&amp;nbsp;Strong bias for action: &amp;gt;ou get things done, stay close to the details, and drive accountability.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tools&lt;/strong&gt;:&amp;nbsp;Comfortable with modern program tools (e.g. Jira, Confluence, Excel, and PMO systems).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;If you&#39;re interested in building the future of European Defence with us, and you see yourself reflected on the description above, please send us your &lt;strong&gt;CV in English&lt;/strong&gt;. We&#39;re looking forward to meeting you!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SECURITY CLEARANCE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Due to the nature of our work in the defence sector, candidates must be eligible to obtain and maintain the appropriate security clearance required for this position. Details will be provided during the recruitment process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;EQUAL OPPORTUNITY&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We are an equal-opportunity employer committed to fostering a diverse and inclusive workplace. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, colour, religion, sex, national origin, disability, or any other characteristic protected by applicable law.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DATA PRIVACY STATEMENT&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;This data privacy statement, which refers exclusively to data collected as part of the online application process, is to inform you about how your personal data that is collected as part of the online application process is handled at our end.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The controller&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The controller under data protection law is:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SKD SE&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Französische Strasse 12, 10117 Berlin&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Commercial register entry number: &lt;strong&gt;HRB 260878&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Registration Court: Amtsgericht Charlottenburg&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Protection officer:&lt;/strong&gt; heyData GmbH, Schützenstraße 5, 10117 Berlin,&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.heydata.eu&quot;&gt; www.heydata.eu&lt;/a&gt;, -----
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Personal data collected as part of the application process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Personal data means any information concerning the personal or material circumstances of an identified or identifiable individual. This includes information such as, for example, your name, address, telephone number and date of birth, but also data relating to your specific career etc. by reference to which a specific individual can be identified with reasonable effort. However, information which cannot be (in)directly associated with your real-life identity is not personal data.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fundamentals and purposes of processing personal data collected from application documents and during the application process&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you apply to us electronically, i.e. via e-mail or using our online form, we will collect and process your personal data for the purpose of executing the application process and preparing contracts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By submitting an application via our recruitment website, you express your interest in taking up work with us. In this context, you transmit personal data, which we will use and store exclusively for the purpose of your job search / application process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In particular, the following data is collected during this process:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;name (first and last names)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;e-mail address&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;phone number&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;LinkedIn profile (optional)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;channel through which you found us&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Furthermore, you can choose to upload expressive documents such as a cover letter, your CV and reference letters. These may contain additional personal data such as date of birth, address etc.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Only authorized HR staff and/or staff involved in the application process have access to your data.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The personal data is stored, as a rule, exclusively for the purpose of filling the vacancy for which you have applied.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your data will be stored for a period of 180 days after the application process has been concluded. This is usually done to fulfill legal requirements and/or defending ourselves against any claims arising from legal provisions. After this period, we are obligated to delete or anonymize your data. In case of anonymization, the data will only be available to us in the form of so-called metadata, without any direct personal reference, for statistical analysis (for example, share of male and/or female applicants, number of applications per specified period of time etc.).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Furthermore, we reserve the right to store your data for 180 days after the application process has been concluded for the purpose of adding it to our Talent Pool in order to identify any other vacancies that may be of interest to you. This includes, for example, applications for apprenticeships or internships. By accepting the data privacy statement, you consent to any further storage of your data as well as its inclusion in our Talent Pool.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Should you be offered and accept a position with us during the application process, we will store the personal data collected as part of the application process for at least the duration of your employment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Disclosure of data to third parties&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Data transmitted as part of your application will be transferred using TLS encryption and stored in a database. This database is operated by Greenhouse, which offers a human resource and applicant management software solution (https://www.greenhouse.com/data-processing-addendum). In this context, Greenhouse is our processor under article 28 of the GDPR. In this case, the processing is based on an agreement for the processing of orders between us as the controller and Greenhouse.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rights of data subjects&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If we as the controller process personal data, you as the data subject have certain rights under Chapter III of the EU General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR), depending on the legal basis and the purpose of the processing, in particular the right of access (article 15 of the GDPR) and the rights to rectification (article 16 of the GDPR), erasure (article 17 of the GDPR), restriction of processing (article 18 of the GDPR), and data portability (article 20 of the GDPR), as well as the right to object (article 21 of the GDPR). If the personal data is processed with your consent, you have the right to withdraw this consent under article 7 III of the GDPR.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To assert your rights as a data subject in relation to the data processed during this online application process, please refer to our Data Protection Officer (see item 2).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Concluding provisions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We reserve the right to adjust this data privacy statement at any point in time to ensure that it is in line with the current legal requirements at all times, or in order to accommodate changes in the application process or other processes. In this case, the new data privacy statement applies to any later visit of this recruitment website or any later job application.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;LEGAL NOTICE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;1. Information according to § 5 DDG&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SKD SE&lt;br&gt;Französische Str. 12&lt;br&gt;10117 Berlin&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Internet: &lt;a href=&quot;https://stark-defence.com/en/&quot;&gt;www.stark-defence.com&lt;br&gt;&lt;/a&gt;E-Mail: -----
&lt;p&gt;SKD SE, Berlin (registered office of the company), is a Societas Europaea (legal form for joint stock companies), registered at the district court of Berlin (Charlottenburg) under the register number: HRB 260878 B, represented by the Executive Board: Uwe Horstmann, Dr. André Schneider, Johannes Schaback, Jan-Patrick Helmsen, Martin Rost.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Chairman of the Supervisory Board is Mr. Robert Maier.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VAT ID No.: DE369778559&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;2. Liability&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are responsible for the content of our website in accordance with the provisions of general law. All content is created with the necessary care and to the best of our knowledge and is for information purposes only. Insofar as we refer on our Internet pages to the Internet pages of third parties by means of hyperlinks, we cannot accept any liability for guarantee that the linked content is always up to date, correct and complete, as this content is outside our responsibility and we have no influence on its future design. If, in your opinion, content violates applicable law or is inappropriate, please let us know. The legal information on this page as well as all questions and disputes in connection with the design of this website are subject to the law of the Federal Republic of Germany.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;3. Data Protection&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You can find our data protection information here. There you will also find the contact details of our data protection officer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;4. Copyright Information&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The texts, images, photos, videos and graphics on our website are generally protected by copyright. Any unauthorized use (in particular the reproduction, editing or distribution) of this copyright-protected content is therefore prohibited. If you intend to use this content or parts thereof, please contact us in advance using the details above. If we are not ourselves the owner of the required copyright usage rights, we will endeavor to arrange contact with the entitled party.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;At Stark, we forge the future of European and national security through cutting-edge, AI-driven technology and unmatched engineering precision. As a premier defence technology company, our mission is clear: to equip NATO Allies and their partners &amp;nbsp;with next-generation autonomous defence platforms and advanced AI-driven software built to perform in the world’s most demanding environments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We believe that true security stems from relentless innovation. By combining elite engineering talent with agile technology and an AI-native operational culture, Stark turns complex defence challenges into field-tested, multi-domain solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;WHY JOIN US&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;The software and systems you work on directly protect personnel and defend European and national sovereignty.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;You will work alongside industry-leading minds on autonomous systems, advanced propulsion, and secure cyber platforms.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We foster a fast-paced, collaborative environment where bold ideas are supported by serious R&amp;amp;D backing.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT THE TEAM&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Data Operations team at Stark builds and maintains the core data pipelines, sensor logging, and annotation workflows that feed our AI and perception models. Operating at the intersection of hardware testing, flight logs, and machine learning, the team ensures high-throughput, high-fidelity data availability. We work closely with ML Engineers, perception experts, and external labeling partners to scale training data for autonomous defence systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;YOUR MISSION&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are the crucial bridge between our raw field data, our external labeling partners, and our internal Machine Learning teams. Your mission is to ensure our AI models are trained on the highest quality data possible. You will own the day-to-day operations of the data labeling lifecycle: curating raw data, preparing annotation batches, managing vendor communication, and rigorously assessing the quality of incoming labels. If you are highly organized, detail-oriented, and interested in the intersection of data operations and Computer Vision, this is the perfect place to start your career in AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU WILL DO AT STARK&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the day-to-day data labeling lifecycle: curate raw field data, create annotation batches, and prepare deliveries for external labeling companies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the primary point of contact for external data annotation vendors, clarifying edge cases and providing feedback on labeling guidelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct rigorous Quality Assurance (QA) assessments on incoming label deliveries, track error rates, and create performance reports.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support data curation efforts, filtering and selecting the most valuable sensor data (images, video, lidar) for model training.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with ML Engineers to understand their data needs, edge cases, and specific Computer Vision requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help maintain the data catalog by ensuring incoming datasets are properly tagged and logged.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU BRING TO THE MISSION&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly organized and detail-oriented: you can manage multiple data batches, vendor deliveries, and QA processes simultaneously without dropping the ball.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills: you are comfortable coordinating with external vendors and writing clear, unambiguous instructions/guidelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic understanding of Computer Vision and Machine Learning concepts (e.g., bounding boxes, segmentation masks, object tracking).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable with basic scripting (Python) and data querying (SQL) to automate small tasks or filter data batches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pragmatic problem-solver who enjoys bringing order to chaotic data deliveries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;If you&#39;re interested in building the future of European Defence with us, and you see yourself reflected on the description above, please send us your &lt;strong&gt;CV in English&lt;/strong&gt;. We&#39;re looking forward to meeting you!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SECURITY CLEARANCE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
