&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT QUINCE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Quince is a destination for builders, creators, innovators, and operators who want to come together and challenge the status quo. Our mission is simple: make really high quality essentials for really low prices, fairly and sustainably. We deliver on that mission through a unique manufacturer-to-consumer (M2C) model eliminating the layers of traditional retail that add cost and result in consumers paying more than they need to. We find, build relationships with, and work directly with the manufacturing partners behind some of the world’s finest products. From there, our teams design smart, efficient operational processes&amp;nbsp; and build and deploy proprietary technology, AI, and analytics to help us scale fast.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What began with a small assortment of elevated basics has quickly grown into a cross-category brand spanning apparel, accessories, home goods, and more. Today, tens of millions of people across a growing number of countries come – and return – to Quince because they trust us to deliver.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;OUR CULTURE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Quince is a culture built for builders by builders. Our way of working starts with a blank sheet of paper. We question conventional thinking, use technology and data to uncover new opportunities, and move quickly to turn ideas into reality. We aren’t interested in replicating how others do retail. We’re building a better way – at a speed and scale unlike anything that’s been done before.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We dream big and chase the hard problems others shy away from. Rejecting long-held assumptions is part of our company&#39;s DNA.&amp;nbsp; Where conventional wisdom says you have to choose – soft or durable, speed or rigor, quality or price – we ask why that trade-off has to exist in the first place.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our pace is fast and the bar is high because our customers expect a lot from us and we refuse to let them down. We believe the best results come from challenging ourselves, learning from one another, and building on each other&#39;s strengths.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Here, responsibility is not determined by role, tenure, or seniority. Every team member - no matter their level - has the opportunity to drive our business and shape our trajectory.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re someone who likes to imagine new possibilities and build better systems rather than plug-in to outdated ones, Quince is the place for you.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2290&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6a0d0d38-3057-4834-9012-12f09f19e465&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fabric-text-color-mark&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-text-custom-color=&quot;#0747a6&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;THE ROLE &lt;/u&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2301&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6d5afd27-5970-45c1-b675-f5df64663cbf&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fabric-text-color-mark&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-text-custom-color=&quot;#0747a6&quot;&gt;Senior Creative Strategist&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Sr. Creative Strategist for UK/EU is a performance-minded, market-savvy leader who bridges global creative output with the nuances of European consumer behaviour. This person excels at identifying what&#39;s working in the US market and translating it for UK and German/French audiences; while also building the infrastructure to test, learn and scale independently. This person is energized by solving complex business problems, making high-judgment decisions in ambiguous environments, and turning insights into scalable, revenue-driving creative strategy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Success in this role looks like:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consistently identifying high-performing US creative and adapting it to drive customer acquisition and revenue growth in UK &amp;amp; DE/FR markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Owning the experimentation framework that enables the EU/UK team to move fast, document learnings, and scale winners while maintaining strong alignment with brand identity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serving as the primary creative liaison between UK &amp;amp; DE/FR market needs and the US creative and production teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improving win rates and spend efficiency through a rigorous, data-backed testing cadence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Acting as a strategic partner to the Director of Paid Social UK &amp;amp; DE/FR and cross-functional brand, design, and marketing teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leveraging data to inform strategic direction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This role is critical to establishing Paid Social as a core growth engine in the UK, Germany and France.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role will be onsite 4-days a week based in London, Madrid, or Berlin.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2663&quot; data-local-id=&quot;e0c03b8d-8a8f-42ae-b3e9-26b5a2308ae6&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fabric-text-color-mark&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-text-custom-color=&quot;#0747a6&quot;&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Creative Adaptation &amp;amp; Briefing&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Audit US creative performance regularly to identify high-potential concepts for UK &amp;amp; DE/FR adaptation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Brief the US creative team on market-specific adaptation needs; adjusting copy, tone, cultural references, pricing, and product focus for UK &amp;amp; DE/FR audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commission net-new creative concepts where US assets are insufficient or market-specific angles are required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write clear, detailed high converting ad briefs for video, static, UGC, and other ad formats with UK &amp;amp; DE/FR market context embedded&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure all adapted and net-new creative aligns with brand identity while resonating locally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide strategic feedback to designers and execute on feedback from leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Experimentation &amp;amp; Performance&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and own a structured experimentation framework for UK &amp;amp; DE/FR paid social; covering hypothesis formation, test design, documentation, and results reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prioritise and manage a live test pipeline across Meta (and other channels) to continuously improve creative performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyse performance data in Meta Ads Manager, TikTok Ads Manager, and Looker; translate findings into clear strategic recommendations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct consumer, competitor, and trend research specific to UK &amp;amp; DE/FR markets to inform creative direction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify winning patterns and codify them into repeatable brief templates and creative playbooks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Cross-functional Collaboration&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the EU/UK creative point of contact for the US production and strategy teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the Director of Paid Social EU/UK on channel strategy, creative priorities, and growth planning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Brand, Design, and broader Marketing teams to align creative output across channels including affiliate, CRM, and PR&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2753&quot; data-local-id=&quot;9ae6a13b-2175-4a37-a4c2-5839b2f592ae&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fabric-text-color-mark&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-text-custom-color=&quot;#0747a6&quot;&gt;Qualifications&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2769&quot; data-local-id=&quot;46937c2f-d543-4fbd-b76c-3593c6541fb4&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fabric-text-color-mark&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-text-custom-color=&quot;#0747a6&quot;&gt;Required:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of relevant creative and marketing experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid Social and/or Direct Response experience required, with strong Meta expertise&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience working across markets; ideally including UK and/or DACH, with an understanding of how to adapt creative for different audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical mindset with the ability to interpret data and make confident creative decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills; ability to write compelling briefs and copy across formats&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing creative testing frameworks and reporting on results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong project management skills with the ability to juggle multiple briefs, markets, and workstreams simultaneously&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working across Google Suite (Docs, Sheets, Slides, Gmail)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in English required; German/French language skills a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to thrive in a fast-paced, deadline-driven environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong collaboration skills across creative and marketing teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3083&quot; data-local-id=&quot;dbaae2d5-3e8d-43bb-be8c-e1c7e3b63382&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fabric-text-color-mark&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-text-custom-color=&quot;#0747a6&quot;&gt;Preferred:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with TikTok, YouTube, Snapchat, or other paid platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience briefing and working with UGC creators&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in DTC, fashion or e-commerce brands&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3150&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;All posted ranges are reflective of base salary and may vary depending upon experience level and location. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;Bonus and equity may also be provided for eligible roles.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;£92,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;£101,000 GBP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3319&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;WHY QUINCE?&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3352&quot;&gt;Joining Quince means being part of a mission-driven team reshaping retail. You will work alongside talented colleagues, tackle meaningful challenges, and contribute to building a more sustainable, accessible future for customers and partners alike.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3604&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;EQUAL OPPORTUNITY &amp;amp; HIRING INTEGRITY&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3662&quot;&gt;Quince provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applications for employment and prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran or military status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state, or local laws.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4074&quot;&gt;Quince is committed to providing reasonable accommodations to qualified individuals with disabilities. If you need a reasonable accommodation to complete your application or to perform the essential functions of a role at Quince, please let us know by completing &lt;a href=&quot;https://forms.gle/DpJ11jHa1WbqfUWB9&quot;&gt;this accommodation form&lt;/a&gt;. We review all requests individually and will work with you to determine appropriate accommodations on a case-by-case basis.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4428&quot;&gt;Employment is contingent upon successful completion of a background check. Quince will conduct background checks in compliance with applicable federal, state, and local laws.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4604&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Security Advisory: Beware of Frauds&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4641&quot;&gt;At Quince, we&#39;re dedicated to recruiting top talent who share our drive for innovation. To safeguard candidates, Quince emphasizes legitimate recruitment practices. Initial communication is primarily via official Quince email addresses and LinkedIn; beware of deviations. Personal data and sensitive information will not be solicited during the application phase. Interviews are conducted via phone, in person, or through the approved platforms Google Meets or Zoom—never via messaging apps or other calling services. Offers are merit-based, communicated verbally, and followed up in writing. If personal information is requested to initiate the hiring process, rest assured it will be through secure and protected means.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5364&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT QUINCE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Quince is a destination for builders, creators, innovators, and operators who want to come together and challenge the status quo. Our mission is simple: make really high quality essentials for really low prices, fairly and sustainably. We deliver on that mission through a unique manufacturer-to-consumer (M2C) model eliminating the layers of traditional retail that add cost and result in consumers paying more than they need to. We find, build relationships with, and work directly with the manufacturing partners behind some of the world’s finest products. From there, our teams design smart, efficient operational processes&amp;nbsp; and build and deploy proprietary technology, AI, and analytics to help us scale fast.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What began with a small assortment of elevated basics has quickly grown into a cross-category brand spanning apparel, accessories, home goods, and more. Today, tens of millions of people across a growing number of countries come – and return – to Quince because they trust us to deliver.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;OUR CULTURE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Quince is a culture built for builders by builders. Our way of working starts with a blank sheet of paper. We question conventional thinking, use technology and data to uncover new opportunities, and move quickly to turn ideas into reality. We aren’t interested in replicating how others do retail. We’re building a better way – at a speed and scale unlike anything that’s been done before.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We dream big and chase the hard problems others shy away from. Rejecting long-held assumptions is part of our company&#39;s DNA.&amp;nbsp; Where conventional wisdom says you have to choose – soft or durable, speed or rigor, quality or price – we ask why that trade-off has to exist in the first place.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our pace is fast and the bar is high because our customers expect a lot from us and we refuse to let them down. We believe the best results come from challenging ourselves, learning from one another, and building on each other&#39;s strengths.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Here, responsibility is not determined by role, tenure, or seniority. Every team member - no matter their level - has the opportunity to drive our business and shape our trajectory.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re someone who likes to imagine new possibilities and build better systems rather than plug-in to outdated ones, Quince is the place for you.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2290&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6a0d0d38-3057-4834-9012-12f09f19e465&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fabric-text-color-mark&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-text-custom-color=&quot;#0747a6&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;THE ROLE &lt;/u&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2301&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6d5afd27-5970-45c1-b675-f5df64663cbf&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fabric-text-color-mark&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-text-custom-color=&quot;#0747a6&quot;&gt;Director, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fabric-text-color-mark&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-text-custom-color=&quot;#0747a6&quot;&gt;International Tax&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2301&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6d5afd27-5970-45c1-b675-f5df64663cbf&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fabric-text-color-mark&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-text-custom-color=&quot;#0747a6&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We are looking for an &lt;strong&gt;Director, &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;International Tax&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;to build and own the international tax function at Quince. This is the first dedicated tax hire in the company, and it arrives at the moment we need it most: Quince is entering Europe, Mexico, Australia, and numerous other countries on an aggressive timeline, and every one of those markets brings tax questions we do not currently have an in-house answer to.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Entity structure. Permanent establishment. VAT and GST registration. Withholding tax. Transfer pricing. Customs and import duty treatment. Local filing obligations we may not know exist until we have already tripped over them. The International Tax Director is the person who knows where those blind spots are before we walk into them, and who tells us what we need to do about them while it is still a decision rather than a problem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role reports directly to the&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;VP of Accounting&lt;/strong&gt; and functions as their right hand on anything tax — the person who can answer any tax question, or knows exactly how to go get the answer. This role is also the first call for the &lt;strong&gt;Head of International&lt;/strong&gt; on any tax question tied to a new market, and a close partner to Legal, People Ops, and Supply Chain as the international footprint is built.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2663&quot; data-local-id=&quot;e0c03b8d-8a8f-42ae-b3e9-26b5a2308ae6&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fabric-text-color-mark&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-text-custom-color=&quot;#0747a6&quot;&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Serve as the tax lead on every new-market launch — assess the tax profile of a market before we enter, flag what will and won&#39;t work, and define the registrations, filings, and structural decisions required to operate compliantly from day one.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Build and maintain a market-entry tax playbook and a global filing calendar, so the tenth country launch is materially faster and cleaner than the first.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Advise on legal entity structure and the tax consequences of each option — branch vs. subsidiary, holding structure, where IP and inventory sit, and how intercompany flows are designed — partnering with Legal on entity timing and sequencing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Identify and manage permanent establishment risk created by employees, contractors, EOR arrangements, warehouses, third-party logistics providers, and local agents, including the tax implications of transitioning employees from EOR to local entity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Own transfer pricing end to end: intercompany agreements, pricing methodology, master file and local file documentation, country-by-country reporting where applicable, and defense of the position under audit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Own indirect tax globally — EU VAT (including OSS/IOSS, distance-selling rules, import VAT, and reverse charge), UK VAT, Mexican IVA, Australian GST and low-value imported goods rules, and the considerably more complex South American regimes — covering registration, filing, recoverability, and the operational setup behind each.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2753&quot; data-local-id=&quot;9ae6a13b-2175-4a37-a4c2-5839b2f592ae&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fabric-text-color-mark&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-text-custom-color=&quot;#0747a6&quot;&gt;Qualifications&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Deep international tax capability is essential given the scope of this role — cross-border structuring, transfer pricing, treaty analysis, permanent establishment, and indirect tax across multiple regimes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Working knowledge of US federal and state taxation, including ASC 740, is a plus rather than a requirement. Our US provision and returns are prepared by an external firm; what we need is someone who can manage that firm credibly, review its work, and recognize when an answer doesn&#39;t hold up.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Genuine indirect tax depth, or a demonstrated ability to research an unfamiliar country&#39;s VAT/GST regime from scratch and return with a defensible, documented answer. Knowing how to find the right answer in a new jurisdiction matters more here than having memorized any one of them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Demonstrated ability to stand up tax infrastructure where none exists, and to apply rigorous technical judgment to ambiguous, fast-moving, and incompletely specified situations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Comfortable being the only tax person in the company. This role will not be hiring a team for at least 12–18 months, and in the meantime you are both the strategist and the person doing the work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Proactive risk identifier. The most valuable thing you will do in this role is raise the issue nobody else knew to ask about.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Skilled at translating complex technical tax positions into clear business language that non-tax partners can act on with confidence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Collaborative partner with a positive, solutions-oriented mindset; able to build trust quickly with Accounting, Legal, People Ops, Supply Chain, and the International team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Agile and adaptable; comfortable building and evolving processes as the international footprint matures, without being constrained by legacy approaches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Entrepreneurial mindset; equally comfortable setting global tax strategy and rolling up their sleeves to file a return.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Proactive problem-solver and self-starter; energized by ambiguity and motivated to find the right answer even when no playbook exists.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3083&quot; data-local-id=&quot;dbaae2d5-3e8d-43bb-be8c-e1c7e3b63382&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fabric-text-color-mark&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-text-custom-color=&quot;#0747a6&quot;&gt;Preferred: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Substantial international tax experience specifically — this is the center of the role, not an adjacent skill.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Demonstrated experience supporting a company through multi-country international expansion, including entity setup, indirect tax registration, and cross-border structuring.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Experience supporting direct-to-consumer, retail, e-commerce, or another goods-based business with a physical supply chain strongly preferred, including exposure to customs and import duty matters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Experience selecting and managing external tax advisors across multiple jurisdictions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Practical experience with tax engines (Avalara, Vertex, or similar) and ERP tax configuration preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3319&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;WHY QUINCE?&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3352&quot;&gt;Joining Quince means being part of a mission-driven team reshaping retail. You will work alongside talented colleagues, tackle meaningful challenges, and contribute to building a more sustainable, accessible future for customers and partners alike.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3604&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;EQUAL OPPORTUNITY &amp;amp; HIRING INTEGRITY&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3662&quot;&gt;Quince provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applications for employment and prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran or military status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state, or local laws.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4074&quot;&gt;Quince is committed to providing reasonable accommodations to qualified individuals with disabilities. If you need a reasonable accommodation to complete your application or to perform the essential functions of a role at Quince, please let us know by completing &lt;a href=&quot;https://forms.gle/DpJ11jHa1WbqfUWB9&quot;&gt;this accommodation form&lt;/a&gt;. We review all requests individually and will work with you to determine appropriate accommodations on a case-by-case basis.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4428&quot;&gt;Employment is contingent upon successful completion of a background check. Quince will conduct background checks in compliance with applicable federal, state, and local laws.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4604&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Security Advisory: Beware of Frauds&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4641&quot;&gt;At Quince, we&#39;re dedicated to recruiting top talent who share our drive for innovation. To safeguard candidates, Quince emphasizes legitimate recruitment practices. Initial communication is primarily via official Quince email addresses and LinkedIn; beware of deviations. Personal data and sensitive information will not be solicited during the application phase. Interviews are conducted via phone, in person, or through the approved platforms Google Meets or Zoom—never via messaging apps or other calling services. Offers are merit-based, communicated verbally, and followed up in writing. If personal information is requested to initiate the hiring process, rest assured it will be through secure and protected means.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5364&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Service Designer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; London (Hybrid) | &lt;strong&gt;Practice Area:&lt;/strong&gt; Product &amp;amp; Experience | &lt;strong&gt;Type:&lt;/strong&gt; Permanent&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design with impact. Lead with empathy. Transform experiences.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Capco is looking for a Senior Service Designer to help create customer-centric products and services that drive meaningful change in financial services and energy. You’ll work on complex transformation programmes addressing today’s most relevant challenges, from advancing inclusive design in high-street banking to helping global organisations adopt customer-driven operating models. You&#39;ll also help clients identify where AI-enabled capabilities can enhance customer experiences and service delivery in a responsible and user-centred way.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Facilitate senior-level workshops and lead discovery activities to define experience design strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate user needs into concepts, service blueprints, and artefacts that align business strategy with user needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to incorporate AI-enabled capabilities, such as personalisation or automation, into service concepts where they enhance customer and business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the design of customer journey management approaches, including AI-enabled insight where appropriate to improve service performance and decision-making&lt;strong&gt;.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee end-to-end design delivery, managing roadmaps and timelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Promote the value of design across multi-disciplinary teams and client stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Become a trusted advisor to clients, identifying and leading new opportunities that address their challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong expertise in service design methods and customer experience practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to lead change and influence senior stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in Customer Journey Management, including specialist tools such as Theydo and how analytics support journey optimisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An understanding of how AI-enabled capabilities can enhance service design and customer experience outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in agile, cross-functional teams alongside data and technology specialists, with an appreciation of AI-enabled delivery approaches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Product design skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Domain knowledge in banking, insurance, or capital markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with inclusive design or AI-enabled service innovation within enterprise environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with sustainable design practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consulting experience within financial services or other regulated industries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Capco&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be part of a close-knit, multi-skilled, and fast-paced design team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver high-impact technology solutions for Tier 1 financial and energy institutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work within a collaborative, flat, and entrepreneurial consulting culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access continuous learning, professional training, and industry certifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help shape the future of human-centric transformation across financial services and energy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Core Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt; Discretionary bonus, competitive pension, health insurance, life insurance, and critical illness cover.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mental Health:&lt;/strong&gt; Easy access to CareFirst, Unmind, Aviva consultations, and trained in-house mental health first aiders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Family-Friendly:&lt;/strong&gt; Enhanced maternity, adoption, and shared parental leave, plus paid leave for sickness, pregnancy loss, fertility treatment, menopause, and bereavement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Family Care:&lt;/strong&gt; Eight complimentary backup care sessions for emergency childcare or elder care.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Holiday Flexibility:&lt;/strong&gt; Five weeks of annual leave, with the option to buy or sell additional days.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Continuous Learning:&lt;/strong&gt; Minimum 40 hours of training annually, including workshops, certifications, and e-learning, plus a dedicated Business Coach from Day One.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Healthcare Access:&lt;/strong&gt; Convenient online GP services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Extra Perks:&lt;/strong&gt; Gympass (Wellhub), travel insurance, Tastecard, season ticket loans, Cycle to Work scheme, and dental insurance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inclusion at Capco&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are committed to a barrier-free and inclusive recruitment process. If you require adjustments at any stage, please let us know – we’re happy to support you. We welcome applicants from all backgrounds. At Capco, we value the difference you make, and the differences that make you. Our #BeYourselfAtWork culture champions diversity, equity, and inclusion, and underpins the way we work with clients and colleagues every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-DNI&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Data Scientist&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; London (Hybrid) | &lt;strong&gt;Practice Area:&lt;/strong&gt; Data &amp;amp; Analytics | &lt;strong&gt;Type:&lt;/strong&gt; Permanent&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shape intelligent solutions. Lead with insight. Drive data innovation.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Senior Data Scientist to join Capco’s growing UK Data Practice. You will play a leading role in designing and implementing cutting-edge data science solutions across financial services. This is an opportunity to build intelligent systems that drive commercial and customer outcomes while mentoring others and collaborating in a dynamic, multi-disciplinary environment. You&#39;ll also embrace AI-enabled ways of working, using approved AI tools where appropriate to enhance delivery while applying sound professional judgement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the end-to-end delivery of data science solutions including PoCs, MVPs and production deployments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and prototype ML models to solve complex business challenges using modern techniques and tooling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with engineers, domain experts, and business teams to translate requirements into deliverables, using approved AI tools where appropriate to improve efficiency and accelerate insight.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide and coach data science pods, supporting skill development and solution design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a subject matter expert on ML architecture, model calibration, and productionisation, promoting responsible AI practices and scalable model governance where applicable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience building and deploying data science solutions in Python and related ML libraries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong background in applied machine learning, model development, and data engineering, with an appreciation of responsible AI principles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with cloud environments (Azure, AWS, GCP) and tools such as Spark, Hive, and Redshift.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to lead cross-functional teams and mentor junior practitioners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to communicate complex technical concepts clearly to non-technical audiences and apply AI-enabled approaches to deliver practical business value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participation in Kaggle or other data science competitions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with MLOps practices (CI/CD, model monitoring, DevOps integration).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with advanced NLP frameworks such as spaCy or Transformers and exposure to AI technologies including Generative AI or LLMs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;MSc or PhD in a numerate discipline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Financial services or banking experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Capco&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver high-impact technology solutions for Tier 1 financial institutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work in a collaborative, flat, and entrepreneurial consulting culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access continuous learning, training, and industry certifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be part of a team shaping the future of digital financial services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help shape the future of digital transformation across FS &amp;amp; Energy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Core Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt; Discretionary bonus, competitive pension, health insurance, life insurance and critical illness cover.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mental Health:&lt;/strong&gt; Easy access to CareFirst, Unmind, Aviva consultations, and in-house first aiders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Family-Friendly:&lt;/strong&gt; Maternity, adoption, shared parental leave, plus paid leave for sickness, pregnancy loss, fertility treatment, menopause, and bereavement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Family Care:&lt;/strong&gt; 8 complimentary backup care sessions for emergency childcare or elder care.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Holiday Flexibility:&lt;/strong&gt; 5 weeks of annual leave with the option to buy or sell holiday days based on your needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Continuous Learning:&lt;/strong&gt; Minimum 40 Hours of Training Annually: Take your pick – workshops, certifications, e-learning – your growth, your way. Business Coach assigned from Day One to help accelerate your development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Healthcare Access:&lt;/strong&gt; Convenient online GP services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Extra Perks:&lt;/strong&gt; Gympass (Wellhub), travel insurance, Tastecard, season ticket loans, Cycle to Work, and dental insurance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inclusion at Capco&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re committed to making our recruitment process accessible and straightforward for everyone. If you need any adjustments at any stage, just let us know – we’ll be happy to help. We value each person’s unique perspective and contribution. At Capco, we believe that being yourself is your greatest strength. Our #BeYourselfAtWork culture encourages individuality and collaboration – a mindset that shapes how we work with clients and each other every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-DNI&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;h1 class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-section-id=&quot;tuqihh&quot; data-start=&quot;454&quot; data-end=&quot;482&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Senior Data Engineer –&amp;nbsp;&lt;em class=&quot;Highlight ht12570a5c-fe4a-4faf-85ad-9359aedf0c1d&quot;&gt;AWS&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;484&quot; data-end=&quot;581&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;484&quot; data-end=&quot;497&quot;&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; London (Hybrid) | &lt;strong data-start=&quot;516&quot; data-end=&quot;534&quot;&gt;Practice Area:&lt;/strong&gt; Technology &amp;amp; Engineering | &lt;strong data-start=&quot;562&quot; data-end=&quot;571&quot;&gt;Type:&lt;/strong&gt; Permanent&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;583&quot; data-end=&quot;660&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;583&quot; data-end=&quot;660&quot;&gt;Engineer future-ready data platforms that power financial transformation.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;1hl1yo8&quot; data-start=&quot;662&quot; data-end=&quot;677&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;665&quot; data-end=&quot;677&quot;&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;679&quot; data-end=&quot;1413&quot;&gt;We’re looking for a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;699&quot; data-end=&quot;732&quot;&gt;Senior Data Engineer with &lt;em class=&quot;Highlight ht12570a5c-fe4a-4faf-85ad-9359aedf0c1d&quot;&gt;AWS&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; to join our growing team of engineering experts driving &lt;em class=&quot;Highlight hte8d84c36-3d11-4b5d-af91-f34d644d37f4&quot;&gt;next&lt;/em&gt;-generation transformation for Tier 1 financial services clients. You’ll play a pivotal role in designing, building, and deploying cloud-based data pipelines. Working across greenfield projects and enterprise-scale platforms, your work will directly impact how data is ingested, transformed, and served at scale across the financial services industry. You&#39;ll also embrace AI-enabled ways of working, using approved AI and automation tools where appropriate to improve engineering productivity, accelerate delivery, and enhance solution quality while applying sound engineering judgement and responsible AI practices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;1uboqym&quot; data-start=&quot;1415&quot; data-end=&quot;1436&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1418&quot; data-end=&quot;1436&quot;&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1438&quot; data-end=&quot;2163&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1efxxzs&quot; data-start=&quot;1438&quot; data-end=&quot;1544&quot;&gt;Design and build end-to-end data pipelines leveraging &lt;em class=&quot;Highlight ht12570a5c-fe4a-4faf-85ad-9359aedf0c1d&quot;&gt;AWS&lt;/em&gt;-native services and modern data architectures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;14sioxy&quot; data-start=&quot;1545&quot; data-end=&quot;1686&quot;&gt;Collaborate with clients to gather requirements, define technical solutions, and deliver production-grade systems that meet business needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1vjb9gp&quot; data-start=&quot;1687&quot; data-end=&quot;1854&quot;&gt;Apply &lt;em class=&quot;Highlight ht12570a5c-fe4a-4faf-85ad-9359aedf0c1d&quot;&gt;AWS&lt;/em&gt; Well-Architected Principles, CI/CD practices, and AI-enabled engineering approaches to deliver scalable, secure, resilient, and high-quality solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1ucfps9&quot; data-start=&quot;1855&quot; data-end=&quot;1990&quot;&gt;Develop robust, tested, and fault-tolerant data engineering solutions while promoting engineering best practices and data governance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;e1ojpy&quot; data-start=&quot;1991&quot; data-end=&quot;2163&quot;&gt;Mentor junior engineers, contribute to knowledge sharing, and encourage the responsible use of approved AI tools and automation to improve collaboration and delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;xs10nj&quot; data-start=&quot;2165&quot; data-end=&quot;2194&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2168&quot; data-end=&quot;2194&quot;&gt;What We’re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2196&quot; data-end=&quot;3056&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1fmcvfx&quot; data-start=&quot;2196&quot; data-end=&quot;2363&quot;&gt;Strong proficiency in &lt;em class=&quot;Highlight ht12570a5c-fe4a-4faf-85ad-9359aedf0c1d&quot;&gt;Python&lt;/em&gt;, &lt;em class=&quot;Highlight ht12570a5c-fe4a-4faf-85ad-9359aedf0c1d&quot;&gt;Scala&lt;/em&gt;, or &lt;em class=&quot;Highlight ht12570a5c-fe4a-4faf-85ad-9359aedf0c1d&quot;&gt;Java&lt;/em&gt; with hands-on experience in Big Data technologies including &lt;em class=&quot;Highlight ht12570a5c-fe4a-4faf-85ad-9359aedf0c1d&quot;&gt;Spark&lt;/em&gt;, &lt;em class=&quot;Highlight ht12570a5c-fe4a-4faf-85ad-9359aedf0c1d&quot;&gt;Hadoop&lt;/em&gt;, or similar distributed processing frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;4zcd4b&quot; data-start=&quot;2364&quot; data-end=&quot;2525&quot;&gt;Practical experience building real-time event streaming pipelines using technologies such as &lt;em class=&quot;Highlight ht54955a67-6e32-48ce-af21-6c3fae6b68c4&quot;&gt;Kafka&lt;/em&gt;, &lt;em class=&quot;Highlight ht12570a5c-fe4a-4faf-85ad-9359aedf0c1d&quot;&gt;Spark&lt;/em&gt; Streaming, or Amazon Kinesis within &lt;em class=&quot;Highlight ht12570a5c-fe4a-4faf-85ad-9359aedf0c1d&quot;&gt;AWS&lt;/em&gt; environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1qpon6y&quot; data-start=&quot;2526&quot; data-end=&quot;2708&quot;&gt;Proven expertise designing modern Data &lt;em class=&quot;Highlight ht12570a5c-fe4a-4faf-85ad-9359aedf0c1d&quot;&gt;Lakehouse&lt;/em&gt; and Data &lt;em class=&quot;Highlight ht12570a5c-fe4a-4faf-85ad-9359aedf0c1d&quot;&gt;Warehousing&lt;/em&gt; architectures, alongside a solid understanding of CI/CD, DevOps practices, and GDPR-compliant data governance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;14opsxg&quot; data-start=&quot;2709&quot; data-end=&quot;2914&quot;&gt;Experience delivering scalable cloud-based data solutions and using AI-enabled tools responsibly to improve engineering efficiency while maintaining appropriate human oversight and quality assurance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1hwma6l&quot; data-start=&quot;2915&quot; data-end=&quot;3056&quot;&gt;Strong communication and collaboration skills, with the ability to work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and client environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;prnxb8&quot; data-start=&quot;3058&quot; data-end=&quot;3081&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3061&quot; data-end=&quot;3081&quot;&gt;Bonus Points For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;3083&quot; data-end=&quot;3645&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j7vkv1&quot; data-start=&quot;3083&quot; data-end=&quot;3186&quot;&gt;Expertise in data modelling, schema design, and working with structured and semi-structured datasets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;lsxdo3&quot; data-start=&quot;3187&quot; data-end=&quot;3301&quot;&gt;Experience with distributed technologies including &lt;em class=&quot;Highlight ht12570a5c-fe4a-4faf-85ad-9359aedf0c1d&quot;&gt;Hadoop&lt;/em&gt;, &lt;em class=&quot;Highlight ht12570a5c-fe4a-4faf-85ad-9359aedf0c1d&quot;&gt;Spark&lt;/em&gt;, HDFS, &lt;em class=&quot;Highlight ht12570a5c-fe4a-4faf-85ad-9359aedf0c1d&quot;&gt;Hive&lt;/em&gt;, &lt;em class=&quot;Highlight ht12570a5c-fe4a-4faf-85ad-9359aedf0c1d&quot;&gt;Databricks&lt;/em&gt;, or &lt;em class=&quot;Highlight ht12570a5c-fe4a-4faf-85ad-9359aedf0c1d&quot;&gt;AWS&lt;/em&gt; Lake Formation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;s8co8o&quot; data-start=&quot;3302&quot; data-end=&quot;3380&quot;&gt;Knowledge of automating cloud-based ingestion and transformation frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;km15mh&quot; data-start=&quot;3381&quot; data-end=&quot;3494&quot;&gt;Experience delivering data engineering solutions within highly regulated industries such as financial services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;7ke6uw&quot; data-start=&quot;3495&quot; data-end=&quot;3645&quot;&gt;Passion for mentoring others, promoting engineering best practices, and exploring responsible AI and automation to continually improve delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;1lla9of&quot; data-start=&quot;3647&quot; data-end=&quot;3668&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3650&quot; data-end=&quot;3668&quot;&gt;Why Join Capco&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;3670&quot; data-end=&quot;4029&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;2dvy0w&quot; data-start=&quot;3670&quot; data-end=&quot;3747&quot;&gt;Deliver high-impact technology solutions for Tier 1 financial institutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1a87gyn&quot; data-start=&quot;3748&quot; data-end=&quot;3820&quot;&gt;Work in a collaborative, flat, and entrepreneurial consulting culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;bsqn1d&quot; data-start=&quot;3821&quot; data-end=&quot;3889&quot;&gt;Access continuous learning, training, and industry certifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;19cv5mp&quot; data-start=&quot;3890&quot; data-end=&quot;3959&quot;&gt;Be part of a team shaping the future of digital financial services.&lt;/li&gt;
