&lt;h1 data-section-id=&quot;51mf08&quot; data-start=&quot;591&quot; data-end=&quot;627&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Data Analytics – Senior Consultant&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;629&quot; data-end=&quot;718&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: &lt;/strong&gt;London (Hybrid) | &lt;strong&gt;Practice Area:&lt;/strong&gt; Data &amp;amp; Analytics | &lt;strong&gt;Type:&lt;/strong&gt; Permanent&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;720&quot; data-end=&quot;799&quot;&gt;Unlock insights. Empower decisions. Shape the future of financial services.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;1hl1yo8&quot; data-start=&quot;801&quot; data-end=&quot;816&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;804&quot; data-end=&quot;816&quot;&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;818&quot; data-end=&quot;1406&quot;&gt;We&#39;re expanding our UK Data Practice and looking for talented Data Analytics Consultants to join our award-winning team. You&#39;ll lead cutting-edge data transformation programmes for top-tier Financial Services institutions, helping clients unlock value, improve operational efficiency and gain a competitive advantage through data-driven decision-making. You&#39;ll also embrace AI-enabled ways of working, using approved AI tools where appropriate to enhance analysis, accelerate delivery and improve the quality of client outcomes while applying sound judgement and responsible AI practices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;1xihhvk&quot; data-start=&quot;1408&quot; data-end=&quot;1429&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1411&quot; data-end=&quot;1429&quot;&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1431&quot; data-end=&quot;2377&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;2sjbex&quot; data-start=&quot;1431&quot; data-end=&quot;1601&quot;&gt;Lead and deliver complex data analytics initiatives across major Financial Services clients, translating data into meaningful business insights and measurable outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;17ym2ri&quot; data-start=&quot;1602&quot; data-end=&quot;1822&quot;&gt;Apply predictive modelling, segmentation and risk analytics to solve client challenges, leveraging AI-enabled analytical techniques where appropriate to accelerate insight generation and support better decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1tehwlt&quot; data-start=&quot;1823&quot; data-end=&quot;1981&quot;&gt;Design and develop dashboards using Power BI, Qlik or Tableau, delivering intuitive visualisations that enable business stakeholders to act with confidence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;sv0e1l&quot; data-start=&quot;1982&quot; data-end=&quot;2170&quot;&gt;Interpret large, complex datasets and provide actionable recommendations through advanced analytical techniques, combining technical expertise with critical thinking and human judgement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1wdzouv&quot; data-start=&quot;2171&quot; data-end=&quot;2377&quot;&gt;Support the growth of Capco&#39;s UK and Global Data Practice by contributing to innovation across analytics, AI and machine learning, sharing knowledge and encouraging modern, AI-enabled delivery approaches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;u9wmb5&quot; data-start=&quot;2379&quot; data-end=&quot;2408&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2382&quot; data-end=&quot;2408&quot;&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
