&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;yaboum&quot; data-start=&quot;2410&quot; data-end=&quot;2530&quot;&gt;Strong ability to acquire, manipulate, analyse and interpret large volumes of complex data to solve business problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;150wxs0&quot; data-start=&quot;2531&quot; data-end=&quot;2690&quot;&gt;Experience delivering predictive and diagnostic analytics across areas such as customer lifetime value, risk scoring, financial crime or marketing analytics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;b85ako&quot; data-start=&quot;2691&quot; data-end=&quot;2902&quot;&gt;Technical proficiency with SQL databases and analytical tools such as Python, R or Spark, with an openness to using approved AI-assisted capabilities to improve productivity and code quality where appropriate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;19jlcbv&quot; data-start=&quot;2903&quot; data-end=&quot;3096&quot;&gt;Strong experience developing dashboards and data visualisations using Power BI, Qlik or Tableau, with the ability to communicate insights effectively to technical and non-technical audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;oyr3f6&quot; data-start=&quot;3097&quot; data-end=&quot;3346&quot;&gt;Experience within Financial Services, including Capital Markets, Insurance or Wealth &amp;amp; Asset Management, alongside experience leading or mentoring small teams and an understanding of responsible data and AI practices within regulated environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
