&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1450&quot; data-end=&quot;2240&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;7pqsax&quot; data-start=&quot;1450&quot; data-end=&quot;1580&quot;&gt;Design and develop robust data pipelines using Delta Lake, &lt;em class=&quot;Highlight ht12570a5c-fe4a-4faf-85ad-9359aedf0c1d&quot;&gt;Spark&lt;/em&gt; Structured Streaming, Unity Catalog, and &lt;em class=&quot;Highlight ht12570a5c-fe4a-4faf-85ad-9359aedf0c1d&quot;&gt;Azure&lt;/em&gt;-native services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;iu8mcb&quot; data-start=&quot;1581&quot; data-end=&quot;1774&quot;&gt;Build real-time, event-driven solutions using technologies such as &lt;em class=&quot;Highlight ht54955a67-6e32-48ce-af21-6c3fae6b68c4&quot;&gt;Kafka&lt;/em&gt; and &lt;em class=&quot;Highlight ht12570a5c-fe4a-4faf-85ad-9359aedf0c1d&quot;&gt;Azure&lt;/em&gt; Event Hubs, applying AI-enabled engineering approaches where appropriate to improve delivery efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1upcfx5&quot; data-start=&quot;1775&quot; data-end=&quot;1919&quot;&gt;Develop and maintain CI/CD pipelines using &lt;em class=&quot;Highlight ht12570a5c-fe4a-4faf-85ad-9359aedf0c1d&quot;&gt;Azure&lt;/em&gt; DevOps, Jenkins, GitHub Actions, and modern DevOps practices to support reliable deployments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;dqrea2&quot; data-start=&quot;1920&quot; data-end=&quot;2057&quot;&gt;Collaborate with clients and multidisciplinary teams to translate business requirements into scalable, production-ready data solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;yhecez&quot; data-start=&quot;2058&quot; data-end=&quot;2240&quot;&gt;Champion clean code, data lifecycle optimisation, engineering best practices, and the responsible use of approved AI tools and automation to improve collaboration and delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
