&lt;p data-start=&quot;101&quot; data-end=&quot;238&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;101&quot; data-end=&quot;144&quot;&gt;Senior AI Engineer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br data-start=&quot;144&quot; data-end=&quot;147&quot;&gt;Location: London (Hybrid) | &lt;strong data-start=&quot;175&quot; data-end=&quot;192&quot;&gt;Practice Area&lt;/strong&gt;: Technology &amp;amp; Engineering | Type: Permanent&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;240&quot; data-end=&quot;346&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;240&quot; data-end=&quot;346&quot;&gt;Empower the next frontier of AI with Capco. Shape, build, and deliver future-ready generative systems.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a Senior AI Engineer (Senior/Principal Consultant) to join our Technology Delivery team. In this role, you’ll combine deep expertise in AI/ML engineering and software development to design, build, and deploy advanced generative AI and agentic systems for leading financial services clients.&amp;nbsp;You’ll work hands-on across the full AI engineering lifecycle, from architecting intelligent multi-agent systems to deploying scalable production-grade AI applications within enterprise environments. As a senior consultant, you’ll also collaborate closely with multidisciplinary teams and client stakeholders to drive innovation, accelerate adoption, and deliver measurable business impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Architect and develop autonomous AI systems leveraging multi-modal large language models across text, image, audio, and video&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and implement agentic workflows using prompt engineering, Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG), APIs, and enterprise data integrations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fine-tune, optimize, and deploy large language and multi-modal models with a focus on scalability, reliability, and low-latency performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build scalable MLOps pipelines and cloud-native AI applications to support secure, production-grade deployments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with clients and cross-functional teams to shape AI engineering strategy and accelerate GenAI adoption across complex environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree or higher in Computer Science, Artificial Intelligence, Engineering, or a related STEM discipline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven hands-on experience deploying LLMs and multi-modal AI models within enterprise or large-scale production environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong software engineering expertise in Python, including backend development, API design, and distributed systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of scalable MLOps, observability, CI/CD practices, and cloud-native AI deployment architectures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication, stakeholder management, and problem-solving skills within agile delivery environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building AI agent frameworks or autonomous orchestration platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of vector databases, semantic search, and advanced RAG architectures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with cloud platforms such as AWS, Azure, or GCP for AI workloads&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with financial services, banking, or regulated enterprise environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to AI governance, model monitoring, and responsible AI practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Capco&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver high-impact technology solutions for Tier 1 financial institutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work in a collaborative, flat, and entrepreneurial consulting culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access continuous learning, training, and industry certifications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be part of a team shaping the future of digital financial services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help shape the future of digital transformation across FS &amp;amp; Energy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2662&quot; data-end=&quot;2674&quot;&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br data-start=&quot;2674&quot; data-end=&quot;2677&quot;&gt;We offer a competitive, people-first benefits package designed to support every aspect of your life:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Core Benefits: &lt;/strong&gt;Discretionary bonus, competitive pension, health insurance, life insurance and critical illness cover.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mental Health:&lt;/strong&gt; Easy access to CareFirst, Unmind, Aviva consultations, and in-house first aiders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Family-Friendly:&lt;/strong&gt; Maternity, adoption, shared parental leave, plus paid leave for sickness, pregnancy loss, fertility treatment, menopause, and bereavement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Family Care:&lt;/strong&gt; 8 complimentary backup care sessions for emergency childcare or elder care.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Holiday Flexibility&lt;/strong&gt;: 5 weeks of annual leave with the option to buy or sell holiday days based on your needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Continuous Learning:&lt;/strong&gt; Your growth, your way - minimum 40 Hours of Training Annually. Take your pick; workshops, certifications, e-learning. Also, Business Coach assigned from Day One: Get one-on-one guidance to fast-track your goals and accelerate your development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Healthcare Access&lt;/strong&gt;: Convenient online GP services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Extra Perks:&lt;/strong&gt; Gympass (Wellhub), travel insurance, Tastecard, season ticket loans, Cycle to Work, and dental insurance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3852&quot; data-end=&quot;4369&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3852&quot; data-end=&quot;3874&quot;&gt;Inclusion at Capco&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br data-start=&quot;3874&quot; data-end=&quot;3877&quot;&gt;We’re committed to making our recruitment process accessible and straightforward for everyone. If you need any adjustments at any stage, just let us know - we’ll be happy to help. We value each person’s unique perspective and contribution. At Capco, we believe that being yourself is your greatest strength. Our #BeYourselfAtWork culture encourages individuality and collaboration – a mindset that shapes how we work with clients and each other every day.&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Principal Payments Architect&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: London (Hybrid) | Practice Area: Technology &amp;amp; Engineering | Type: Permanent&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Lead innovative payments transformation across financial services.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Capco&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Capco is a global leader in technology and business consulting, dedicated to driving digital innovation and transformation in financial services. We’ve partnered with over 100 clients worldwide - from pioneering FinTech&#39;s to established global institutions - helping them adapt, compete, and scale in a rapidly evolving industry. With more than 30 offices globally, we combine deep expertise in banking, payments, capital markets, insurance, wealth and asset management, and energy with an agile, inclusive, and entrepreneurial culture.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;1547&quot; data-end=&quot;2101&quot;&gt;You will play a central role in shaping and delivering some of our clients&#39; most critical payments transformation programmes, applying your expertise in enterprise and solution architecture alongside your deep knowledge of payments. You will help modernise core payment platforms and enable new digital payment capabilities while guiding clients through complex regulatory, operational, and technology change. Your work will influence how banks and financial institutions build, operate, and innovate across domestic and international payment ecosystems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2103&quot; data-end=&quot;2806&quot;&gt;Working closely with engineers, you will design scalable and resilient payment solutions while helping senior stakeholders shape long-term payments strategies and investment decisions. You will also lead high-performing teams, mentor junior technologists, and contribute to the growth of our Technology &amp;amp; Engineering Practice through thought leadership, community engagement, and supporting new client opportunities. You&#39;ll be encouraged to adopt approved AI-enabled tools and automation to enhance architecture design, accelerate analysis, improve documentation quality and support more informed decision-making, while applying appropriate human judgement, governance and responsible AI principles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1tzcido&quot; data-start=&quot;2831&quot; data-end=&quot;3032&quot;&gt;Lead the architecture and modernisation of complex payment platforms across domestic, international, real-time, on-us and card payment ecosystems, delivering scalable, resilient and secure solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;184q86g&quot; data-start=&quot;3033&quot; data-end=&quot;3240&quot;&gt;Define payments technology strategies, target architectures and transformation roadmaps while working closely with business, engineering and delivery teams to guide implementation and investment decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;6tzybc&quot; data-start=&quot;3241&quot; data-end=&quot;3522&quot;&gt;Apply modern architecture practices including microservices, event-driven design, cloud-native technologies and DevOps, leveraging approved AI-enabled workflows where appropriate to improve productivity, design quality and delivery outcomes while maintaining human oversight.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1sw18si&quot; data-start=&quot;3523&quot; data-end=&quot;3722&quot;&gt;Build trusted relationships with senior client stakeholders, mentor technical teams and contribute to Capco&#39;s Technology &amp;amp; Engineering community through thought leadership and business development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;wy2twa&quot; data-start=&quot;3723&quot; data-end=&quot;3925&quot;&gt;Ensure architectural decisions align with regulatory requirements, security, resilience, governance and responsible AI principles where AI-enabled capabilities form part of the solution landscape.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1kueo3&quot; data-start=&quot;3958&quot; data-end=&quot;4126&quot;&gt;Proven experience designing or modernising payment platforms across Faster Payments, Bacs, CHAPS, SWIFT, SEPA, Open Banking, ISO 20022 and related payment ecosystems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;un8nb3&quot; data-start=&quot;4127&quot; data-end=&quot;4320&quot;&gt;Deep expertise in enterprise and solution architecture, distributed systems, cloud technologies, modern engineering practices and recognised frameworks such as TOGAF and Domain-Driven Design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1ta949w&quot; data-start=&quot;4321&quot; data-end=&quot;4468&quot;&gt;Strong consulting, stakeholder management and leadership experience with the ability to influence senior technology and business decision-makers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1j6p7jk&quot; data-start=&quot;4469&quot; data-end=&quot;4608&quot;&gt;Experience delivering large-scale payments transformation programmes using agile delivery methodologies and modern engineering practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;uf15dy&quot; data-start=&quot;4609&quot; data-end=&quot;4852&quot;&gt;A curiosity for AI-enabled ways of working and an understanding of how approved AI tools, automation and responsible AI governance can improve architectural delivery while maintaining appropriate review, auditability and human judgement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;9fmxsi&quot; data-start=&quot;4879&quot; data-end=&quot;4968&quot;&gt;Senior consulting experience delivering large-scale payments transformation programmes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;u6q66x&quot; data-start=&quot;4969&quot; data-end=&quot;5048&quot;&gt;Experience leading pre-sales engagements, proposals and commercial estimates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;lorjzp&quot; data-start=&quot;5049&quot; data-end=&quot;5276&quot;&gt;Awareness of emerging technologies including digital wallets, tokenisation, embedded finance and AI (including Generative AI and Agentic AI), AI-driven fraud detection and intelligent automation within payment ecosystems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1o55480&quot; data-start=&quot;5277&quot; data-end=&quot;5374&quot;&gt;Knowledge of financial crime, AML controls, payment fraud prevention and security architecture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1j6y0qv&quot; data-start=&quot;5375&quot; data-end=&quot;5493&quot;&gt;Exposure to international payment ecosystems and relevant architecture or cloud certifications such as TOGAF or AWS.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Capco?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Capco, you’ll be part of a collaborative, entrepreneurial, and inclusive culture working with Tier 1 financial services enterprises on impactful and enriching projects. We offer a competitive, people-first benefits package to support your growth as both a technologist and a consultant.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our benefits include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Core benefits: &lt;/strong&gt;discretionary bonus, competitive pension, health and dental insurance, life insurance, and critical illness cover.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mental health: &lt;/strong&gt;access to CareFirst, Unmind, Aviva consultations, and in-house first aiders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Family-friendly: &lt;/strong&gt;maternity, adoption, shared parental leave, plus paid leave for sickness, pregnancy loss, fertility treatment, menopause, and bereavement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Family care: &lt;/strong&gt;8 complimentary backup care sessions for emergency childcare or elder care.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Holiday flexibility: &lt;/strong&gt;5 weeks of annual leave with the option to buy or sell days.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Continuous learning: &lt;/strong&gt;minimum 40 hours of annual training, including workshops, certifications, e-learning, and ongoing business coaching.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Extra perks: &lt;/strong&gt;Gympass (Wellhub), travel insurance, Tastecard, season ticket loans, and Cycle to Work scheme.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inclusion at Capco&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We’re committed to making our recruitment process accessible and straightforward. If you need adjustments at any stage, please let us know. We value each person’s unique perspective and contribution. At Capco, we believe that being yourself is your greatest strength. Our #BeYourselfAtWork culture encourages individuality and collaboration—a mindset that shapes how we work with clients and each other every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We have been informed of recruitment scams targeting the public.&amp;nbsp;Always verify identities before engaging in recruitment communication. All&amp;nbsp;official Capco&amp;nbsp;communication will be conducted via a Capco recruiter.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;#LI-DNI&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;h1 class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-section-id=&quot;1u1crfv&quot; data-start=&quot;516&quot; data-end=&quot;547&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Principal Data Engineer – &lt;em class=&quot;Highlight ht12570a5c-fe4a-4faf-85ad-9359aedf0c1d&quot;&gt;AWS&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;549&quot; data-end=&quot;646&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;549&quot; data-end=&quot;562&quot;&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; London (Hybrid) | &lt;strong data-start=&quot;581&quot; data-end=&quot;599&quot;&gt;Practice Area:&lt;/strong&gt; Technology &amp;amp; Engineering | &lt;strong data-start=&quot;627&quot; data-end=&quot;636&quot;&gt;Type:&lt;/strong&gt; Permanent&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;648&quot; data-end=&quot;725&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;648&quot; data-end=&quot;725&quot;&gt;Engineer future-ready data platforms that power financial transformation.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;1hl1yo8&quot; data-start=&quot;727&quot; data-end=&quot;742&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;730&quot; data-end=&quot;742&quot;&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;744&quot; data-end=&quot;1522&quot;&gt;We’re looking for a Principal Data Engineer with &lt;em class=&quot;Highlight ht12570a5c-fe4a-4faf-85ad-9359aedf0c1d&quot;&gt;AWS&lt;/em&gt; to join our growing team of engineering experts driving &lt;em class=&quot;Highlight hte8d84c36-3d11-4b5d-af91-f34d644d37f4&quot;&gt;next&lt;/em&gt;-generation transformation for Tier 1 financial services clients. You’ll play a pivotal role in designing, building, and deploying cloud-based data pipelines that enable trusted, scalable data platforms. Working across greenfield initiatives and enterprise-scale programmes, your work will directly influence how data is ingested, transformed, and consumed across the financial services industry. You&#39;ll also embrace AI-enabled ways of working, using approved AI and automation tools where appropriate to enhance productivity, improve delivery quality, and accelerate engineering outcomes while applying sound engineering judgement and responsible AI practices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;1uboqym&quot; data-start=&quot;1524&quot; data-end=&quot;1545&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1527&quot; data-end=&quot;1545&quot;&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1547&quot; data-end=&quot;2368&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1tshnfo&quot; data-start=&quot;1547&quot; data-end=&quot;1706&quot;&gt;Design and build end-to-end data pipelines using &lt;em class=&quot;Highlight ht12570a5c-fe4a-4faf-85ad-9359aedf0c1d&quot;&gt;AWS&lt;/em&gt;-native services and modern cloud data architectures, ensuring scalable, secure, and resilient solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;t2fg2h&quot; data-start=&quot;1707&quot; data-end=&quot;1866&quot;&gt;Partner with clients and cross-functional teams to understand business requirements, define technical solutions, and deliver production-grade data platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;uvcvlu&quot; data-start=&quot;1867&quot; data-end=&quot;2044&quot;&gt;Apply &lt;em class=&quot;Highlight ht12570a5c-fe4a-4faf-85ad-9359aedf0c1d&quot;&gt;AWS&lt;/em&gt; Well-Architected Principles, engineering best practices, CI/CD, and AI-enabled development approaches to improve quality, efficiency, and operational excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;ciokzc&quot; data-start=&quot;2045&quot; data-end=&quot;2194&quot;&gt;Lead the development of robust, tested, fault-tolerant data engineering solutions while promoting responsible engineering standards and governance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;22f9c0&quot; data-start=&quot;2195&quot; data-end=&quot;2368&quot;&gt;Mentor engineers, share technical expertise, and encourage the effective and responsible use of approved AI tools and automation to enhance collaboration and delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;xs10nj&quot; data-start=&quot;2370&quot; data-end=&quot;2399&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2373&quot; data-end=&quot;2399&quot;&gt;What We’re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2401&quot; data-end=&quot;3289&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;pncgr3&quot; data-start=&quot;2401&quot; data-end=&quot;2569&quot;&gt;Strong proficiency in &lt;em class=&quot;Highlight ht12570a5c-fe4a-4faf-85ad-9359aedf0c1d&quot;&gt;Python&lt;/em&gt;, &lt;em class=&quot;Highlight ht12570a5c-fe4a-4faf-85ad-9359aedf0c1d&quot;&gt;Scala&lt;/em&gt;, or &lt;em class=&quot;Highlight ht12570a5c-fe4a-4faf-85ad-9359aedf0c1d&quot;&gt;Java&lt;/em&gt;, with hands-on experience of Big Data technologies including &lt;em class=&quot;Highlight ht12570a5c-fe4a-4faf-85ad-9359aedf0c1d&quot;&gt;Spark&lt;/em&gt;, &lt;em class=&quot;Highlight ht12570a5c-fe4a-4faf-85ad-9359aedf0c1d&quot;&gt;Hadoop&lt;/em&gt;, or similar distributed processing frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1x2g63n&quot; data-start=&quot;2570&quot; data-end=&quot;2721&quot;&gt;Experience building real-time event streaming solutions using technologies such as &lt;em class=&quot;Highlight ht54955a67-6e32-48ce-af21-6c3fae6b68c4&quot;&gt;Kafka&lt;/em&gt;, &lt;em class=&quot;Highlight ht12570a5c-fe4a-4faf-85ad-9359aedf0c1d&quot;&gt;Spark&lt;/em&gt; Streaming, or Amazon Kinesis within &lt;em class=&quot;Highlight ht12570a5c-fe4a-4faf-85ad-9359aedf0c1d&quot;&gt;AWS&lt;/em&gt; environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;2ajmmb&quot; data-start=&quot;2722&quot; data-end=&quot;2904&quot;&gt;Proven expertise designing modern data architectures including Data &lt;em class=&quot;Highlight ht12570a5c-fe4a-4faf-85ad-9359aedf0c1d&quot;&gt;Lakehouse&lt;/em&gt; and Data &lt;em class=&quot;Highlight ht12570a5c-fe4a-4faf-85ad-9359aedf0c1d&quot;&gt;Warehousing&lt;/em&gt; solutions, alongside CI/CD, DevOps practices, and data governance including GDPR.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;11bz0d0&quot; data-start=&quot;2905&quot; data-end=&quot;3142&quot;&gt;A collaborative engineering mindset with experience delivering scalable cloud solutions and using AI-enabled tools responsibly to improve engineering productivity while maintaining appropriate human oversight and quality assurance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;13wf0lm&quot; data-start=&quot;3143&quot; data-end=&quot;3289&quot;&gt;Excellent stakeholder communication skills with the ability to translate business requirements into practical, high-quality technical solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;prnxb8&quot; data-start=&quot;3291&quot; data-end=&quot;3314&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3294&quot; data-end=&quot;3314&quot;&gt;Bonus Points For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;3316&quot; data-end=&quot;3882&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j7vkv1&quot; data-start=&quot;3316&quot; data-end=&quot;3419&quot;&gt;Expertise in data modelling, schema design, and working with structured and semi-structured datasets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;lsxdo3&quot; data-start=&quot;3420&quot; data-end=&quot;3534&quot;&gt;Experience with distributed technologies including &lt;em class=&quot;Highlight ht12570a5c-fe4a-4faf-85ad-9359aedf0c1d&quot;&gt;Hadoop&lt;/em&gt;, &lt;em class=&quot;Highlight ht12570a5c-fe4a-4faf-85ad-9359aedf0c1d&quot;&gt;Spark&lt;/em&gt;, HDFS, &lt;em class=&quot;Highlight ht12570a5c-fe4a-4faf-85ad-9359aedf0c1d&quot;&gt;Hive&lt;/em&gt;, &lt;em class=&quot;Highlight ht12570a5c-fe4a-4faf-85ad-9359aedf0c1d&quot;&gt;Databricks&lt;/em&gt;, or &lt;em class=&quot;Highlight ht12570a5c-fe4a-4faf-85ad-9359aedf0c1d&quot;&gt;AWS&lt;/em&gt; Lake Formation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1am4w6p&quot; data-start=&quot;3535&quot; data-end=&quot;3636&quot;&gt;Knowledge of automating ingestion and transformation frameworks within cloud-native data platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;xvnu1c&quot; data-start=&quot;3637&quot; data-end=&quot;3733&quot;&gt;Experience delivering solutions within highly regulated industries such as financial services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;cnen9m&quot; data-start=&quot;3734&quot; data-end=&quot;3882&quot;&gt;Passion for mentoring others, driving engineering best practices, and exploring responsible AI and automation to continually improve delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;1lla9of&quot; data-start=&quot;3884&quot; data-end=&quot;3905&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3887&quot; data-end=&quot;3905&quot;&gt;Why Join Capco&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;3907&quot; data-end=&quot;4282&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;2dvy0w&quot; data-start=&quot;3907&quot; data-end=&quot;3984&quot;&gt;Deliver high-impact technology solutions for Tier 1 financial institutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1a87gyn&quot; data-start=&quot;3985&quot; data-end=&quot;4057&quot;&gt;Work in a collaborative, flat, and entrepreneurial consulting culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;bsqn1d&quot; data-start=&quot;4058&quot; data-end=&quot;4126&quot;&gt;Access continuous learning, training, and industry certifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;19cv5mp&quot; data-start=&quot;4127&quot; data-end=&quot;4196&quot;&gt;Be part of a team shaping the future of digital financial services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;16f0ika&quot; data-start=&quot;4197&quot; data-end=&quot;4282&quot;&gt;Help shape the future of digital transformation across Financial Services &amp;amp; Energy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;4301&quot; data-end=&quot;4401&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;4301&quot; data-end=&quot;4401&quot;&gt;We offer a competitive, people-first benefits package designed to support every aspect of your life:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;4403&quot; data-end=&quot;5386&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1sfk404&quot; data-start=&quot;4403&quot; data-end=&quot;4526&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;4405&quot; data-end=&quot;4423&quot;&gt;Core Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt; Discretionary bonus, competitive pension, health insurance, life insurance and critical illness cover.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1yaj5pw&quot; data-start=&quot;4527&quot; data-end=&quot;4629&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;4529&quot; data-end=&quot;4547&quot;&gt;Mental Health:&lt;/strong&gt; Easy access to CareFirst, Unmind, Aviva consultations, and in-house first aiders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1pqxiiz&quot; data-start=&quot;4630&quot; data-end=&quot;4791&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;4632&quot; data-end=&quot;4652&quot;&gt;Family-Friendly:&lt;/strong&gt; Maternity, adoption, shared parental leave, plus paid leave for sickness, pregnancy loss, fertility treatment, menopause, and bereavement.&lt;/li&gt;
