&lt;p data-start=&quot;286&quot; data-end=&quot;972&quot;&gt;Capco is seeking experienced Principal Consultants with deep expertise in Non-Financial Risk to join our growing Finance, Risk, Regulatory &amp;amp; Financial Crime (FRRF) capability. In this senior role, you&#39;ll lead complex client engagements, advise senior stakeholders, and play a key role in shaping and delivering enterprise and operational risk transformation initiatives. Acting as a trusted advisor, you&#39;ll contribute to capability growth, proposition development, and team leadership while leveraging approved AI tools and AI-enabled ways of working to enhance analysis, improve delivery, and strengthen decision-making through responsible AI practices and appropriate human oversight.&lt;/p&gt;
