&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;or6oqv&quot; data-start=&quot;2348&quot; data-end=&quot;2489&quot;&gt;Strong understanding of cyber security frameworks such as NIST and ISO 27001, together with regulatory expectations including PRA and DORA.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1tepv3c&quot; data-start=&quot;2490&quot; data-end=&quot;2639&quot;&gt;Practical experience delivering resilience testing, control assessments, remediation programmes, and technology-enabled transformation initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
