&lt;p data-start=&quot;686&quot; data-end=&quot;753&quot;&gt;Lead the strategy. Grow the practice. Redefine data excellence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;1hl1yo8&quot; data-start=&quot;755&quot; data-end=&quot;770&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;The Role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;772&quot; data-end=&quot;1345&quot;&gt;Capco is seeking a visionary Data Analytics Lead at Managing Principal level to spearhead the strategy and growth of our award-winning Data Practice. You&#39;ll lead a team of multidisciplinary practitioners delivering high-impact analytics, AI and data science programmes across the Financial Services sector. This leadership role combines business development, client engagement, capability growth and proposition innovation while championing AI-enabled ways of working that improve client outcomes, accelerate delivery and foster responsible AI adoption across the practice.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;1xihhvk&quot; data-start=&quot;1347&quot; data-end=&quot;1368&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
