&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1t41e22&quot; data-start=&quot;2451&quot; data-end=&quot;2644&quot;&gt;8+ years of consulting experience, currently operating at Senior Management, Director or Managing Principal level, with a proven track record of leading large-scale transformation programmes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;ogcxa4&quot; data-start=&quot;2645&quot; data-end=&quot;2800&quot;&gt;Demonstrated success in building senior client relationships, developing strategic partnerships and securing data- and AI-related business opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;r96gs4&quot; data-start=&quot;2801&quot; data-end=&quot;2928&quot;&gt;Deep expertise across enterprise data domains, including data strategy, governance, privacy, analytics and AI transformation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1nfw60u&quot; data-start=&quot;2929&quot; data-end=&quot;3159&quot;&gt;Strong understanding of data science, AI, Generative AI, MLOps, business intelligence, responsible AI, AI governance and modern analytics operating models, with the ability to translate emerging technologies into business value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;4xqan4&quot; data-start=&quot;3160&quot; data-end=&quot;3377&quot;&gt;Proven experience leading complex data transformation initiatives within Financial Services while enabling multidisciplinary teams to adopt AI-enabled ways of working with appropriate human oversight and governance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
