&lt;p data-start=&quot;278&quot; data-end=&quot;1029&quot;&gt;Capco is seeking a Financial Risk Transformation Principal Consultant (Senior Manager) to join our growing Finance, Risk, Regulatory &amp;amp; Financial Crime (FRRF) capability. In this role, you&#39;ll lead strategic client engagements, advise senior stakeholders including Chief Risk Officers, and drive transformation across risk functions. You&#39;ll play a key role in shaping large-scale programmes spanning liquidity, credit, market, and model risk, helping clients modernise their risk capabilities through data, technology, automation, and AI-enabled ways of working. You&#39;ll leverage approved AI tools to enhance insight, improve delivery efficiency, and support better decision-making while applying responsible AI practices and appropriate human oversight.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1031&quot; data-end=&quot;1049&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1031&quot; data-end=&quot;1049&quot;&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
