&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;qie9dk&quot; data-start=&quot;1272&quot; data-end=&quot;1475&quot;&gt;Advise senior stakeholders on regulatory frameworks including Basel, IFRS 9, and BCBS 239, translating regulatory requirements into practical transformation strategies and sustainable operating models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;jq6uer&quot; data-start=&quot;1476&quot; data-end=&quot;1670&quot;&gt;Design and implement enhanced risk controls, target operating models, governance frameworks, and data-driven reporting solutions that strengthen regulatory compliance and business performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;eh2wz6&quot; data-start=&quot;1671&quot; data-end=&quot;1870&quot;&gt;Drive the responsible adoption of AI, automation, and advanced analytics to improve risk processes, reporting, forecasting, and decision-making while ensuring appropriate governance and validation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;zm5hxv&quot; data-start=&quot;1871&quot; data-end=&quot;2027&quot;&gt;Contribute to business development, proposition development, client relationship growth, and the continued expansion of Capco&#39;s Financial Risk capability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
