&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;y1n622&quot; data-start=&quot;2184&quot; data-end=&quot;2350&quot;&gt;Deep expertise across liquidity risk, credit risk, market risk, and model risk, with strong knowledge of Basel, IFRS 9, BCBS 239, and related regulatory frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;158kt5w&quot; data-start=&quot;2351&quot; data-end=&quot;2511&quot;&gt;Proven experience leading complex transformation programmes and influencing senior stakeholders, including Chief Risk Officers and executive leadership teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1sm8l0e&quot; data-start=&quot;2512&quot; data-end=&quot;2692&quot;&gt;Strong analytical and strategic problem-solving skills, with experience using approved AI tools and automation to enhance delivery while maintaining sound professional judgement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1kd7gds&quot; data-start=&quot;2693&quot; data-end=&quot;2850&quot;&gt;Excellent communication and stakeholder management skills with the ability to translate complex risk challenges into practical, business-focused solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
