&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1vqdpdf&quot; data-start=&quot;3121&quot; data-end=&quot;3252&quot;&gt;Experience with enterprise data architecture, risk technology platforms, model implementation, or regulatory reporting solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;t16pp7&quot; data-start=&quot;3253&quot; data-end=&quot;3356&quot;&gt;Leadership experience including mentoring, coaching, and developing high-performing consulting teams.&lt;/li&gt;
