&lt;h1 class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-section-id=&quot;129nh90&quot; data-start=&quot;540&quot; data-end=&quot;596&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Data &amp;amp; AI Strategy Consultant – Manager/Senior Manager&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;598&quot; data-end=&quot;687&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;598&quot; data-end=&quot;611&quot;&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; London (Hybrid) | &lt;strong data-start=&quot;630&quot; data-end=&quot;648&quot;&gt;Practice Area:&lt;/strong&gt; Data &amp;amp; Analytics | &lt;strong data-start=&quot;668&quot; data-end=&quot;677&quot;&gt;Type:&lt;/strong&gt; Permanent&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;689&quot; data-end=&quot;771&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;689&quot; data-end=&quot;771&quot;&gt;Craft bold strategies. Inspire data-driven transformation. Lead the AI future.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;1hl1yo8&quot; data-start=&quot;773&quot; data-end=&quot;788&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;776&quot; data-end=&quot;788&quot;&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;790&quot; data-end=&quot;1358&quot;&gt;Join Capco&#39;s Data Strategy &amp;amp; Advisory team as a Manager or Senior Manager, shaping enterprise-level AI and data strategies for the world&#39;s leading financial institutions. This is a high-impact role for strategic thinkers passionate about the intersection of data, AI and business value. You will guide clients in envisioning and realising AI-driven competitive advantage—beyond tooling and beyond pipelines—while helping organisations adopt AI-enabled ways of working responsibly, balancing innovation with governance, human judgement and measurable business outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;1xihhvk&quot; data-start=&quot;1360&quot; data-end=&quot;1381&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1363&quot; data-end=&quot;1381&quot;&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1383&quot; data-end=&quot;2479&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1f224n1&quot; data-start=&quot;1383&quot; data-end=&quot;1576&quot;&gt;Partner with C-suite clients to define strategic AI ambitions, aligning enterprise data and AI capabilities with business priorities, competitive differentiation and long-term value creation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;os8ecn&quot; data-start=&quot;1577&quot; data-end=&quot;1800&quot;&gt;Act as a subject matter expert on emerging AI and data technologies, advising clients on how to responsibly adopt innovations—including Generative AI, &lt;em class=&quot;Highlight hta855f6c2-8a5b-4f83-9ca4-0b69c35a796e&quot;&gt;Agentic&lt;/em&gt; AI and intelligent automation—to accelerate business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;185i23v&quot; data-start=&quot;1801&quot; data-end=&quot;2011&quot;&gt;Lead the definition of enterprise data and AI strategies, identifying high-value use cases and translating them into practical roadmaps that balance opportunity, risk, governance and organisational readiness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;15v2o2b&quot; data-start=&quot;2012&quot; data-end=&quot;2266&quot;&gt;Facilitate executive workshops, visioning sessions and strategic decision-making, developing compelling board-level narratives and investment cases while using AI-enabled insights and approved AI tools to enhance analysis and strategic recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1l2zye8&quot; data-start=&quot;2267&quot; data-end=&quot;2479&quot;&gt;Collaborate across Capco&#39;s Engineering, Architecture, Risk, Product, Innovation and Data teams to ensure strategic recommendations are actionable, commercially viable and aligned with responsible AI principles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2481&quot; data-end=&quot;2523&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2481&quot; data-end=&quot;2523&quot;&gt;Beyond client delivery, you will also:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2525&quot; data-end=&quot;3064&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1d7773&quot; data-start=&quot;2525&quot; data-end=&quot;2664&quot;&gt;Contribute to Capco&#39;s perspective on how AI is reshaping the financial services value chain and help develop market-leading propositions.&lt;/li&gt;
