&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;4lm0im&quot; data-start=&quot;2802&quot; data-end=&quot;2938&quot;&gt;Mentor colleagues, fostering strategic thinking, innovation and the effective use of AI-enabled ways of working across the wider team.&lt;/li&gt;
