&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Strategy &amp;amp; Transformation – Managing Principal&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: &lt;/strong&gt;London (Hybrid) | &lt;strong&gt;Practice Area: &lt;/strong&gt;Data &amp;amp; Analytics |&lt;strong&gt; Type: &lt;/strong&gt;Permanent&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Shape the Future of AI Strategy for the World&#39;s Leading Financial Institutions&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;The Role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for an experienced Managing Principal to join Capco&#39;s AI Strategy &amp;amp; Transformation practice. In this senior leadership role, you&#39;ll partner with C-suite executives across leading financial institutions to define AI strategies, shape enterprise transformation agendas and deliver measurable business value through responsible AI adoption.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll combine strategic advisory expertise, commercial leadership and transformation delivery to help clients scale AI capabilities, establish effective operating models and realize long-term value from AI investments. Alongside leading major client engagements, you&#39;ll play a key role in growing Capco&#39;s AI Strategy &amp;amp; Advisory capability, developing our people and expanding our market presence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead enterprise AI strategy engagements, defining transformation roadmaps, operating models, governance frameworks and investment priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise senior executives on AI adoption, business transformation, Responsible AI and value realization across complex Financial Services organizations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead large-scale AI transformation programmes while building trusted client relationships and delivering measurable commercial outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive business growth by shaping new client opportunities, developing propositions and contributing to AI thought leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach and develop consulting teams while strengthening Capco&#39;s AI Strategy &amp;amp; Advisory capability across the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive consulting or advisory experience delivering AI, digital or enterprise transformation within Financial Services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience advising C-suite stakeholders and leading complex strategic transformation programmes from strategy through implementation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong expertise in AI strategy, governance, operating models, business case development and value realization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commercially minded with experience developing client relationships, winning consulting engagements and leading multidisciplinary teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outstanding communication, facilitation and stakeholder management skills with the ability to simplify complex topics for executive audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Bonus Points For&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in Responsible AI, AI Governance, AI Operating Models or AI Value Realisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience helping organisations scale Generative AI or Agentic AI capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thought leadership, proposition development or capability-building experience within a consulting environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of AI economics, cost optimisation and sustainable AI adoption strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience mentoring senior consultants and building high-performing consulting teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Why Join Capco&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver high-impact AI strategy and transformation programmes for leading global financial institutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work in a collaborative, flat and entrepreneurial consulting culture alongside industry experts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access continuous learning, professional development and industry-leading AI expertise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape the future of AI transformation while helping clients navigate one of the most significant technology shifts in Financial Services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Play a key role in growing one of the industry&#39;s leading Data &amp;amp; AI consulting practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Core Benefits: Discretionary bonus, competitive pension, health insurance, life insurance and critical illness cover.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mental Health: Easy access to CareFirst, Unmind, Aviva consultations and in-house first aiders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Family-Friendly: Maternity, adoption, shared parental leave, plus paid leave for sickness, pregnancy loss, fertility treatment, menopause and bereavement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Holiday Flexibility &amp;amp; Development: Five weeks&#39; annual leave with the option to buy or sell holiday, plus a minimum of 40 hours of annual learning and a Business Coach from day one.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Additional Perks: Online GP services, backup care for children or elder care, Gympass (Wellhub), travel insurance, Tastecard, Cycle to Work, season ticket loans and dental insurance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Inclusion at Capco&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
