Volta&nbsp;Medical is an innovative, data-inspired US and European-based growth MedTech aimed at creating and&nbsp;bringing to&nbsp;the market&nbsp;cutting-edge&nbsp;AI software products to revolutionize interventional cardiac electrophysiology.&nbsp;&nbsp;


Volta has created a data collection and enrichment ecosystem for curated EP lab&nbsp;data&nbsp;which is fed into a physician&nbsp;validated, machine learning&nbsp;methodology&nbsp;to support complex AF solutions. Our newest technology, Volta AF-Xplorer&nbsp;II, is a data-driven AI decision support system that easily integrates into the standard physician workflow, providing a patient-tailored approach to complex AF and AT procedures.&nbsp;&nbsp;


Our dynamic, innovative team is made up of 100+ collaborators in the EU and USA from a wide variety of backgrounds including engineers, business professionals and physicians, working together to develop AI solutions that help electrophysiologists help patients.

Mission 

As&nbsp;Lead Data Science,&nbsp;you&nbsp;will&nbsp;play&nbsp;a&nbsp;key&nbsp;role&nbsp;in&nbsp;shaping&nbsp;the future of&nbsp;Volta's&nbsp;AI&nbsp;technology. You&nbsp;will&nbsp;lead a&nbsp;multidisciplinary&nbsp;Data Science&nbsp;team&nbsp;and&nbsp;contribute&nbsp;directly&nbsp;to the&nbsp;development&nbsp;of innovative machine&nbsp;learning&nbsp;solutions&nbsp;embedded&nbsp;in&nbsp;medical&nbsp;devices&nbsp;used&nbsp;daily&nbsp;in&nbsp;electrophysiology&nbsp;labs&nbsp;worldwide.&nbsp;


Reporting to the VP Innovation, you will combine scientific&nbsp;expertise, technical&nbsp;leadership&nbsp;and people management to drive the development of next-generation AI algorithms while ensuring compliance with medical device quality and regulatory standards.

Your Responsibilities 

Technical Leadership&nbsp;




Define and drive the Data Science roadmap in&nbsp;alignment&nbsp;with&nbsp;product&nbsp;and business&nbsp;priorities.&nbsp;&nbsp;






Lead the design,&nbsp;development&nbsp;and validation of state-of-the-art Machine Learning and Deep Learning&nbsp;algorithms.&nbsp;&nbsp;






Ensure&nbsp;scientific&nbsp;excellence and&nbsp;promote&nbsp;best practices in AI&nbsp;research&nbsp;and&nbsp;development.&nbsp;&nbsp;






Stay up to date&nbsp;with&nbsp;the&nbsp;latest&nbsp;advances&nbsp;in AI and&nbsp;identify&nbsp;opportunities&nbsp;to&nbsp;integrate&nbsp;new technologies&nbsp;into&nbsp;Volta's&nbsp;products.&nbsp;&nbsp;






Support the&nbsp;definition&nbsp;of data&nbsp;strategies&nbsp;and&nbsp;contribute&nbsp;to the&nbsp;continuous&nbsp;improvement&nbsp;of data collection pipelines.&nbsp;&nbsp;






Team Leadership&nbsp;




Lead, mentor and&nbsp;grow&nbsp;a&nbsp;team&nbsp;of Data Scientists, Data&nbsp;Engineers&nbsp;and PhD&nbsp;researchers.&nbsp;&nbsp;






Foster a collaborative, innovative and high-performance culture.&nbsp;&nbsp;






Coach&nbsp;team&nbsp;members&nbsp;in&nbsp;both&nbsp;technical&nbsp;and&nbsp;professional&nbsp;development.&nbsp;&nbsp;






Coordinate&nbsp;priorities,&nbsp;allocate&nbsp;resources&nbsp;and&nbsp;ensure&nbsp;timely&nbsp;project&nbsp;delivery.&nbsp;&nbsp;




Product&nbsp;Development&nbsp;




Collaborate&nbsp;closely&nbsp;with&nbsp;Software Engineering,&nbsp;Clinical,&nbsp;Regulatory&nbsp;and Product&nbsp;teams&nbsp;throughout&nbsp;the&nbsp;product&nbsp;lifecycle.&nbsp;&nbsp;






Contribute&nbsp;to software architecture discussions&nbsp;involving&nbsp;AI components.&nbsp;&nbsp;






Ensure&nbsp;production-ready,&nbsp;maintainable&nbsp;and high-quality&nbsp;code.&nbsp;&nbsp;






Participate&nbsp;in the&nbsp;preparation&nbsp;of&nbsp;technical&nbsp;documentation&nbsp;required&nbsp;for&nbsp;regulatory&nbsp;submissions.&nbsp;&nbsp;




Scientific &amp;&nbsp;External&nbsp;Collaboration&nbsp;




Represent&nbsp;Volta&nbsp;Medical&nbsp;at&nbsp;scientific&nbsp;conferences&nbsp;and&nbsp;technical&nbsp;events.&nbsp;&nbsp;






Contribute&nbsp;to publications, patents and collaborations&nbsp;with&nbsp;academic&nbsp;partners.&nbsp;&nbsp;






Communicate&nbsp;AI&nbsp;strategy&nbsp;and&nbsp;technical&nbsp;achievements&nbsp;to&nbsp;executive&nbsp;leadership,&nbsp;partners&nbsp;and&nbsp;investors.&nbsp;



Your Profile


Education &amp;&nbsp;Experience&nbsp;




PhD in Computer Science,&nbsp;Artificial Intelligence, Applied Mathematics, Statistics,&nbsp;Physics&nbsp;or&nbsp;a&nbsp;related field.&nbsp;&nbsp;






10+&nbsp;years&nbsp;of&nbsp;experience&nbsp;developing&nbsp;Machine Learning solutions in an&nbsp;industrial&nbsp;R&amp;D&nbsp;environment.&nbsp;&nbsp;






5+&nbsp;years&nbsp;of&nbsp;experience&nbsp;leading&nbsp;technical&nbsp;teams&nbsp;or mentoring Data Scientists.&nbsp;&nbsp;








Experience&nbsp;working&nbsp;in&nbsp;regulated&nbsp;environments&nbsp;(Medical&nbsp;Devices, Healthcare, Automotive, Aerospace or&nbsp;similar)&nbsp;is&nbsp;a&nbsp;strong&nbsp;plus.&nbsp;&nbsp;






Experience&nbsp;bringing&nbsp;AI&nbsp;models&nbsp;from&nbsp;research&nbsp;to production.&nbsp;&nbsp;




Technical&nbsp;Skills&nbsp;




Strong expertise in Machine Learning, Deep Learning and&nbsp;statistical&nbsp;modeling.&nbsp;&nbsp;






Excellent&nbsp;understanding&nbsp;of model&nbsp;development,&nbsp;evaluation&nbsp;and&nbsp;deployment.&nbsp;&nbsp;






Strong&nbsp;programming&nbsp;skills&nbsp;in Python.&nbsp;&nbsp;






Experience&nbsp;with&nbsp;PyTorch,&nbsp;Scikit-learn,&nbsp;NumPy, Pandas and&nbsp;related&nbsp;ML&nbsp;libraries.&nbsp;&nbsp;






Familiarity&nbsp;with&nbsp;software engineering best practices (Git,&nbsp;testing, CI/CD, Docker).&nbsp;&nbsp;






Good&nbsp;knowledge&nbsp;of Linux&nbsp;environments.&nbsp;&nbsp;






Experience&nbsp;with&nbsp;cloud&nbsp;computing&nbsp;and&nbsp;MLOps&nbsp;is&nbsp;a plus.&nbsp;&nbsp;






Signal&nbsp;processing&nbsp;knowledge&nbsp;would&nbsp;be&nbsp;highly&nbsp;appreciated.&nbsp;&nbsp;




Soft&nbsp;Skills&nbsp;




Strong leadership and coaching&nbsp;abilities.&nbsp;&nbsp;






Excellent communication&nbsp;and&nbsp;presentation&nbsp;skills.&nbsp;&nbsp;






Strong&nbsp;analytical&nbsp;and&nbsp;problem-solving&nbsp;capabilities.&nbsp;&nbsp;






Ability&nbsp;to&nbsp;work&nbsp;effectively&nbsp;in a&nbsp;multidisciplinary&nbsp;and international&nbsp;environment.&nbsp;&nbsp;






Fluent English (spoken&nbsp;and&nbsp;written).&nbsp;




Why join Volta Medical? 
Artificial Intelligence is transforming healthcare, and Volta Medical is at the forefront of this revolution.&nbsp;



Joining&nbsp;us&nbsp;means&nbsp;contributing&nbsp;to&nbsp;cutting-edge&nbsp;medical&nbsp;technologies&nbsp;that&nbsp;directly&nbsp;improve&nbsp;patients'&nbsp;lives&nbsp;while&nbsp;working&nbsp;alongside&nbsp;internationally&nbsp;recognized&nbsp;experts in&nbsp;electrophysiology, AI and&nbsp;medical&nbsp;devices.&nbsp;


At Volta,&nbsp;you&nbsp;will&nbsp;enjoy:&nbsp;




