&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Burson, part of WPP, is the global communications leader built to create value for clients through reputation. With highly specialized teams, industry-leading technologies and breakthrough creative, we help brands and businesses redefine reputation as a competitive advantage so they can lead today and into the future. When you work at Burson, you are part of a global community of lifelong learners who thrive at the edge of innovation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP (LSE/NYSE: WPP) is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. We unite cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, world-class creativity, next-generation production, transformative enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel in a single company – powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform, WPP Open, to help our clients navigate change, capture opportunity and deliver transformational growth. For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;WPP.com&quot;&gt;WPP.com&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bursonglobal.com/&quot;&gt;bursonglobal.com&lt;/a&gt; and follow us on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/burson/posts/?feedView=all&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt; and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/burson.global/?hl=en&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;More about the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an ambitious, commercially minded &lt;strong&gt;Senior Marketing Manager&lt;/strong&gt; to help Burson drive visibility, relevance and connection to the clients and prospects we most want to work with.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sitting at the heart of the UK Growth Team, this is a high-profile role working closely with the Chief Growth Officer and senior leaders across the business. You will help further Burson’s momentum in the UK having been named Cannes Lions Agency of the year 2026, turning our best thinking, expertise, people and client work into marketing that builds our reputation, creates demand and opens doors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be responsible for growing Burson&#39;s reputation and visibility in the market, strengthening engagement with priority audiences and building marketing programmes that support our growth ambitions across all areas of our business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for someone with ideas, energy and excellent judgement. Someone who understands what makes senior decision-makers pay attention, knows how to turn complex expertise into compelling stories and can mobilise a busy organisation behind a great idea.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and deliver a focused UK marketing strategy that builds brand awareness, distinctiveness and demand, aligned with business and growth priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strengthen Burson’s profile among&amp;nbsp;priority clients, prospects, industry influencers, business leaders and future talent, positioning us as a modern strategic advisory partner.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a distinctive&amp;nbsp;thought leadership and editorial programme, turning our expertise, insights, data and senior counsel into timely and compelling content across multiple channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify key moments across the&amp;nbsp;business, media and cultural agenda where Burson can lead the conversation, mobilising experts and building the external profiles of senior leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create an engaging events and experiences programme, including briefings, roundtables, webinars and partnerships that deepen relationships with clients and prospects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Showcase Burson’s best work through case studies, credentials, awards and external storytelling, increasing visibility and recognition for our people, expertise and client impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a modern, high-performing marketing engine, using AI, automation, media intelligence, data and measurement to make marketing faster, smarter and more effective.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with UK leadership, Growth, practices, capabilities and the EMEA Marketing Team to maximise commercial impact, amplify regional and global programmes, and share the best of Burson UK across the wider network.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience that contributes to success:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for an ambitious marketer who combines the instincts of a&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;marketer, editor and connector, and who likes making things happen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll bring:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong track record in B2B or professional-services marketing, ideally within strategic communications, consulting, creative, technology or another expertise-led business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evidence that you have helped build a brand, audience or market position, rather than simply managed marketing activity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing and delivering high-impact thought leadership, content and integrated marketing programmes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent editorial judgement. You know what makes an interesting point of view, what will engage an external audience and what won&#39;t.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outstanding writing and storytelling skills, with an ability to turn complex ideas into clear, engaging narratives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commercial instinct and an understanding of the relationship between reputation, relationships, marketing and new business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidence working with senior leaders, including the ability to advise, influence and challenge constructively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong understanding of AI-enabled marketing, together with curiosity about how emerging technology can improve insight, creativity, personalisation, productivity and measurement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of the communications, marketing and wider business landscape, with a natural curiosity about what&#39;s happening in the world.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proactive approach to building external relationships with industry influencers, partners, media stakeholders and senior decision-makers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A bias for action. You spot opportunities, bring ideas and make them happen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High standards and exceptional attention to detail, without allowing perfection to get in the way of momentum.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative mindset and the ability to bring people together across Growth, practices, capabilities, creative teams and regional marketing colleagues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What success looks like&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will help create a Burson UK that feels&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;impossible to ignore: sharper in the market, faster into important conversations and better at turning our expertise into reputation, relationships and growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Success will mean:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;greater visibility and distinctiveness for Burson amongst priority audiences;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;stronger engagement with the clients and prospects we most want to reach;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;a recognisable and consistent flow of distinctive Burson attitude, thinking and expertise into the market;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;greater visibility for our senior experts and our best client work;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;marketing programmes, content and experiences that create meaningful conversations and support growth; and&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;a faster, smarter and more measurable marketing operation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an opportunity to help shape not simply how Burson markets itself in the UK, but how the market sees Burson and what we are capable of.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;#LI-CY1&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You belong at Burson:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our vision is for Burson to be the leading ‘academy company’ for creative communications professionals and emerging leaders. We provide a dynamic environment where ambitious colleagues come to elevate their skills, expand their networks, and ultimately, produce the best solutions for today’s leading brands. Our commitment to your growth is reflected in our robust benefits and people programs, which include professional development opportunities, mentorship programs with industry leaders, a vibrant and inclusive company culture fostering collaboration and innovation and packages designed to reward and retain top talent. We invest in our people because we believe their success is our success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Burson, we’re an agency of learn-it-alls. We recognize that the things we do best, creativity and communications, require a level of nuanced understanding. That’s why it’s imperative for us to hire extraordinarily talented people of all backgrounds and identities. Without that we can’t do the essential work of inspiring bold ideas, fostering constructive dialogue, cultivating meaningful experiences, and driving innovation and creativity for our partners. Your unique point of view—your talent—is what makes you a #BursonPerson, and it’s how we deliver exceptional results for our clients, together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When you click the &quot;Submit Application&quot; button below, this will send any information you add below to Burson. Before you do this, we think it&#39;s a good idea to read through our &amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bursonglobal.com/p/recruitment-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy. &lt;/a&gt;California residents should read our  &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bursonglobal.com/p/california-recruitment-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;California Recruitment Privacy Notice. &lt;/a&gt;This explains what we do with your personal data when you apply for a role with us, and, how you can update the information you have provided us with or how to remove it.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;Rubrik’s Sales organisation is a united group of elite cross-functional sales professionals that help companies &amp;amp; government entities achieve resilience against cyberattacks, malicious insiders, and operational disruptions. We offer continuous professional growth and opportunity through our world-class sales enablement program. Our One Rubrik selling approach provides all the resources you need to exceed your goals, maximize your earnings potential, and take your career to the next level. All this while doing something truly purposeful, protecting the world&#39;s data.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Large Enterprise Account Executive&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Large Enterprise Account Executive, you will have ownership of all elements of bookings growth in new and existing accounts across the UK region. We are seeking a relentless self-starter who is hyper-focused on acquiring new logos by discovering and developing new opportunities, managing pipeline, and executing account strategies, while also encouraging existing customer expansion. The AE must drive pipeline generation daily while working with Sales Engineers, Sales Development, Channel Development, and Rubrik Channel Partners to exceed sales quotas.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and execute sales plans for the assigned territory to meet and exceed quota through prospecting, qualifying, managing, and closing sales opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and manage sales pipeline to move a large number of strategic transactions through the sales process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and close new opportunities for growth working with a mix of Enterprise/Strat accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present Rubrik, Inc. solutions within complex data centre design environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Co-sell and strategise with partners, distributors, and VAR’s to enable rapid growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide Rubrik, Inc. management with feedback about the local market opportunity and identification of new business opportunities and channel partnerships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Experience You’ll Need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years Tech sales experience (selling either IT Infrastructure, Security or SaaS)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consistent track record landing net &quot;new logos&quot;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong track record of performance with consistent overachievement of quotas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding and experience working with channel&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly driven, goal oriented &quot;get it done&quot; attitude.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling a complex solution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Join Us in Securing and Accelerating the World&#39;s AI Transformation&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rubrik (NYSE: RBRK) is the Security and AI Operations Company, delivering one platform built at the intersection of data, identity, and AI. The platform enables agentic cyber resilience and trusted AI operations for enterprises worldwide, built to recover before disruption strikes and stay a step ahead, so security is never the reason ambition stalls.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/rubrik-inc/mycompany/verification/&quot;&gt;Linkedin&lt;/a&gt; | &lt;a href=&quot;https://twitter.com/rubrikinc&quot;&gt;X (formerly Twitter)&lt;/a&gt; | &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/rubrikinc/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt; |&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.rubrik.com&quot;&gt;Rubrik.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Inclusion @ Rubrik&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Rubrik, we are dedicated to fostering a culture where people from all backgrounds are valued, feel they belong, and believe they can succeed. Our commitment to inclusion is at the heart of our mission to secure the world’s data.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our goal is to hire and promote the best talent, regardless of background. We continually review our hiring practices to ensure fairness and strive to create an environment where every employee has equal access to opportunities for growth and excellence. We believe in empowering everyone to bring their authentic selves to work and achieve their fullest potential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Our inclusion strategy focuses on three core areas of our business and culture:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;Our Company: We are committed to building a merit-based organization that offers equal access to growth and success for all employees globally. Your potential is limitless here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Culture: We strive to create an inclusive atmosphere where individuals from all backgrounds feel a strong sense of belonging, can thrive, and do their best work. Your contributions help us innovate and break boundaries.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;Our Communities: We are dedicated to expanding our engagement with the communities we operate in, creating opportunities for underrepresented talent and driving greater innovation for our clients. Your impact extends beyond Rubrik, contributing to safer and stronger communities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Equal Opportunity Employer/Veterans/Disabled&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rubrik is an Equal Opportunity Employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, age, disability, genetic information, protected veteran status, or any other status protected by applicable law. Rubrik provides equal employment opportunities to employees and applicants in all terms and conditions of employment, including recruiting, hiring, promotion, compensation, training, leave, and termination.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rubrik provides reasonable accommodations to qualified applicants and employees with disabilities in accordance with applicable law. If you need an accommodation to participate in the application process or to perform your job, please contact&amp;nbsp;&lt;a ----- ----- Accommodations may include changes to the application process, documents in an alternate format, a sign language interpreter, or specialized equipment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/sites/default/files/2023-06/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights6.12ScreenRdr.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;EEO IS THE LAW&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/olms/regs/compliance/eo_posters/employeerightsposter2page_19final.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;NOTIFICATION OF EMPLOYEE RIGHTS UNDER FEDERAL LABOR LAWS&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;LTK’s mission is to empower the world’s premium lifestyle Creators to achieve maximum economic success. We have a huge opportunity ahead of us and we’re looking for team members who want to create, innovate and disrupt an industry.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We empower our team members to drive innovation, create value, and continue to spearhead the creation of this industry — a game changer when it comes to career growth.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Director, Brand Partnerships (UK)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; London, UK&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reports to:&lt;/strong&gt; VP, Brand Partnerships (EU)&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Type:&lt;/strong&gt; Full Time&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Director, Brand Partnerships&lt;/strong&gt; to join our growing EU Brand Partnerships team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a senior commercial role responsible for driving enterprise growth across the UK through the acquisition, growth and strategic development of LTK&#39;s most valuable brand partnerships. You&#39;ll own the development of high-value relationships with leading fashion, beauty, lifestyle and luxury brands, positioning LTK as a trusted, long-term creator commerce partner.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As one of the UK&#39;s most senior commercial leaders, you&#39;ll lead consultative sales conversations with executive stakeholders, identifying opportunities to solve complex marketing challenges through LTK&#39;s full-funnel creator marketing solutions. You&#39;ll be responsible for building new enterprise relationships while strategically growing a portfolio of LTK Europe’s highest-potential and highest-value brand partners. Through a consultative approach, you&#39;ll develop a healthy pipeline of opportunities, convert new business and expand long-term investment across your accounts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working closely with Brand Activation, Creator Success, Campaign Operations and Marketing, you&#39;ll own the long-term growth of strategic brand partners, taking over once brands have successfully onboarded and transitioned through their initial activation phase to maximise retention, investment and lifetime value.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is ideal for an experienced enterprise seller who thrives on opening new opportunities, influencing senior decision-makers and building meaningful commercial partnerships across every level of a brand&#39;s marketing organisation—from executive leadership through to day-to-day marketing teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Own&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enterprise Sales &amp;amp; Market Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute the UK enterprise &amp;amp; mid market business strategy across fashion, beauty, lifestyle and luxury sectors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain a healthy pipeline of high-value opportunities through strategic prospecting, networking and industry engagement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop relationships across senior marketing organisations, including CMOs, Marketing Directors, Digital, Social, Affiliate and Ecommerce leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead complex consultative sales cycles from discovery through negotiation and contract execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Position LTK as a strategic creator commerce partner by delivering insight-led, value-based sales conversations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consistently exceed ambitious Managed Services and Advertising revenue targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Account Growth&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and grow a portfolio of strategic brand partners, identifying opportunities to increase investment across LTK&#39;s commercial solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop long-term account strategies that deepen relationships and expand LTK&#39;s footprint across multiple business units.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities across creator collaborations, paid media, content, licensing, events and emerging commercial products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build trusted executive relationships that position LTK as a long-term strategic marketing partner.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver executive business reviews, strategic recommendations and commercial proposals that support long-term partnership growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with clients to solve evolving marketing challenges through innovative creator-led solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Brand Activation to ensure a seamless transition of newly activated brands into long-term commercial management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Marketing, Creator Success, Campaign Operations, Product and Operations to deliver an exceptional partner experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share market intelligence and customer feedback to influence product development, commercial strategy and go-to-market initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the development of sales playbooks, enterprise outreach strategies and consultative selling best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify emerging categories, market trends and whitespace opportunities to expand LTK&#39;s enterprise footprint across the UK.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent LTK across the UK marketing industry by building executive-level relationships, speaking at key industry events and strengthening LTK&#39;s position as the leading creator commerce platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a senior commercial leader within the UK Brand Partnerships team, shaping commercial strategy, coach consultative selling and foster a culture of high performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sales Excellence&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consistently exceed individual sales quotas while contributing to wider UK Business Partnerships objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use performance data and commercial insights to continuously optimise sales strategy and pipeline health.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain accurate pipeline management, forecasting and reporting through HubSpot and internal systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build compelling, insight-led presentations and business cases tailored to executive audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay ahead of consumer trends, retail innovation and the evolving creator economy to identify new commercial opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years&#39; experience in enterprise sales, strategic partnerships or business development within digital marketing, media, SaaS or influencer marketing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of consistently exceeding commercial targets through enterprise new business acquisition and strategic account growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A consultative relationship builder who earns trust quickly and is comfortable influencing senior stakeholders through insight rather than transactional selling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading complex consultative sales cycles involving multiple stakeholders and executive decision-makers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional commercial acumen with the ability to translate market trends into compelling business opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outstanding presentation, negotiation and executive communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of influencer marketing, affiliate marketing, social commerce and the evolving creator economy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable influencing cross-functional teams and collaborating across multiple business functions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Existing senior relationships across fashion, beauty, luxury and lifestyle brands.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly strategic while remaining hands-on and execution focused.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive, entrepreneurial and driven to build new commercial opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent English language skills; additional European languages are a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A mindset focused on seizing opportunities and moving with urgency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dedication to fierce prioritization and operational excellence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adaptability to a dynamic, fast-moving environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A growth mindset and openness to feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; color: #ffffff;&quot;&gt;#LI-AJ1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What’s in it for you?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Competitive salary, bonuses, and private pension scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Flexible work schedule plus Summer Fridays (workday ends at 3 pm)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;25 days holiday, plus an extra day for your birthday&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A benefits and wellness scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Private medical care&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Paid volunteering days&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Professional development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Work anniversary celebrations, including extra annual holidays, and luxury gifting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Interesting problems to solve with an expert team at a rapid-growth retail disruptor and the largest creator marketing platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Happy Hours and team events and activities!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About LTK&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Founded in 2011, LTK is the global technology platform purpose-built to empower lifestyle creators to monetize their content. The full-service platform connects brands, creators, and shoppers with a world-class shopping app and trusted tools and technology that make content instantly shoppable. Today, premium lifestyle creators in 150+ countries drive more than $3.6 billion in annual retail sales through their LTK Shop profiles. More than 20 million consumers turn to LTK Shops in the LTK shopping platform each month to find inspiration and instantly shop the styles recommended by their favorite creators. And, more than 6,000 brands partner with LTK to gain access to its global creator network for content that converts against performance-driven, cross-channel KPIs. LTK is headquartered in Dallas, TX, and currently operates on five continents.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;To empower the world’s premium lifestyle Creators to achieve maximum economic success.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our values&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Here to win&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Commit to the journey&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Work well&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commitment to Diversity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;LTK believes diversity, equity, and inclusion are fundamental obligations that strengthen our team. We employ a diverse, multi-disciplinary team to build a meaningful company and culture.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;We are not offering new sponsorships opportunities at this time for persons requiring employment visas;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;authorization to work in the UK is a precondition of employment.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Any unsolicited resumes/candidate profiles submitted through our website or to personal email accounts of employees of LTK are considered the property of LTK and are not subject to payment of agency fees&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
